hadiths[553]{hadithnumber,text}:
"601","Aur Ibn al-Tabba', Nu'aym aur Ibrahim ibn Hamzah ne kaha: Yahya se, jaisa Mahmud ne kaha."
"602","Aur al-Nufayli ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sulaym se, Ismail se, Said se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se."
"603","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamen khabar di, al-A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne kutte aur billi ki qeemat se mana farmaya."
"604","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Mas'ud Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, badkar aurat ki ujrat aur kahin ki ujrat se mana farmaya."
"605","Abu Said al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ulayyah se, Ali ibn al-Hakam se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne sanr ke asib ki qeemat se mana farmaya."
"606","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Haram ibn Muhayyisah se, un ke walid se, ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hijama karne wale ki kamai ke bare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne unhen us se mana farmaya, phir unhon ne apni hajat ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne farmaya: Use apne pani lane wale unt ko khilao aur apne ghulamon ko khilao."
"607","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn aur Hisham dono ne hamen khabar di, Ibn Sirin se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hijama karwaya aur hijama karne wale ko us ki ujrat di."
"608","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Umar ibn Abi Salamah se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne rishwat dene wale aur rishwat lene wale par la'nat farmayi."
"609","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Harith ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Salamah se, Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne rishwat dene wale aur rishwat lene wale par la'nat farmayi."
"610","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, Muhammad ibn Juhadah se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne laundiyon ki kamai se mana farmaya."
"611","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu al-Mutawakkil ko Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba me se kuch log Arab ke qabilon me se ek qabile ke pas utre to unhon ne un ki qira nahi ki aur un ki ziyafat nahi ki, unhon ne kaha: Phir un ke sardar ko taklif pahunchi, to woh hamare pas aaye aur kahne lage: Kya tumhare pas koi dawa hai? To hum ne kaha: Han, lekin tum ne hamari qira nahi ki aur hamari ziyafat nahi ki, is liye hum us waqt tak nahi karenge jab tak tum hamare liye ujrat muqarrar na kar do, to unhon ne us par un ke liye bakriyon ka ek rewad muqarrar kar diya, phir hum me se ek shakhs us par Surah al-Fatiha padhne laga, phir jab woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aaye to hum ne Aap se us ka zikr kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen kya malum ke woh dam hai? Aur unhon ne Aap ki taraf se koi mumaniat zikr nahi ki. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Khao aur us ujrat me apne sath mera bhi hissa lagao."
"612","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, Muharib ibn Dithar se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se ek unt kharida, phir mere liye us ki qeemat toli aur mujhe zyada di."
"613","(65) Gharar aur us ke ilawa mana ki gayi be'on ka bab: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Uqbah - ya'ni Ibn Khalid - ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaydullah - ya'ni Ibn Umar - ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne gharar ki be' se aur hasah (kankari wali) ki be' se mana farmaya."
"614","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ishaq ibn Isa al-Tabba' ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne habal al-habalah ki be' se mana farmaya."
"615","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne do be'on se aur do libason se mana farmaya, to rahi do be'en to mulamasah aur munabadhah hain, aur rahe do libas to ishtimal al-samma' aur ek hi kapde me ehtiba karna jabke us ki sharmgah par us me se kuch na ho."
"616","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Rawh ibn Ubadah ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Sayyar se, al-Sha'bi se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: kankari phenk kar be' na karo, aur najsh na karo, aur mulamasah ke zariye be' na karo, aur tum me se jo muhaffalah (thanon me doodh rok kar rakha hua janwar) khareede phir use napasand kare to use wapas kar de, aur us ke sath ek sa' khana (ghalla) bhi wapas kare."
"617","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Amr se, unhon ne Abu al-Minhal ko kehte hue suna: main ne Iyas ibn Abd al-Muzani ko kehte hue suna: pani mat becho, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko pani ki be' se mana farmate hue suna, main nahin janta woh kaun sa pani hai, aur Sufyan ne ek dusri martaba kaha: unhen Abu al-Minhal ne khabar di."
"618","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Waki' ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne fazil (zaid) pani ki be' se mana farmaya."
"619","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: fazil pani ko is liye na roka jaye ke us ke zariye ghaas (kala) ko roka jaye, Sufyan ne kaha: aur teen cheezen hain jinhen nahin roka jata: pani, ghaas aur aag."
"620","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne bayan kiya, Humayd al-A'raj se, Sulayman ibn Atiq se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne salon tak phal ki be' se mana farmaya."
"621","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu al-Nu'man aur Musaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu al-Zubayr aur Sa'id ibn Mina se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne muhaqalah aur muzabanah aur mukhabarah aur mu'awamah se mana farmaya, aur dusre ne kaha: salon ki be' (se), aur thunya (istisna) se (mana farmaya), aur arayah me rukhsat di."
"622","Hasan ibn Arafah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hushaym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yunus ibn Ubayd ne khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: maal-dar ka tal-matol karna zulm hai, aur jab tumhen kisi maal-dar par hawalah diya jaye to us ke peeche jao, aur ek (saude) me do be'en na becho."
"623","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, Muhammad se, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: ke Aap ne ek be' me do be'on se mana farmaya."
"624","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya ke Isma'il ibn Ulayyah ne unhen khabar di, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Amr ibn Shu'ayb ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, yahan tak ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma ka zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: qarz aur be' (ka ikattha hona) halal nahin, aur na be' me do sharten, aur na us cheez ka nafa' jis ki zamin na li gayi ho, aur na us cheez ki be' jo tumhare paas na ho."
"625","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Fadalah al-Tufawi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ya'la - woh Ibn Hakim hain - se, unhon ne kaha: Yusuf ibn Mahak ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn Ismah se, Hakim ibn Hizam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ek aisa aadmi hun jo khareed o farokht ke liye khareedta hai, to un me se kya halal hai aur kya haram hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae mere bhai ke bete, jab tum koi sauda khareedo to use us waqt tak na becho jab tak tum us par qabza na kar lo."
"626","Aur isi tarah Shayban aur Hammam ne kaha, Yahya se, Ya'la se, Yusuf se, Abdullah ibn Ismah se, Hakim se. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se ise bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, Shayban se."
"627","Aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya."
"628","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne phal ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ka pakna zahir ho jaye."
"629","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khajoor ke darakhton ka bechna durust nahin hai yahan tak ke us ka pakna zahir ho jaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka pakna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh surkh aur zard ho jayen."
"630","Ali ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il - yani Ibn Ulayyah - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke darakhton ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh zahw ho jayen, aur baliyon ko yahan tak ke woh safed ho jayen aur aafat se mehfooz ho jayen, Aap ne bechne wale aur khareedne wale dono ko mana farmaya."
"631","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Woh cheez jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya woh khana hai ke use becha jaye yahan tak ke us par qabza kar liya jaye. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur main har cheez ko isi ke misl hi samajhta hun."
"632","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Hum sawaaron se khana andaze se (juzafan) khareeda karte the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein mana farmaya ke hum use bechen yahan tak ke hum use us ki jagah se naqal kar len."
"633","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke dher ko, jis ka naap ma'lum na ho, muqarrar naap ki khajoor ke badle bechne se mana farmaya."
"634","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par bechne se mana farmaya."
"635","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shihab - yani Ibn Abbad - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud - yani al-Attar - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par becha jaye."
"636","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par bechne se mana farmaya."
"637","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Safiyyah Dihyah al-Kalbi ke hisse me aayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen saat saron ke badle khareed liya."
"638","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek ghulam ko do siyah ghulamon ke badle khareeda."
"639","(67) Salam ke bare me bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Najih se, Abdullah ibn Kathir se, Abu al-Minhal se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Madinah tashreef laye jabke woh phalon me do aur teen saal ke liye salaf karte thay, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Phalon me maloom paimane me maloom muddat tak salaf karo."
"640","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Najih se, Abdullah ibn Kathir se, Abu al-Minhal se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Madinah tashreef laye jabke woh phalon me do aur teen saal ke liye salaf karte thay, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Phalon me maloom paimane aur maloom wazan me salaf karo."
"641","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi al-Mujalid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Shaddad aur Abu Burdah ka salam ke bare me ikhtilaf hua, to unhon ne mujhe Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ke paas bheja to maine un se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me aur Abu Bakr aur Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke zamane me gehun, jau, kishmish aur khajoor me un logon se salaf karte thay jin ke paas woh maujood na hota tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir maine Ibn Abza se pucha, to unhon ne bhi isi tarah kaha."
"642","(67) Buyu me qaza ke abwab: Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Dono bechne walon ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na hon, ya unki be khiyar par ho."
"643","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hamen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di ke Nafi' ne un se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi aapas me be karen to un me se har ek ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na hon aur ikatthe hon, ya un me se ek dusre ko ikhtiyar de, phir unhon ne isi par be kar li to be lazim ho gayi, aur agar be ke baad woh juda ho gaye aur un me se kisi ne be ko tark na kiya to be lazim ho gayi."
"644","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jamil ibn Murrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Wadi se, unhon ne kaha: Hum apne ek ghazwe me nikle aur ek manzil me utre, to hamare ek saathi ne ek aadmi ke haath ek ghoda ek ghulam ke badle becha, aur woh dono apne baqi din aur apni raat thehre rahe yahan tak ke subah ho gayi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab kooch ka waqt aaya to woh aadmi apne ghode ke paas use zeen pehnane ke liye khada hua aur nadim hua, to (dusre) aadmi ne use be ka paband tehraya, to woh dono Abu Barzah Raziallahu anhu ke paas aaye aur unhen apna qissa sunaya, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum raazi ho ke main tumhare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke faisle se faisla karun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Dono bechne walon ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na hon."
"645","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad yani Ibn Mas'adah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unke walid se, unke dada se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Bechne wala aur khareedne wala ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na hon, magar ye ke khiyar ki shart wali be ho, aur uske liye jayez nahin ke is khauf se juda ho ke (dusra) us se faskh ka mutalba karega."
"646","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-Aqadi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo musarrat khareede use teen din tak ikhtiyar hai, phir agar use wapas kare to uske saath ek sa khana wapas kare, samra nahin. Abu Amir ne kaha: Yani gehun nahin."
"647","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis aurat ko do wali nikah me den woh pehle ki hai, aur jis aadmi ne do aadmiyon se be ki to be pehle ki hai."
"648","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do wakeel bechen to be pehle ki hai, aur jab do wali nikah karen to nikah pehle ka hai."
"649","Abu Zur'ah Al-Razi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Qays Al-Masir se, Al-Qasim ibn Abd Al-Rahman se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ne Al-Ash'ath ibn Qays ko imarat ke qaidiyon me se kuch qaidi bees hazaar me farokht kiye, to woh un ke paas das hazaar le kar aaye, to unhon ne kaha: main ne tumhen bees hazaar me becha tha, unhon ne kaha: main ne to inhen das hazaar me liya tha, unhon ne kaha: to main is bare me tumhari raay par raazi hun, to Ibn Mas'ud ne kaha: agar tum chaho to main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hadees bayan karun to karun, unhon ne kaha: ji han, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do kharid o farokht karne wale aisa soda karen jis ke darmiyan koi gawah na hon to qaul wohi hoga jo bae' (bechne wala) kahe, ya dono soda wapas lauta den. Al-Ash'ath ne kaha: to main ne tum par wapas lauta diya."
"650","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Umays se, unhon ne kaha: Abd Al-Rahman ibn Qays ibn Muhammad ibn Al-Ash'ath ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'ath ne khums ke ghulamon me se kuch ghulam Abdullah se bees hazaar me khareede, to Abdullah ne un ki qeemat ke bare me un ki taraf paigham bheja, to unhon ne kaha: main ne to inhen das hazaar me liya tha, to Abdullah ne kaha: koi aisa shakhs muntakhab karo jo mere aur tumhare darmiyan ho, Al-Ash'ath ne kaha: tum mere aur mere nafs ke darmiyan ho, Abdullah ne kaha: to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab do bechne wale ikhtilaf karen aur un ke darmiyan koi daleel na ho, to wohi hoga jo saman ke malik ka qaul hoga, ya dono tark kar den."
"651","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Shafi'i se, unhon ne kaha: Muslim ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, un ke walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: ke ek shakhs ne ek ghulam khareeda to us se faida uthaya, phir us me se ek aib zahir hua, to us ne is ke bare me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se mukhadamat ki to Aap ne us ke wapas karne ka faisla farmaya, to bechne wale ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ne to us ka kharaj (paidawar) le liya hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kharaj zaman ke sath hai."
"652","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya Al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad ibn Khufaf ne mujh se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Kharaj zaman ke sath hai."
"653","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisi khajuren beche jin ki pevandkari (ubar) ho chuki ho to us ka phal usi ka hoga jis ne becha, magar ye ke khareedar shart laga le."
"654","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisa ghulam beche jis ka maal ho, to us ka maal usi ka hoga jis ne becha, magar ye ke khareedar shart laga le."
"655","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hamen khabar di, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Umar ibn Abd Al-Aziz ko bayan karte hue suna, ke unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Abd Al-Rahman ibn Al-Harith ibn Hisham ko bayan karte hue suna, ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs logon ke maal samait muflis ho jaye, phir koi shakhs apna saman ba-'aynihi pa le to woh ghairon se zyada us ka haqdar hai."
"656","Muhammad ibn Awf Al-Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abd Al-Jabbar Al-Khabayiri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - yani Ibn Ayyash - ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Uqbah se, Al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd Al-Rahman se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs bhi koi saman beche, phir apne saman ko ba-'aynihi kisi muflis shakhs ke paas pa le, aur us ne us ki qeemat me se kuch wasool na kiya ho - to woh usi ka hai, aur agar us ne us ki qeemat me se kuch ada kar diya ho to jo baqi reh gaya us me woh qarz khwahon ke barabar hai."
"657","Ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abd Al-Jabbar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - yani Ibn Ayyash - ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zubaidi se, Al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd Al-Rahman se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi tarah bilkul misl, aur izafa kiya: Aur jo shakhs bhi halak ho jaye aur us ke paas kisi shakhs ka maal ba-'aynihi ho, us ne us me se kuch taqaza karke wasool kiya ho ya na kiya ho, to woh qarz khwahon ke barabar hai."
"658","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd Al-Rahman se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se iflas ke bare me. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Malik aur Salih ibn Kaysan aur Yunus ne ise Al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr se mutlaqan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya aur woh hadees ke zyada haqdar hain, yani: Al-Zuhri ke tariq se."
"659","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Al-Hakam ne hamen khabar di ke Ibn Abi Fudayk ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: aur Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Al-Mu'tamir ibn Amr ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Khaldah Al-Zuraqi se, aur woh Madinah ke qazi the, unhon ne kaha: hum apne ek sathi ke bare me jo muflis ho gaya tha Abu Hurairah ke paas aaye, to unhon ne kaha: yehi woh hai jis me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya: Jo shakhs bhi mar jaye ya muflis ho jaye, to saman ka malik apne saman ka zyada haqdar hai jab use ba-'aynihi pa le."
"660","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad Al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ibn Al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Sha'bi se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek oont becha, aur apne ghar walon tak us ki sawari ki shart lagai."
"661","Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apna oont mujhe bech do, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin, balke woh aap ka hai, Aap ne farmaya: Use mujhe bech do, main ne kaha: Pas falan shakhs ke zimme mere upar sone ki ek ooqiya hai to woh us ke badle aap ka hai, to Aap ne use le liya phir farmaya: Us par sawar ho kar apne ghar walon tak pahunch jao, pas jab main pahuncha to Aap ne Bilal ko hukm diya ke mujhe ata karein, aur baqi hadees zikr ki."
"662","Hamzah ibn Malik ibn Hamzah al-Aslami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan - ya'ni Ibn Hamzah, un ke chacha - ne mujh se bayan kiya, Kathir - ya'ni Ibn Zaid - se, Walid ibn Rabah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman apni sharton par qayam hain jab tak un mein se haq ke muwafiq hon."
"663","Hamzah ibn Malik ibn Hamzah al-Aslami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan - ya'ni Ibn Hamzah - ne mujh se bayan kiya, Kathir se, Walid ibn Rabah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke darmiyan sulah jayez hai."
"664","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne mujhe bataya, ke Abu Zubair al-Makki ne unhein khabar di, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum apne bhai ko khajoor becho phir use aafat pahunch jaye to tumhare liye halal nahin ke tum us se kuch lo, tum apne bhai ka maal baghair haq ke kis cheez ke badle loge?"
"665","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid ibn Qais se, Sulaiman ibn Atiq se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jawaih ko saqit farma diya."
"666","(68) Shuf'a ke bare mein jo aaya hai us ka bab: Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo koi zameen ya khajoor ke darakht ka malik ho to woh use na beche hatta ke use apne shareek par pesh kare."
"667","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah - ya'ni Ibn Idris - ne humein bataya, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne har ghair taqseem shuda shirkat mein shuf'a ka faisla farmaya, zameen ho ya bagh, us ke liye halal nahin ke woh beche hatta ke apne shareek ko ittila de, pas agar chahe to le le aur agar chahe to chhor de, pas agar us ne becha aur use ittila na di to woh us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"668","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne shuf'a sirf har us cheez mein rakha hai jo taqseem nahin hui, pas jab hudood waqe ho jayen aur raste pher diye jayen to shuf'a nahin hai."
"669","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abul Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: Padosi apne padosi ke ghar ya zameen ka zyada haqdar hai."
"670","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Ya'la ibn Ka'b al-Thaqafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr ibn al-Sharid ko Sharid se hadees bayan karte hue suna. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abdur Rahman se, Amr ibn al-Sharid se, un ke walid se - aur yeh Abu Asim ki hadees hai - unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne saqab ka zyada haqdar hai. Abu Nu'aim ne izafa kiya: Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr se kaha: Us ka saqab kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Shuf'a. Main ne kaha: Log gumaan karte hain ke woh pados hai? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak log yeh kehte hain."
"671","(69) Riba ke bare mein jo aaya hai us ka bab: Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne sood khane wale aur khilane wale aur us ke dono gawahon aur us ke likhne wale par la'nat farmai, aur farmaya: Woh barabar hain."
"672","Hamen Ahmad ibn Yusuf as-Sulami aur Abu Dawud Sulayman ibn Mabad ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: hamen an-Nadr, woh Ibn Muhammad hain, ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ikrimah, yani Ibn Ammar, ne bayan kiya, Yahya se, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah Raziyallahu Anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Riba ke sattar darwaze hain, Allah ke nazdik un me se sab se halka aisa hai jaise woh shakhs jo apni maan se nikah karta hai."
"673","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne humein khabar di, Abdullah al-Za'farani se, Abu al-Mutawakkil se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Chandi chandi ke badle aur sona sone ke badle barabar barabar ho, pas jis ne zyada diya ya zyada liya to us ne riba ka irtikab kiya, lene wala aur dene wala barabar hai."
"674","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe ahle ilm mein se chand aadmiyon ne khabar di, un mein Malik ibn Anas bhi hain, ke Nafi' jo Ibn Umar ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne un se hadees bayan ki, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone ke badle mat becho magar misl ba misl, aur us ke baaz ko baaz par fazilat na do, aur chandi chandi ke badle mat becho magar misl ba misl, aur us ke baaz ko baaz par fazilat na do, aur in mein se koi cheez udhar ke badle nagad mat becho."
"675","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sufyan se, Khalid al-Hadh-dha' se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Ash'ath al-San'ani se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone ke badle, aur chandi chandi ke badle, aur khajoor khajoor ke badle, aur gandum gandum ke badle, aur jau jau ke badle, aur namak namak ke badle, misl ba misl, haath ba haath ho, phir jab ye qismein mukhtalif ho jayen to jis tarah chaho becho jab ke haath ba haath ho."
"676","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Malik ibn Aws ibn al-Hadathan se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona chandi ke badle riba hai magar haa aur haa (ya'ni dast ba dast ho), aur khajoor khajoor ke badle riba hai magar haa aur haa, aur gandum gandum ke badle riba hai magar haa aur haa, aur jau jau ke badle riba hai magar haa aur haa."
"677","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid se, Hakim ibn Jabir al-Ahmasi se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit Raziallahu anhu se, aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ya'ni Ibn Mu'awiyah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Isma'il se, Hakim ibn Jabir se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit Raziallahu anhu se, aur yeh Waki' se un ki hadees hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Sona sone ke badle palra ba palra, aur chandi chandi ke badle palra ba palra, yahan tak ke unhon ne namak tak ko khaas taur par zikr kiya, Ubadah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mujhe parwah nahin ke main Mu'awiyah ki zameen mein na hun, aur Marwan ne kaha: yahan tak ke unhon ne namak ke zikr ko khaas kiya."
"678","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne humein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: humein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein jama' (mili-juli ghatiya) khajoor rizq mein di jati thi to hum do sa' ko ek sa' ke badle bechte the, phir ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchayi gayi to aap ne farmaya: Do sa' khajoor ek sa' ke badle (mat becho) aur na do dirham ek dirham ke badle."
"679","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Hani' al-Khawlani ne khabar di ke unhon ne Ulayy ibn Rabah al-Lakhmi ko kehte hue suna: main ne Fadalah ibn Ubayd al-Ansari ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas jab ke aap Khaybar mein the ek haar laya gaya jis mein manke aur sona tha, aur wo maal-e-ghanimat mein se tha jo becha ja raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne haar mein jo sona tha usay akele alag nikalne ka hukm diya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Sona sone ke badle wazan ba wazan ho."
"680","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Simak ibn Harb se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: main Baqi' mein oont becha karta tha, pas deenaron ke badle bechta aur dirham leta aur dirhamon ke badle bechta aur deenaar leta tha, unhon ne kaha: phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya jab ke aap Hafsah ke ghar mein the, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, zara tehriye, main aap se sawal karta hun! Main Baqi' mein oont bechta hun, pas deenaron ke badle bechta hun aur dirham leta hun, aur dirhamon ke badle bechta hun aur deenaar leta hun, to aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahin jab tum usay us din ke bhao par lo, jab tak tum juda na ho aur tumhare darmiyan koi cheez baqi na ho."
"681","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne khajoor ko us ke pakne ke zahir hone se pehle bechne se mana farmaya, aur phal ko phal ke badle bechne se mana farmaya."
"682","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne hum se hadees bayan ki ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ibn Anas aur Usamah ibn Zayd ne khabar di, Abdullah ibn Yazid jo al-Aswad ibn Sufyan ke azaad karda ghulam hain un se, ke Abu Ayyash jo Banu Zuhrah ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas Raziallahu anhu ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khushk khajoor ke badle taza khajoor (rutab) kharidne ke baare mein sawal kiye jate hue suna, to aap ne farmaya: Kya rutab khushk ho kar kam ho jati hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, to aap ne us se mana farmaya."
"683","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ya'ni Ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaydullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Zayd ibn Thabit Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne araya mein rukhsat di ke usay us ke andaze ke mutabiq kail (pemane) se becha jaye."
"684","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne khabar di, Dawud ibn al-Husayn se ke Abu Sufyan jo Ibn Abi Ahmad ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne unhein khabar di, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne paanch awsaq se kam, ya paanch awsaq mein araya ke bechne ki rukhsat di, Dawud ibn al-Husayn ko shak hua: unhein malum nahin ke paanch awsaq ya paanch se kam."
"685","Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid - yani Ibn Harun - ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne humein khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Zaid ibn Thabit Raziallahu anhu ne mujhe khabar di: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ariyya me rukhsat di ke use usi ke misl ke mutabiq andaze (khars) se khajoor ke badle liya jaye, jise us ke ghar wale tar khajoor (rutab) ki surat me khayen."
"686","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaidullah se, Nafi se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaibar walon se aadhe par muamala kiya us me se jo us se nikle, khajoor ya kheti me se."
"687","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nafi ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ahl-e-Khaibar se muamala kiya aadhe par us me se jo us se nikle, kheti ya khajoor me se, pas Aap apni azwaj ko har saal sau wasq diya karte the, assi wasq khajoor aur bees wasq jau. Pas jab Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu bar sar-e-iqtidar aaye to unhon ne Khaibar taqseem ki, pas Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki azwaj ko ikhtiyar diya ke un ke liye zameen kaat kar de di jaye ya un ke liye wasqon ki zamanat di jaye, pas un me se jis ne ikhtiyar kiya ke us ke liye zameen kaat kar di jaye aur un me se jis ne wasqon ko ikhtiyar kiya. Aur Aisha aur Hafsa Raziallahu anhuma un me se thin jinhon ne wasqon ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"688","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqbah ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne Yahudiyon ko arz-e-Hijaz se jila-watan kar diya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab Khaibar par ghalib aaye to Aap ne Yahudiyon ko wahan se nikalna chaha, aur zameen jab Aap us par ghalib aaye to Allah aur Us ke Rasul aur Musalmanon ke liye thi, pas Aap ne Yahudiyon ko us se nikalna chaha, to Yahudiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se darkhwast ki ke Aap unhein us me baqi rakhen is shart par ke woh us ke kaam ki kifayat karenge aur un ke liye aadhi khajoor hogi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se kaha: Hum tumhein us me is par baqi rakhte hain jab tak hum chahein. Pas woh us me baqi rahe yahan tak ke Umar Raziallahu anhu ne unhein Taima aur Ariha ki taraf jila-watan kar diya."
"689","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa - yani Ibn Yunus - ne humein khabar di, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek Yahudi se khana (ghalla) kharida, aur us ke paas lohe ki ek zirah girwi rakhi."
"690","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zakariyya - yani Ibn Abi Za'idah - se, Amir se, Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Peeth (sawari ke janwar) par us ke kharche ke badle sawari ki jayegi jab woh girwi ho, aur doodh wali (janwar) ke doodh me se piya jayega jab woh girwi ho, aur jo piye aur sawari kare us par us ka kharcha hai."
"691","(70) Luqata aur gumshuda janwaron ka bab: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas aur Amr ibn al-Harith aur Sufyan ibn Sa'id al-Thawri aur ghairon ne mujhe khabar di ke Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abdur Rahman ne un se hadees bayan ki, Yazid maula al-Munba'ith se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur main Aap ke saath tha, pas us ne luqata (padi hui cheez) ke baare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke bartan (ifas) aur us ke bandhan (wika) ko pehchan le, phir us ka ek saal tak elaan kar, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye (to use de de) warna phir tu us ke baare me jo chahe kar, unhon ne kaha: To bhatki hui bakri? Aap ne farmaya: Woh tere liye hai, ya tere bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye. Unhon ne kaha: To bhatka hua oont? Aap ne farmaya: Us ke saath us ke jute (khur) aur us ki mashk hai, woh pani par aata hai aur darakht se khata hai, yahan tak ke use us ka maalik pa le."
"692","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sufyan se (ha). Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abdur Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abdur Rahman se, Yazid maula al-Munba'ith se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se luqata ke baare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar koi tere paas aaye jo tujhe us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ke baare me bataye (to use de de), warna us se faida utha. Aur us ne Aap se bhatke hue oont ke baare me sawal kiya? To Aap ka chehra (ghusse se) surkh ho gaya, aur farmaya: Tujhe us se kya? Us ke saath us ke jute aur us ki mashk hai, woh pani par aata hai aur darakht se khata hai, use chhod de yahan tak ke use us ka maalik pa le. Aur us ne Aap se bhatki hui bakri ke baare me sawal kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Woh tere liye hai, ya tere bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye. Yeh al-Firyabi ki hadees hai."
"693","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Firyabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Salamah ibn Kuhail se, Suwaid ibn Ghafalah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine ek koda paya to use utha liya, to Zaid ibn Suhan aur Salman ibn Rabi'ah ne mujh par us ko bura jana, to maine kaha: Agar maine us ke maalik ko pa liya to use us ke hawale kar dunga warna us se faida uthaunga, unhon ne kaha: Pas maine us ka zikr Ubayy ibn Ka'b se kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tum ne acha kiya, tum ne acha kiya; maine ek thaili pai to use Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas laya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka elaan kar, pas maine us ka ek saal elaan kiya, pas mujhe koi na mila jo use pehchanta ho, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ki ginti aur us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko jaan le, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, warna us se faida utha."
"694","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-Dahhak ibn Uthman ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Nadr se, Busr ibn Sa'id se, Zaid ibn Khalid al-Juhani Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se luqata ke baare me sawal kiya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar woh pehchani na jaye to us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko pehchan le, phir use kha le, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de."
"695","Ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith aur Hisham ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, Amr ibn Shu'aib se, un ke walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Muzaina ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, us ne kaha: Aap kya farmate hain us ke baare me jo aam aamad-o-raft wali rah me aur aabaad basti me paya jaye? Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elaan kar, pas agar us ka talash karne wala aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, warna phir tu us ke baare me jo chahe kar, aur agar us ka talib zamane me kabhi bhi aa jaye to use us ke hawale kar de, aur jo ghair aamad-o-raft wali rah me ho, ya ghair aabaad basti me ho, to us me aur rikaz (dafina) me panchwan (khums) hai."
"696","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Amir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, Khalid al-Hazza se, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se, Mutarrif se, Iyad ibn Himar Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo luqata uthaye to use chahiye ke ek aadil shakhs ko, ya do aadil shakhs ko gawah banaye, aur na chhupaye, aur na ghaib kare, pas agar us ka maalik aa jaye to woh us ka zyada haqdar hai, warna woh Allah ka maal hai jise chahta hai deta hai."
"697","(71) Nikah ki kitab: Abu Hashim Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Umara ibn Umayr se, Abdur Rahman ibn Yazid se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hum se farmaya: Ae jawanon ki jama'at, tum me se jo ba'ah (nikah ke akhrajat) ki istita'at rakhta ho use nikah karna chahiye, kyunki yeh nigah ko zyada jhukane wala aur sharmgah ko zyada mehfooz rakhne wala hai, aur jo istita'at na rakhe to us par roza lazim hai, kyunki woh us ke liye wija (khwahish ko katne wali cheez) hai."
"698","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne humen khabar di (ha). Aur Abu Ja'far al-Mukharrimi Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn-ul-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne tabattul (nikah tark karke mujarrad rehne) se mana farmaya."
"699","Rabi ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, ke Ibn-ul-Musayyib ne un se bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Maz'un ne tabattul (nikah se alag rehne) ka irada kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen mana farmaya. Sa'd ne kaha: Pas agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) unhen is ki ijazat de dete to hum khassi ho jate."
"700","Ali ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiya ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim al-Ahwal se, Bakr ibn Abdullah al-Muzani se, Mughira ibn Shu'ba Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine ek aurat ko nikah ka paigham diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tum ne use dekha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Use dekh lo, kyunki yeh is baat ke zyada layaq hai ke tum dono ke darmiyan ulfat paida ki jaye."
"701","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, Sabit se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, ke Mughira ibn Shu'ba ne ek aurat ko nikah ka paigham diya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Jao, use dekh lo, kyunki yeh tum dono ke darmiyan (muhabbat) ko zyada qaim rakhne wala hai."
"702","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Uyaynah ne kaha (ha). Aur Ibn-ul-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn-ul-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se - aur Ali ne kaha: woh ise Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hain - Aap ne farmaya: Najsh na karo, aur koi shehri kisi dehati ke liye (uska maal) farokht na kare, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke paigham-e-nikah par paigham na bheje, aur koi aurat apni (deeni) behan ki talaq ka mutalba na kare. Ali ne izafa kiya: taake woh us ke bartan me jo hai use undel le."
"703","Abu Hatim ar-Razi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah - yani Ibn Musa - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ne humen khabar di, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, Abu Salama se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Kisi aurat ke liye munasib nahin ke woh apni (deeni) behan ki talaq ki shart lagaye taake woh us ka bartan undel le."
"704","Abu Zur'a ar-Razi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abthar ne humen khabar di, al-A'mash se, Abu Ishaq se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humen namaz me tashahhud aur hajat me tashahhud sikhaya, phir unhon ne namaz me tashahhud aur hajat me tashahhud zikr kiya, phir unhon ne kaha: Aur hajat me tashahhud yeh hai ke woh kahe: Beshak tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai, hum Uski hamd karte hain, Us se madad mangte hain aur Us se maghfirat talab karte hain, aur apne nafson ke shurur se Allah ki panah mangte hain, aur jise Allah hidayat de use koi gumrah karne wala nahin aur jise Woh gumrah kare use koi hidayat dene wala nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Uske bande aur Uske Rasul hain, phir Quran ki teen aayaten parhe: Allah se daro jaisa Us se darne ka haq hai aur tumhen maut na aaye magar is haal me ke tum Musalman ho. Aur us Allah se daro jiske waste se tum ek dusre se sawal karte ho aur rishton ka khayal rakho, beshak Allah tum par nigahban hai. Ae iman walo, Allah se daro aur seedhi baat kaho."
"705","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: an-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwa se, Zaynab bint Abi Salama se, Umm Salama se, ke Umm Habiba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya aap ko meri behan (se nikah) me raghbat hai? Aap ne farmaya: Main kya karun? Unhon ne kaha: Aap us se nikah kar len. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari behan? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Aur kya tum ise pasand karti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main akeli (aap ki zauja) nahin hun aur jo mere sath khair me shareek ho un me se mujhe sab se zyada mehboob meri behan hai! Aap ne farmaya: Pas woh mere liye halal nahin hai, Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke aap Durra - ya Dhurra, shak Zuhayr ki taraf se hai - ko paigham de rahe hain, Aap ne farmaya: Umm Salama ki beti? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, agar woh meri parwarish me meri rabiba (sauteli beti) na hoti tab bhi woh mere liye halal na hoti, woh raza'at se mere bhai ki beti hai, mujhe aur us ke walid ko Suwayba ne doodh pilaya tha, pas tum apni betiyan aur apni behnen mujh par pesh na karo."
"706","Muhammad ibn Sabiq ke maula (aazad-karda ghulam) Rawh ibn-ul-Faraj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd ibn Jannad al-Halabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Amr ar-Raqqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Abi Unaysa se, Adi ibn Sabit se, Yazid ibn-ul-Bara se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne chacha se mila jabke unhon ne jhanda bandh rakha tha, to maine kaha: Aap kahan ka irada rakhte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe ek aise shakhs ki taraf bheja hai jis ne apne baap ki biwi se nikah kiya hai, (is hukm ke sath) ke main us ki gardan maar dun aur us ka maal le lun."
"707","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne mujhe khabar di, Miswar ibn Rifa'a al-Qurazi se, Zubayr ibn Abdur Rahman ibn-uz-Zubayr se, un ke walid se, ke Rifa'a ibn Samaw'al ne apni biwi Tumayma bint Wahb ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me talaq di, to Abdur Rahman ibn-uz-Zubayr ne us se nikah kiya, magar woh us se (jima se) ruk gaya, pas woh use pahunch na saka to us ne use talaq de di aur use chhua nahin, phir Rifa'a ne us se nikah karne ka irada kiya, aur wohi us ka woh shohar tha jis ne use Abdur Rahman se pehle talaq di thi, to yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se zikr ki gayi, to Aap ne use us se nikah karne se mana farmaya, pas Aap ne farmaya: Woh tumhare liye halal nahin, yahan tak ke woh usaylah (jima ki mithas) chakhe."
"708","Ibn-ul-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwa se, Ayesha Raziallahu anha se, ke Rifa'a ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aayi aur kaha: Rifa'a ne mujhe aisi talaq di jis se main us se juda ho gayi, aur maine Abdur Rahman ibn-uz-Zubayr se nikah kiya hai, aur us ke pas kapde ke jhalar jaisa (namardi ka aza) hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: Kya tum Rifa'a ki taraf lautna chahti ho? Nahin, yahan tak ke woh tumhari usaylah chakhe aur tum us ki usaylah chakho."
"709","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'alla ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya (ha). Aur Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'alla ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Ja'far se - woh al-Mukharrimi hain - Uthman ibn Muhammad se, al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne muhallil aur muhallal lahu par la'nat farmayi."
"710","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud - yani Ibn Abi Hind - ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aurat ka nikah uski phuphi par kiya jaye, aur phuphi ka uske bhai ki beti par, ya aurat ka uski khala par, ya khala ka uski behan ki beti par; na chhoti ka nikah badi par kiya jaye aur na badi ka chhoti par."
"711","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Salih se, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi ghulam apne maula aur uske ghar walon ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare to woh zinakar hai."
"712","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman se, ke Aishah Raziallahu anha, jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja hain, ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak raza'at us cheez ko haram karti hai jise wiladat haram karti hai."
"713","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hamein khabar di ke Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Aishah ko kehte hue suna: Quran mein dus maloom raza'atein nazil huin, woh us se woh murad le rahi thin jo raza'at se haram karta hai. Amrah ne kaha: Phir Aishah ne zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uske baad paanch nazil huin."
"714","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Wuhayb se, Ayyub se, Abdullah ibn Abi Mulaykah se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek ya do ghoont haram nahin karte."
"715","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Akhi Ibn Shihab ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Sahlah bint Suhayl ibn Amr aayin - aur woh Abu Hudhayfah ibn Utbah ke nikah mein thin - phir woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayin to unhon ne kaha: Abu Hudhayfah ka azaad karda ghulam Salim hamare paas aata hai jabke main halke libas mein hoti hun, aur hum use beta samajhte the, aur Abu Hudhayfah ne use munh bola beta banaya tha jaise Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zayd ko munh bola beta banaya tha, phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Unhein unke baapon ki nisbat se pukaro, yahi Allah ke nazdeek zyada insaf wala hai, to us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein hukum diya ke Salim ko doodh pilayen, to unhon ne use paanch raza'atein pilayin, to woh raza'at se unke bete ke darje mein ho gaya, isi wajah se Aishah Raziallahu anha apne bhaiyon aur apne bhatijiyon ko hukum deti thin ke jis mard ko Aishah Raziallahu anha pasand kartin ke woh unhein dekhe aur unke paas aaye, agarche woh bada ho, use paanch raza'atein pilayen phir woh unke paas aaye, aur Umm Salamah aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki baqi azwaj ne inkar kiya ke unke paas us raza'at ke zariye logon mein se koi aaye, yahan tak ke woh jhoole mein doodh piye, aur unhon ne Aishah se kaha: Allah ki qasam hum nahin jantein, shayad yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf se Salim ke liye logon ke siwa khaas ijazat thi."
"716","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan se, al-Ash'ath se, unke walid se, Masruq se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) unke paas tashreef laye jabke unke paas ek mard tha, to unhon ne farmaya: Yeh kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Mera razayi bhai hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Dekho tumhare bhai kaun hain, kyunki raza'at to sirf bhook se hai."
"717","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, aur Hisham ibn Urwah ne apne walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se - un mein se ek apne sathi par izafa karta hai - unhon ne kaha: Mere chacha hijab farz hone ke baad mujh se ijazat talab karne aaye, to maine unhein ijazat na di, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef laye, to maine unse poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: Unhein ijazat do kyunki woh tumhare chacha hain, maine kaha: Mujhe to aurat ne doodh pilaya hai aur mard ne mujhe doodh nahin pilaya? Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara dayan haath khaak aalud ho, unhein ijazat do kyunki woh tumhare chacha hain."
"718","Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Zayd se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (ha). Aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Zayd se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne Hamzah Raziallahu anhu ki beti ka zikr kiya gaya to unhon ne farmaya: Beshak woh mere razayi bhai ki beti hai."
"719","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Nubayh ibn Wahb se jo Banu Abd al-Dar ke bhai hain, ke Umar ibn Abdillah ne Talhah ibn Umar ka nikah Shaybah ibn Jubayr ki beti se karna chaha jabke dono muhrim the, to unhon ne Aban ibn Uthman ibn Affan ki taraf paigham bheja taake woh is mein hazir hon, unhon ne kaha: To Aban ne is par unka inkar kiya jabke woh hajj ke amir the, to Aban ne kaha: Maine Uthman ibn Affan Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Muhrim na nikah kare, na nikah karaye, aur na paigham bheje."
"720","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn al-Shahid se, Maymun ibn Mihran se, Yazid ibn al-Asamm se jo Maymunah ke bhanje hain, Maymunah bint al-Harith se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se Sarif mein nikah kiya jabke hum dono halal the."
"721","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr se, Abu al-Sha'tha se, ke Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke Aap ihram ki halat me the."
"722","Pas maine is ki khabar Zuhri ko di to unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yazid ibn al-Asamm ne khabar di - aur woh un ki khala thin - ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke Aap halal the, aur woh halal thin."
"723","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Hasan aur Abdullah ibne Muhammad se - unhon ne kaha: aur Hasan un dono me se zyada siqah the - un dono ke walid se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah se aur Khaybar ke zamane me gharlu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya. Aur Sufyan kaha karte the: Hasan un dono me behtar the."
"724","Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: aur Sufyan ne hamen is sanad se ek dusri martaba hadees bayan ki to usay zikr kiya, aur kaha: un dono ke walid se, unhon ne Ali ko Ibn Abbas se kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah se aur gharlu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya."
"725","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Rabi ibn Sabrah al-Juhani se, apne walid se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah se mana farmaya."
"726","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abd al-Aziz ibn Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, unhon ne kaha: Rabi ibn Sabrah al-Juhani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath nikle, phir jab hum ne apna umrah pura kar liya to Aap ne hum se farmaya: in aurton se istimta karo, aur us din hamare nazdeek istimta se murad nikah tha, unhon ne kaha: pas hum ne is baat ko aurton ke samne pesh kiya to unhon ne inkar kiya magar is par ke hum apne aur un ke darmiyan ek muddat muqarrar karen, unhon ne kaha: pas hum ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to Aap ne farmaya: aisa kar lo, unhon ne kaha: pas main aur mera ek chachazad bhai nikle, mere pas ek chadar thi aur us ke pas ek chadar thi, aur us ki chadar meri chadar se umdah thi, aur main us se zyada naujawan tha, unhon ne kaha: pas hum ek aurat ke pas aaye aur us par is baat ko pesh kiya, to use meri jawani pasand aayi aur use mere chachazad bhai ki chadar pasand aayi, to us ne kaha: chadar to chadar jaisi, pas maine us se nikah kar liya aur mere aur us ke darmiyan muddat das din thi, unhon ne kaha: pas main us raat us ke pas raha phir subah masjid ki taraf gaya, to achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Hijr aur Darwaze ke darmiyan khade khutba de rahe the, aur Aap farma rahe the: ae logo, sun lo! maine tumhen in aurton se istimta ki ijazat di thi, sun lo! pas beshak Allah ne is ko Qayamat ke din tak haram kar diya hai, pas jis ke pas in me se koi aurat ho to use us ka rasta chhor de, aur jo kuch tum ne unhen diya hai us me se kuch na lo."
"727","Muhammad ibn Sahl ibn Askar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sulayman ibn Musa ne bataya, ke Ibn Shihab ne unhen khabar di, ke Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne unhen khabar di, ke Aishah Raziallahu anha ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jo bhi aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare to us ka nikah batil hai, pas agar woh us se suhbat kare to usay us ki sharmgah ko halal karne ke badle mehar milega, aur agar woh jhagden to hukmaran us ka wali hai jis ka koi wali na ho."
"728","Muhammad ibn Sahl ibn Askar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qabisah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa al-Ashari Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: wali ke baghair nikah nahin."
"729","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: wali ke baghair nikah nahin."
"730","Muhammad ibn Sahl ibn Askar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Uthman al-Raqqi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ibn Muawiyah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: wali ke baghair nikah nahin."
"731","Abu Bakr Hamdan ibn Muhammad ibn Raja ibn al-Sindi aur Muhammad ibn Zakariyya al-Jawhari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Kamil al-Fudayl ibn al-Husayn ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, apne walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: wali ke baghair nikah nahin. Aur Sharik ne bhi isay muttasil bayan kiya hai aur is ki sanad bayan ki hai."
"732","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn al-Rabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Idris ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ishaq ne kaha aur mujhe Muhammad ibn Jafar ibn al-Zubayr ne hadees bayan ki, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko Banu al-Mustaliq ke qaidi mile to Juwayriyah bint al-Harith Thabit ibn Qays ibn Shammas ke hisse me aayin, ya us ke chachazad bhai ke hisse me, unhon ne kaha: pas unhon ne apne nafs par us se kitabat kar li aur woh ek meethi, namkeen aurat thin, unhen taqreeban jo bhi dekhta woh us ke dil ko moh letin, pas woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas apni kitabat par madad mangne ke liye aayin, unhon ne kaha: pas Allah ki qasam! jaise hi maine unhen hujre ke darwaze par dekha to maine unhen na-pasand kiya, aur maine jaan liya ke Aap un me wohi dekhenge jo maine dekha, pas unhon ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasul! main Juwayriyah bint al-Harith ibn Abi Dirar hun jo apni qaum ka sardar hai, aur mujhe is mamle se woh pohuncha hai jo Aap se chhupa nahin, pas main Thabit ke hisse me aayi, ya us ke chachazad bhai ke hisse me, to maine apne nafs par us se kitabat kar li, pas main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas apni kitabat par madad mangne aayi hun, Aap ne farmaya: kya tumhare liye is se behtar cheez hai? unhon ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasul! woh kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: main tumhari kitabat ada kar dun aur tum se nikah kar lun? unhon ne kaha: ji han, unhon ne kaha: maine kar diya, aur logon me khabar phail gayi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Juwayriyah bint al-Harith se nikah kar liya hai, to logon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke susral wale hain, pas unhon ne Banu al-Mustaliq ke qaidiyon me se jo kuch un ke hathon me tha chhor diya, pas un se Aap ke nikah ne Banu al-Mustaliq ke sau gharane azad kara diye, pas hum kisi aurat ko nahin jante jo apni qaum par un se barh kar barkat wali ho."
"733","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Ibn Abi Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Umm Salamah Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ek cheez suni, aur woh mujhe falaan cheez se zyada mehboob hai: Koi shakhs kisi museebat mein mubtala nahi hota, phir unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki taraf paigham bheja aur un se nikah ka paigham diya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khush aamdeed. Mujh mein teen khaslatein hain jin ka mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke haq mein andesha hai: main sakht ghairat wali aurat hun, aur main aisi aurat hun ke mere awliya mein se koi (yahan) nahi jo mera nikah karaye, aur main bachchon wali aurat hun, to Umar Raziallahu anhu ne ye suna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke liye is se bhi zyada sakht ghussa hue jitna apne liye ghussa hue the jab unhon ne un se kaha tha: Ay Ibn al-Khattab! mujh mein aisi aisi baatein hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko un ki kahi hui baat pahunchi to aap un ke paas aaye aur farmaya: Raha jo tum ne apni ghairat ka zikr kiya to main Allah Ta'ala se dua karunga ke woh use tum se door kar de, aur raha jo tum ne apne bachchon ka zikr kiya to Allah un ki kifayat karega, aur raha jo tum ne zikr kiya ke yahan tumhare awliya mein se koi nahi jo tumhara nikah karaye to tumhare awliya mein se koi shakhs haazir ho ya ghaib aisa nahi jo mujhe napasand karta ho. To unhon ne apne bete se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (mera) nikah kara do, to us ne un ka nikah kara diya."
"734","Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya aur kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith ne hum se bayan kiya. Aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ayyim aurat ka nikah na kiya jaye yahan tak ke us se mashwara liya jaye, aur kunwari ka nikah na kiya jaye yahan tak ke us se ijazat li jaye, kaha gaya: Aur us ki ijazat kya hai ay Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke woh khamosh rahe. Yeh hadees al-Darimi ki hai."
"735","Abu Ja'far Muhammad ibn Abdillah al-Mukharrami aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abi Mulaykah ko Dhakwan Abu Amr se hadees bayan karte hue suna, woh Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Nabi se (riwayat karte hain ke) unhon ne kaha: Ijazat talab karo. Aur al-Mukharrami ne kaha: Aurton se un ki sharmgahon ke baare mein mashwara lo. Kaha gaya: Phir kunwari to sharmati hai aur khamosh rehti hai? Aap ne farmaya: To us ki khamoshi us ki ijazat hai. Aur al-Mukharrami ne kaha: Sharmati hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: To wohi us ki ijazat hai."
"736","Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik ibn Anas se, Abdullah ibn al-Fadl se, Nafi' ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ayyim aurat apne nafs ki apne wali se zyada haqdaar hai, aur kunwari se us ke nafs ke baare mein mashwara liya jayega, aur us ki khamoshi us ka iqraar hai."
"737","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur us mein se jo maine Ibn Nafi' par qiraat kiya, (woh) Malik se, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Abd al-Rahman aur Mujammi' dono farzandan Yazid ibn Jariyah al-Ansari se, Khansa' bint Khidham al-Ansariyyah Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat hai): Ke un ke walid ne un ka nikah kar diya jabke woh thayyib thin to unhon ne ise napasand kiya, to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayin to aap ne un ka nikah radd kar diya."
"738","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, un ke walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main chhe baras ki bachi thi, aur mujh se suhbat ki jab main nau baras ki bachi thi."
"739","al-Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne un se bayan kiya, Sulayman ya'ni Ibn Bilal se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Habib se, ke unhon ne Ata' ibn Abi Rabah ko kehte hue suna: Yusuf ibn Mahak ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hadees bayan karte hue suna, aap ne farmaya: Teen (cheezein aisi) hain jin ka jidd bhi jidd hai aur jin ka mazaq bhi jidd hai: Nikah aur talaq aur ruj'at."
"740","Yahya ibn Ja'far ibn Abi Talib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn al-Hasan ibn Shaqiq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Umm Habibah Raziallahu anha se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke woh sarzameen-e-Habasha mein thin; Najashi ne un ka nikah aap se karaya aur un ka mahr chaar hazaar muqarrar kiya aur apni taraf se un ka jahez tayyar kiya, aur unhein Shurahbil ibn Hasanah ke saath bheja, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki taraf kuch nahi bheja tha, aur aap ki biwiyon ka mahr chaar sau dirham tha."
"741","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nu'aym ibn Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, isi isnad se isi tarah."
"742","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf Raziallahu anhu ne Ansar ki ek aurat se nikah kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum ne use kitna mahr diya? Unhon ne kaha: Sone ki ek nawat. Ibn Abi Najih ne kaha: Nawat paanch dirham (ki) hai, aur nashsh bees dirham, aur uqiyyah chalees dirham hai."
"743","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Sahl ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Hum logon mein (maujood) the ke ek aurat ne kaha: Maine apna nafs aap ko hiba kar diya hai ay Rasulullah! Mere baare mein apni raay zahir farmaiye! To ek mard khada hua aur kaha: Is ka nikah mujh se kara dijiye! Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur talaash karo agarche lohe ki ek anguthi hi ho, unhon ne kaha: To woh gaya aur kuch lekar na aaya aur na lohe ki anguthi, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas Quran ki surton mein se kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: To aap ne us ka nikah us se kara diya us ke badle jo us ke paas Quran ki surton mein se tha."
"744","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ya'ni Ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawud ya'ni Ibn Qays se, Musa ibn Yasar se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hamara sadaq (mahr) jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hum mein maujood the, das uqiyyah tha."
"745","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman - ya'ni Ibn Mahdi - ne humen khabar di, Sufyan se, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, Abdullah se. Aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki - aur hadees ke alfaz unhi ke hain - unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne humen khabar di, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, Abdullah se, ek aise shakhs ke baare mein jis ne ek aurat se nikah kiya phir us ke liye mahr muqarrar kiya na us se sohbat ki hatta ke mar gaya, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne unhen wapas kar diya, phir kaha: Main is mein apni raay se kehta hun, agar woh durust hai to Allah ki taraf se hai aur agar ghalat hai to meri taraf se hai, main us ke liye us ki khandan ki auraton jaisa mahr dekhta hun, na kami na ziyadti, aur us par iddat hai aur us ke liye wirasat hai, unhon ne kaha: To Ma'qil ibn Sinan al-Ashja'i khade hue aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum ne is mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke faisle ke mutabiq faisla kiya hai Barwa' bint Washiq ke baare mein - jo Banu Ruwas ki ek aurat thin - aur Banu Ruwas Banu Amir ibn Sa'sa'ah ka ek qabeela hai."
"746","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya."
"747","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Aur jo main ne Ibn Nafi' par parh kar sunaya, Malik ibn Anas se, Nafi' se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya. Aur shighar yeh hai ke koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko apni beti is shart par byahe ke dusra use apni beti byahega aur un dono ke darmiyan koi mahr na ho."
"748","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - ya'ni Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham - ya'ni Ibn Hassan - se, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ayb ibn al-Habhab ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Safiyyah ko azaad kiya aur un ki azaadi ko un ka mahr qarar diya."
"749","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne humen khabar di, Qatadah se, al-Nadr ibn Anas se, Bashir ibn Nahik se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi mard ki do biwiyan hon aur woh ek ki taraf jhuk jaye to Qayamat ke din is haal mein aayega ke us ka ek pehlu gira hua hoga."
"750","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr, Alqamah ibn Waqqas al-Laythi aur Ubaydullah ibn Utbah ibn Mas'ud ne mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja A'ishah ki hadees se khabar di ke Nabi ki zauja A'ishah ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) safar ka irada farmate to apni biwiyon ke darmiyan qur'a andazi farmate, phir un mein se jis ka qura nikalta Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke saath bahar nikalte."
"751","Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Ahmasi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Sunnat yeh hai ke jab kunwari se nikah kare to us ke paas saat din qiyam kare, aur jab thayyib se nikah kare to us ke paas teen din qiyam kare."
"752","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se ke Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne unhen hadees bayan ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja A'ishah ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) safar ka irada farmate to apni biwiyon ke darmiyan qur'a andazi farmate, phir un mein se jis ka qura nikalta woh us ke saath nikalte, aur woh un mein se har aurat ke liye us ka din aur us ki raat muqarrar farmate the, siwaye is ke ke Sawdah bint Zam'ah ne apna din aur apni raat A'ishah ko hiba kar di thi, is se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki khushnudi chahti thin."
"753","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Awf ne nikah kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Walima karo agarche ek bakri hi ho."
"754","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hafsah ya apni azwaj mein se kisi se nikah kiya to un par khajoor aur sattu ka walima kiya."
"755","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Usamah ibn al-Hadi se, Umarah ibn Khuzaymah ibn Thabit se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Beshak Allah haq se haya nahin farmate, auraton ke paas un ke dubur mein na aao."
"756","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Dahhak ibn Uthman se, Makhramah ibn Sulayman se, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us shakhs ki taraf nazar nahin farmayega jo kisi mard ya aurat ke paas dubur mein aaye."
"757","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zuhri, az Urwah, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Abd ibn Zam'ah aur Sa'd ne Zam'ah ki londi ke bete ke bare mein jhagra kiya, to Sa'd ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujhe wasiyat ki thi ke jab main Makkah aaun to Zam'ah ki londi ke bete ko le lun kyunki woh mera beta hai, to Abd ibn Zam'ah ne kaha: Mere baap ki londi ka beta hai jo mere baap ke bistar par paida hua, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Utbah se wazeh mushabihat dekhi to farmaya: Woh tumhara hai aye Abd ibn Zam'ah, aur bachcha bistar wale ka hai, aur aye Sawdah! Usse parda karo."
"758","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakr ibn Mudar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Rabi'ah ne hum se bayan kiya, az Abu Marzuq al-Tujibi, az Hanash al-San'ani, az Ruwayfi' ibn Thabit al-Ansari, az Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi shakhs ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai halal nahi - ya jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho to woh - apna pani ghair ke bachche ko na pilaye."
"759","Muhammad ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, az A'mash, az Mujahid, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din gadho ke gosht se, aur daant wale har darinde se, aur qaidi auraton se is tarah wati karne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh waza hamal kar len."
"760","(72) Talaq ki kitab ka bab: Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Ayman maula Urwah ko Ibn Umar se sawal karte hue suna - jabke Abu al-Zubayr sun rahe the - to unhon ne kaha: Us shakhs ke bare mein aap kya kehte hain jisne apni biwi ko haiz ki halat mein talaq di? To unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko haiz ki halat mein talaq di, to Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Beshak Abdullah ibn Umar ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh usse ruju kare, to usne use mujh par lauta diya, aur kaha: Jab woh paak ho jaye to use talaq de ya rok le, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne tilawat farmayi: Aye Nabi! Jab tum auraton ko talaq do to unhe unki iddat ke liye talaq do, unki iddat ke aaghaz mein."
"761","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Maine apni biwi ko talaq di."
"762","Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya - aur hadees unhi ki hai - unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, az Nafi', az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Umar ne iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare yahan tak ke woh paak ho jaye, phir use doosra haiz aaye, phir jab woh paak ho jaye to agar chahe use jima karne se pehle talaq de ya use rok le, kyunki yehi woh iddat hai jiska Allah ne hukm diya hai ke auraton ko uske liye talaq di jaye."
"763","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne humein khabar di, az Anas ibn Sirin, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Umar ne iska zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare yahan tak ke woh paak ho jaye, to maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se kaha: Kya us talaq se iddat shumar hui? Unhon ne kaha: To phir kya!"
"764","Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan aur Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, az Sufyan, az Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman maula aal Talhah, az Salim, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di - aur Za'farani ne kaha: jabke woh haiza thin - to Umar ne iska zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare, phir use paak ya hamila hone ki halat mein talaq de, Yusuf ne kaha: To Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya."
"765","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibn Nafi', az Malik, az Ibn Shihab ke Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi ne use khabar di ke Uwaymir al-Ajlani - phir unhon ne li'an ke qisse ka zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: To usne use teen talaqen de din is se pehle ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) use hukm dete, Ibn Shihab ne kaha: To yehi mula'ana karne wale miyan biwi ki sunnat thi."
"766","Muhammad ibn Awf ibn Sufyan al-Ta'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Duhaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Awza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Zuhri se sawal kiya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki kin biwiyon ne Aapse panaah mangi? To unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, az Aisha Raziallahu anha ke Jaun ki beti jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas dakhil huin aur Aap unke qareeb hue to unhon ne kaha: Main aapse Allah ki panaah mangti hun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumne Bahut Bade ki panaah li, apne ghar walon se ja milo, Zuhri ne kaha: Apne ghar walon se ja milo ek talaq hai."
"767","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zuhri, az Abu Salamah ke Aisha Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apni biwiyon ko ikhtiyar dene ka hukm diya gaya to unhon ne mujh se ibtida ki aur farmaya: Main tumhe ek khabar sunata hun, aur tum par koi harj nahi ke jaldi na karo yahan tak ke apne walidain se mashwara kar lo, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne farmaya: Aye Nabi! Apni biwiyon se kaho: Agar tum duniya ki zindagi chahti ho - yahan tak ke pahunche - to beshak Allah ne tum mein se neko karon ke liye bahut bada ajr tayyar kar rakha hai, to maine kaha: Isme se kis baat mein main apne walidain se mashwara karun? Beshak main Allah aur Uske Rasool aur Aakhirat ke ghar ko chahti hun, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ne waisa hi kiya jaisa maine kiya."
"768","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani al-Qattan - ne hum se bayan kiya, az Isma'il, az Sha'bi, az Masruq, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ikhtiyar diya, to kya woh talaq tha?"
"769","Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ibn Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - yani Ibn Ulayyah - ne hum se Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrimah se bayan kiya, ke Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne Barirah ke shohar ke bare mein kaha: Woh Mughith tha, Banu Fulan ka ghulam; Allah ki qasam goya main use abhi dekh raha hun ke woh Madinah ki galiyon mein us ke peeche peeche ro raha tha."
"770","Muhammad ibn Abdillah Abu Jafar al-Mukharrimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hisham - woh al-Mughirah ibn Salamah al-Makhzumi hain - ne hum se Wuhayb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se Yazid ibn Ruman se, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se bayan kiya: ke Barirah ka shohar ghulam tha."
"771","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se Amir al-Ahwal se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shuayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis cheez ka malik na ho us mein na talaq hai, aur jis cheez ka malik na ho us mein na aazadi hai."
"772","(73) Zihar ka bab Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar se, unhon ne Salamah ibn Sakhr al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek aisa mard tha jise aurton se jima ki taraf se itna hissa diya gaya tha jo mere siwa kisi aur ko nahi diya gaya tha, phir jab Ramazan aaya to maine apni biwi se zihar kar liya yahan tak ke (mahina) khatm ho jaye, is dar se ke main apni raat mein us se kuch hasil karunga phir us mein lagatar laga rahunga yahan tak ke din mujhe is haal mein pa le ke main rokne ki taqat na rakhunga, pas jab ek raat woh meri khidmat kar rahi thi ke us mein se kuch mere samne khul gaya to main us par toot pada, phir jab subah hui to main apni qaum ke paas gaya aur unhein apni khabar sunai aur un se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf jao aur unhein mera mamla batao, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam hum hargiz aisa nahi karenge, humein dar hai ke humare bare mein Quran nazil ho jaye, ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) humare bare mein koi aisi baat kah dein jis ka aar hum par baqi reh jaye, lekin tum jao aur jo tumhein munasib lage karo, pas main nikla yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhein apni khabar sunai, to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Kya tum hi woh ho? To maine kaha: Main hi woh hun, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum hi woh ho? Maine kaha: Main hi woh hun, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum hi woh ho? Maine kaha: Main hi woh hun, pas mere bare mein Allah ka hukm jari kar dijiye kyunke main sabr karne wala, sawab ki umeed rakhne wala hun, unhon ne kaha: Ek gardan aazad karo, unhon ne kaha: To maine apni gardan ke kinare par hath mara aur kaha: Us Zat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja hai ya Rasulullah, aaj subah main is ke siwa kisi cheez ka malik nahi hun, unhon ne kaha: Pas do mahine lagatar roze rakho, maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe jo musibat pahunchi hai kya woh roze hi ki wajah se to nahi pahunchi? Unhon ne kaha: Pas saath miskino ko khana khilao, maine kaha: Us Zat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja hai hum ne raat is haal mein guzari ke muflis the, humare paas raat ka khana nahi tha, unhon ne kaha: Banu Ruzayq ke sadqe wale ke paas jao - Yahya ne kaha: Aur sahih hai: Zurayq - pas us se kaho, use chahiye ke woh use tumhare hawale kar de, pas us mein se apni taraf se saath miskino ko khajur ka ek wasq khilao, phir baqi se apne aur apne ghar walon par madad hasil karo, unhon ne kaha: Pas main apni qaum ki taraf lauta aur kaha: Maine tumhare paas tangi aur buri raye payi, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas kushadgi aur barkat payi, unhon ne mere liye tumhare sadqe ka hukm diya hai pas use mere hawale kar do, unhon ne kaha: Pas unhon ne use mere hawale kar diya."
"773","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Lahiah aur Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujhe Bukayr ibn al-Ashajj se khabar di, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar se ke Banu Zurayq ka ek mard jis ka naam Salamah ibn Sakhr tha: phir unhon ne mukhtasar taur par isi tarah hadees zikr ki aur us ke aakhir mein kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas khajur layi gayi, to unhon ne woh mujhe de di aur woh pandrah sa ke qareeb thi, pas unhon ne kaha: Ise sadqa kar do, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya mujh se aur mere ghar walon se zyada muflis par? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use tum aur tumhare ghar wale khao."
"774","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Yahya al-Jazari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Salamah ne hum se Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Mamar ibn Abdillah ibn Hanzalah se, unhon ne Yusuf ibn Abdillah ibn Salam se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khuwaylah bint Thalabah ne mujh se bayan kiya - aur woh Aws ibn Samit jo Ubadah ibn al-Samit ke bhai hain ke paas thin - unhon ne kaha: Ek din woh mere paas aaya aur mujh se kisi baat par guftagu ki jabke woh us mein uktaya hua tha, to maine use jawab diya to woh ghussa ho gaya, pas us ne kaha: Tum mujh par meri maa ki peeth ki tarah ho, phir woh nikla aur apni qaum ki majlis mein ja baitha, phir wapas aaya aur mujhe apne nafs ke liye chaha to maine use rok diya, pas us ne mujh se kashmakash ki aur maine us se kashmakash ki to main us par ghalib aa gayi jaise aurat kamzor mard par ghalib aa jati hai, pas maine kaha: Hargiz nahi, us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Khuwaylah ki jaan hai, tum us tak hargiz nahi pahunchoge yahan tak ke Allah mere aur tumhare bare mein apna hukm de de, phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur jo mujhe us se pahunchi thi us ki shikayat ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh tumhara shohar aur tumhara chachazad hai, pas Allah se daro aur us ke sath achha nibhao, unhon ne kaha: Main wahan se hati bhi na thi ke Quran nazil ho gaya: Allah ne us aurat ki baat sun li jo apne shohar ke bare mein aap se jhagadti hai, yahan tak ke kaffare tak pahuncha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh ek gardan aazad kare, maine kaha: Allah ki qasam ya Nabiyullah, us ke paas koi gardan nahi hai jise woh aazad kare, unhon ne kaha: Use hukm do ke woh do mahine lagatar roze rakhe, to maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh budha mard hai us mein roze ki taqat nahi hai, unhon ne kaha: Pas woh saath miskino ko khana khilaye, maine kaha: Ya Nabiyullah, us ke paas kuch nahi hai jo woh khilaye, unhon ne kaha: Hum khajur ke ek araq se us ki madad karenge - aur araq ek tokra hai jo tees sa ki gunjaish rakhta hai - maine kaha: Aur main bhi ek aur araq se us ki madad karungi, unhon ne kaha: Tum ne achha kiya, pas use chahiye ke use sadqa kare."
"775","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ammar ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl ibn Musa ne hum se Mamar se, unhon ne al-Hakam ibn Aban se, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se bayan kiya: ke ek mard Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke us ne apni biwi se zihar kiya tha phir kaffara dene se pehle us se sohbat kar li thi, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, maine apni biwi se zihar kiya tha phir kaffara dene se pehle main us par waqe ho gaya, unhon ne kaha: Allah tum par reham kare, tumhein is par kis cheez ne ubhara? Us ne kaha: Maine chandni mein us ke paon ka jhanjhan dekha tha, unhon ne kaha: Use na chhuo yahan tak ke tum woh karo jis ka Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai."
"776","(74) Khula ka bab Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se Ayyub se, unhon ne Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne Abu Asma se, unhon ne Thawban Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi aurat baghair kisi takleef ke apne shohar se talaq mange to us par Jannat ki khushbu haram hai."
"777","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur us mein se jo maine Abdillah ibn Nafi par padha, aur Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se Malik se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya ibn Said se, unhon ne Amrah se ke unhon ne use Habibah bint Sahl al-Ansariyyah se khabar di ke woh Thabit ibn Qays ibn Shammas ke nikah mein thin, aur ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) subah ki namaz ke liye nikle to Habibah bint Sahl ko andhere mein apne darwaze par paya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main Habibah bint Sahl hun, unhon ne kaha: Tumhara kya mamla hai? Unhon ne kaha: Na main (raazi hun) aur na Thabit ibn Qays - yani un ke shohar - phir jab Thabit aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se kaha: Yeh Habibah bint Sahl hai aur us ne woh zikr kiya hai jo Allah ne chaha ke woh zikr kare, to Habibah ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ne jo kuch mujhe diya tha woh sab mere paas hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Thabit se kaha: Us se le lo, pas us ne us se le liya aur woh apne ghar walon mein baithi rahin."
"778","Abbas ibn Muhammad al-Duri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurad Abu Nuh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ibn Hazim ne hum se Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Thabit ibn Qays ki biwi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur un se kaha: Main Thabit par na deen mein koi aitraz karti hun aur na akhlaq mein, lekin Islam mein kufr se darti hun, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum use us ka bagh wapas karogi? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan, pas Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke woh use us ka bagh wapas kar de aur unhon ne dono ke darmiyan judai kar di."
"779","Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur use Ibrahim ibn Tahman ne bhi Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya hai, magar unhon ne us ke aakhir mein judai kar di ka zikr nahi kiya, use Ahmad ibn Hafs ne hum se apne walid se, unhon ne Ibrahim ibn Tahman se bayan kiya."
"780","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Abu al-Zinad se, unhon ne al-Araj se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Afzal sadqa woh hai jo maal dari ke bawajud diya jaye, aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho, Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Tumhari biwi kehti hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe talaq do, aur tumhara beta kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo, mujhe kis ke hawale karte ho? Aur tumhara khadim kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe bech do."
"781","(75) Li'an ka bab - Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - ya'ni al-Qattan - ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko kehte hue suna: Ibn al-Zubayr ki hukumat mein mutala'inain (li'an karne wale miyan-biwi) ke bare mein mujh se pucha gaya ke kya un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq kar di jayegi? To mujhe maloom na tha ke kya kahun, to main apni jagah se uth kar Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke ghar ki taraf gaya, to main ne kaha: Abu Abd al-Rahman, mutala'inain ke darmiyan kya tafreeq kar di jayegi? Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah, haan. Is bare mein sab se pehle sawal karne wala falan ibn falan tha, us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us shakhs ke bare mein batayiye jo apni biwi ko fahisha (buri harkat) par dekhe? Agar woh bole to bahut badi baat kahe, aur agar khamosh rahe to isi jaisi (bhari) baat par khamosh rahe! Unhon ne kaha: To aap ne use jawab na diya, unhon ne kaha: phir jab agla din hua to woh aap ke paas aya, to us ne kaha: jis ke bare mein main ne sawal kiya tha main usi mein mubtala kar diya gaya hun, to Allah ne Surah al-Nur mein yeh ayat nazil farmayi: Wa allazina yarmuna azwajahum - hatta ke wahan tak pahuncha - Wa al-khamisata anna ghadab Allahi alaiha in kana min al-sadiqin, to aap ne mard se ibtida ki aur use naseehat ki aur yaad-dihani karayi, aur use khabar di ke duniya ka azab akhirat ke azab se halka hai, to us ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne aap ko haqq ke sath bheja, main ne jhoot nahin bola, phir aap ne aurat se dusri bari mein (muamala kiya) aur use naseehat ki aur yaad-dihani karayi, aur use khabar di ke duniya ka azab akhirat ke azab se halka hai, to us ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne aap ko haqq ke sath bheja, beshak woh jhoota hai, unhon ne kaha: to aap ne mard se ibtida ki, to us ne Allah ki qasam ke sath char gawahiyan di ke beshak woh sachon mein se hai, aur panchwin (mein kaha ke) Allah ki la'nat us par ho agar woh jhooton mein se ho, phir aap ne aurat se dusri bari mein (liya), to us ne Allah ki qasam ke sath char gawahiyan di ke beshak woh jhooton mein se hai, aur panchwin (mein kaha ke) Allah ka ghadab us par ho agar woh sachon mein se ho, phir aap ne un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di."
"782","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mutala'inain ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di aur farmaya: tum dono ka hisab Allah par hai, tum mein se ek jhoota hai, tumhare liye is (aurat) par koi rasta (haqq) nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: tumhare liye is (aurat) par koi maal nahin, agar tum is par (ilzam mein) sachche the to woh us ke badle hai jo tum ne is ki sharmgah se halal kiya, aur agar tum ne jhoot bola to woh tumhein is se aur zyada door karega."
"783","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke ek mard ne apni biwi se li'an kiya aur us ke bache se inkar kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di, aur bache ko aurat se milhaq (mansub) farma diya."
"784","al-Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn Abbas se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne al-Ajlani aur us ki biwi ke darmiyan li'an karaya, aur woh hamila thi."
"785","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Awza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se al-Zuhri ne hadees bayan ki, Sahl ibn Sa'd se, ke Uwaymir Asim ibn Adi ke paas aya aur hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: to us ne is (biwi) se li'an kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: agar tum ne use rok kar rakha to tum ne is par zulm kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne use talaq de di, phir woh un dono ke baad ane wale mutala'inain ke liye sunnat (tariqa) ban gaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: dekho; agar woh use kala, aankhon ki sakht siyahi wala, surinon ke etebar se bada, pindliyon ke etebar se bhari (mota) lekar ayi, to main Uwaymir ko magar sachcha hi samajhta hun, aur agar woh use surkh rang ka goya ke woh wihara (chhoti chhipkali) hai lekar ayi, to main Uwaymir ko magar jhoota hi samajhta hun. Unhon ne kaha: To woh use us sifat par lekar ayi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Uwaymir ki tasdeeq mein bayan farmayi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur woh (bacha) is ke baad apni maan ki taraf mansub kiya jata tha."
"786","(76) Bab - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Israil se, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (ha). Unhon ne kaha: Aur Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein Islam layi, phir us ne (dusra) nikah kar liya. To us ka shauhar al-Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main us ke sath Islam la chuka tha aur woh mere Islam ko janti thi, unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use us ke dusre shauhar se le liya, aur use us ke pehle shauhar ki taraf lauta diya."
"787","(77) Bab - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman - ya'ni Ibn Sulayman ibn al-Ghasil - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hamzah ibn Abi Usayd se, Abi Usayd se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath nikle hatta ke hum ek bagh ki taraf chale jise al-Shawt kaha jata hai, hatta ke hum do baghon tak pahunche, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahan baitho. Phir aap dakhil hue, aur al-Jawniyyah ko laya gaya tha aur use khajuron wale ghar mein uthara gaya tha: Umaymah bint al-Nu'man ibn Sharahil aur us ke sath us ki parwarish karne wali daya thi, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke paas dakhil hue to farmaya: Apne aap ko mujhe hiba kar do, us ne kaha: Kya malika apne aap ko aam admi ko hiba karti hai? Unhon ne kaha: To aap ne apna hath jhukaya ke us par apna hath rakhen taake woh sukoon pakde, to us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panah mangti hun, aap ne farmaya: Tum ne panah dene wali hasti ki panah le li hai. Phir aap hamare paas bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Ae Abu Usayd, use do raziqiyyah kapde pehna do aur use us ke ghar walon tak pahuncha do."
"788","(78) Iddat ka bab - Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad Mas'adah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Ishaq se, apni phuphi Zaynab bint Ka'b se, al-Furay'ah bint Malik se, ke us ka shauhar apne kuch a'laj (ghulamon) ki talash mein nikla to unhein al-Qadum par pa liya, to unhon ne us par hamla karke use qatl kar diya, aur woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas ayi aur aap se (is ka) zikr kiya, aur zikr kiya ke woh apne ghar walon se door ke makan mein hai, aur woh un ki taraf muntaqil hona chahti hai to aap ne use ijazat de di. Us ne kaha: To main nikli hatta ke jab main hujron mein thi - ya us ne kaha: main hujron se guzar chuki thi - to aap ne mujhe bulaya - ya us ne kaha: aap ne meri taraf (paigham) bhej kar mujhe bulaya, aur mujhe bulaya aur mujh se farmaya: Apne us shauhar ke ghar mein iddat guzaro jis mein tumhein us ki maut ki khabar ayi, hatta ke (Allah ka) likha apni muddat ko pahunch jaye. Us ne kaha: Phir jab Uthman Raziallahu anhu ka zamana hua to unhon ne meri taraf (paigham) bhej kar mujhe bulaya, aur mujh se sawal kiya, to main ne unhein hadees bayan ki."
"789","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mutarrif ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya (ha) aur Ahmad ibn Nasr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Harb aur Abd al-Aziz ibn Abdillah al-Uwaysi ne humein khabar di, Malik se, Abdillah ibn Yazid mawla al-Aswad ibn Sufyan se, Abi Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Fatimah bint Qays se, ke Abu Amr ibn Hafs ne use batta (qat'i) talaq di jabke woh ghaib tha, to us ne apne wakil ke zariye use jau bhejey to us ne use napasand kiya, to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam tumhare liye hamare zimme koi cheez nahin, to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas ayi aur aap se us ka zikr kiya, to aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye is par nafaqa nahin. Aur aap ne use hukm diya ke Umm Sharik ke ghar mein iddat guzare, phir farmaya: Woh aisi aurat hai jis ke paas mere sahaba ate jate hain, pas Ibn Umm Maktum ke paas iddat guzaro, kyunke woh nabina shakhs hai tum apne kapde utar sakogi, phir jab tum halal ho jao to mujhe khabar dena. Us ne kaha: Phir jab main halal hui to main ne aap se zikr kiya ke Mu'awiyah ibn Abi Sufyan aur Abu Jahm ne mujhe nikah ka paigham diya hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha Abu Jahm to woh apne kandhe se apna asa nahin hatata, aur raha Mu'awiyah to woh muflis hai us ke paas maal nahin, Usamah ibn Zayd se nikah kar lo. Us ne kaha: To main ne use napasand kiya, phir aap ne farmaya: Usamah ibn Zayd se nikah kar lo. To main ne us se nikah kar liya, to Allah ne is mein khair rakhi aur main is se khush hui."
"790","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Abi Bakr ibn Abi al-Jahm ibn Sukhayr al-Adawi se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Fatimah bint Qays Raziallahu anha ko kehte hue suna: Beshak us ke shauhar ne use teen talaqein di, to Rasulullah ne us ke liye na rihaish muqarrar ki aur na nafaqa. Dar al-Kutub al-Ilmiyyah ke nuskhe mein isi tarah hai, aur durust hai: (Abi Bakr ibn Abi al-Jahm: Sukhayr)."
"791","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - ya'ni Ibn Sa'id - ne humein khabar di ke Sulayman ibn Yasar ne unhein khabar di, ke Abu Salamah ne unhein khabar di, ke woh aur Ibn Abbas Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ke paas jama hue, to unhon ne us mard ka zikr kiya jo biwi ko chhod kar faut ho jaye phir woh us ke baad chand raaton mein bacha jane, to Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Us ka halal hona dono muddaton mein se akhri (ke guzarne) par hai, aur Abu Salamah ne kaha: Jab woh waza-e-hamal kar le to woh halal ho gayi. To un dono ne is bare mein apas mein ikhtilaf kiya, to Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Main apne bhatije ke sath hun - ya'ni: Abu Salamah - to unhon ne Kurayb mawla Ibn Abbas ko Umm Salamah ki taraf bhej kar sawal karwaya, to Umm Salamah ne zikr kiya ke Subay'ah bint al-Harith al-Aslamiyyah - us ka shauhar faut hua aur us ne us ke baad chand raaton mein bacha jana - aur Banu Abd al-Dar ke ek mard jis ki kunyat Abu al-Sanabil ibn Ba'kak hai ne use nikah ka paigham diya aur use khabar di ke woh halal ho chuki hai, aur us ne us ke siwa dusre se nikah karna chaha, to Abu al-Sanabil ne us se kaha: Tum halal nahin hui, to Subay'ah ne us ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya, to aap ne use nikah karne ka hukm diya."
"792","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mahmud ibn Ghaylan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan al-Thawri se, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman mawla Al Talhah se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, al-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwidh se, ke us ne al-Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein khul' kiya, to al-Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use hukm diya - ya use hukm diya gaya - ke woh ek haiz se iddat guzare."
"793","Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar aur Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah aur Yawm-e-Akhir par iman rakhne wali kisi aurat ke liye halal nahin hai ke woh kisi mayyit par teen raaton se zyada ihdad kare. Aur al-Attar ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamen khabar di."
"794","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, az Shubah, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ibn Nafi ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zaynab bint Umm Salamah, az Umm Habibah Raziallahu anha se (riwayat hai ke) unka koi nasabi ya qaribi rishtedar faut ho gaya to unhon ne sufr (zard khizab) mangwaya aur apne dono baazuon par mala aur kaha: Maine Rasulullah se suna - ya unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah ne farmaya - (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam): Allah aur Yawm-e-Akhir par iman rakhne wali kisi aurat ke liye halal nahin hai ke woh kisi mayyit par teen se zyada ihdad kare siwaye shauhar ke, pas woh us par chaar mahine das din ihdad karegi."
"795","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hamen khabar di, az Hisham, az Hafsah, az Umm Atiyyah, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya."
"796","Aur Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya - aur yeh unhi ki hadees hai - unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hassan ne hamen khabar di, az Hafsah bint Sirin, az Umm Atiyyah Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah aur Yawm-e-Akhir par iman rakhne wali kisi aurat ke liye halal nahin hai ke woh kisi mayyit par teen se zyada ihdad kare siwaye shauhar ke, pas woh us par chaar mahine das din ihdad karegi, aur na surma lagaye, aur na ranga hua kapda pehne siwaye asb ke kapde ke, aur khushbu ko haath na lagaye siwaye apne tuhr ke aakhir me."
"797","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Ismail ibn Abi al-Harith ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Yahya - woh Ibn Abi Bukayr hain - ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibrahim ibn Tahman, unhon ne kaha: Budayl ne mujh se bayan kiya, az Hasan ibn Muslim, az Safiyyah bint Shaybah, az Umm Salamah se jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja hain, unhon ne Nabi se (riwayat kiya ke Aap ne) farmaya: Jis aurat ka shauhar faut ho gaya ho woh usfur se range hue kapdon me se na pehne, na mumashshaqah, na zewar, na mehndi lagaye aur na surma lagaye."
"798","Unhon ne kaha: Aur Budayl ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Hasan ibn Muslim ne kaha: Maine un logon ko sabr (ke istemal) me koi harj samajhte hue nahin dekha."
"799","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, az Shubah, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ibn Nafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, az Zaynab bint Umm Salamah, az unki walida se (riwayat hai) ke ek aurat ka shauhar faut ho gaya to uski aankh me shikayat ho gayi, to logon ne iska zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya aur surme ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Hamen uski aankh par khauf hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se ek (aurat) apne ghar me apne badtareen kapdon me - ya (farmaya) apne kapdon me apne badtareen ghar me - ek saal tak rehti thi, phir jab kutta guzarta to woh gobar phenk deti thi, pas (aisa) nahin, (iddat) chaar mahine das din hai."
"800","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, az Sa'id, az Matar, az Raja ibn Haywah, az Qabisah ibn Dhuayb, az Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhu, unhon ne kaha: Hamare Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki sunnat ko ham par mushtabah na karo, umm walad ki iddat us aurat ki iddat hai jiska shauhar faut ho gaya ho."
"801","(79) Diyat ka bab: Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hamen khabar di, az Iyad ibn Laqit, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rimthah al-Taymi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur mere saath mera ek beta tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara beta hai? Maine kaha: Main iski gawahi deta hun, Aap ne farmaya: Na woh tumhare jurm ka bojh uthayega aur na tum uske jurm ka bojh uthaoge. Unhon ne kaha: Aur maine safed balon par surkh khizab dekha."
"802","Abu Bakr Muhammad ibn Ishaq al-Saghani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne mujh se bayan kiya, az Yahya ibn Sa'id, az Amr ibn Shuayb, az unke walid, az unke dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke khoon barabar hain, un me se adna shakhs bhi unki taraf se aman deta hai, aur woh ghairon ke muqable me ek haath hain."
"803","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Salih ne hamen khabar di, az Simak, az Ikrimah, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Qurayzah aur Nadir (do qabile) the, aur Nadir Qurayzah se zyada muazzaz tha, pas jab Nadir ka koi shakhs Qurayzah ke kisi shakhs ko qatal karta to sau wasq khajoor diyat me di jati, aur jab Qurayzah ka koi shakhs Banu Nadir ke kisi shakhs ko qatal karta to uske badle use qatal kiya jata. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) mabus hue to Nadir ke ek shakhs ne Qurayzah ke ek shakhs ko qatal kar diya, to unhon ne kaha: Use hamare hawale karo taake hum use qatal karen, to unhon ne kaha: Hamare aur tumhare darmiyan Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hain, pas woh Aap ke paas aaye to Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Aur agar aap faisla karen to unke darmiyan insaf se faisla karen, unhon ne kaha: Pas insaf (yeh hai ke) jaan ke badle jaan hai, phir nazil hua: Kya woh jahiliyyat ke hukm ke talabgar hain."
"804","(80) Bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, az Khalid al-Hadhdha, az Qasim ibn Rabiah, az Uqbah ibn Aws, az Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Jahiliyyat ki har masurah baat jo khoon ya maal ke bare me shumar ki jati ya pukari jati thi mere qadmon tale hai, siwaye hajiyon ko pani pilane aur Baitullah ki nigahbani ke. Phir farmaya: Khabardar! Khata (ke qatal) ki diyat jo kode ya asa se ho: sau oont hain, un me se chalis aisi hain jinke peton me unke bachche hon."
"805","Ibrahim ibn Abdullah al-Naysaburi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne humein khabar di, Haris ibn Fudail se, Sufyan ibn Abi al-Awja al-Sulami se, Abu Shuraih al-Khuzai se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs khoon ya khabl me mubtela ho - aur khabl se murad zakhm hai - to use teen me se ek ka ikhtiyar hai, phir agar woh chauthi cheez chahe to us ke haath ko rok do, yaani is darmiyan ke woh qisas le, ya muaf kare, ya aql (diyat) le. Phir agar us ne us me se kuch le liya, phir us ke baad zyadati ki to us ke liye aag hai, us me hamesha hamesha rehne wala hai."
"806","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Mujahid ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Bani Israil me qisas tha aur un me diyat nahi thi, to Allah ne is ummat se farmaya: Aey iman walon! Tum par maqtuleen me qisas farz kiya gaya hai, aazad ke badle aazad aur ghulam ke badle ghulam aur aurat ke badle aurat, phir jise us ke bhai ki taraf se kuch muaf kar diya jaye. Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Pas muafi ye hai ke woh amd (jaan boojh kar qatl) me diyat qabool kar le, phir maaruf ke sath pairwi karna aur ehsan ke sath us ki taraf ada karna lazim hai. Unhon ne kaha: Is (wali-e-maqtool) par hai ke woh maaruf ki pairwi kare, aur is (qatil) par hai ke woh ehsan ke sath ada kare, ye tumhare Rabb ki taraf se takhfeef hai, us se jo tum se pehle logon par likha gaya tha, phir jo us ke baad zyadati kare to us ke liye dardnak azab hai."
"807","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib aur Abu Salamah ibn Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Hudhail ki do auraton ne aapas me ladai ki, to un me se ek ne dusri ko pathar mara to use aur jo us ke pet me tha use qatl kar diya, pas woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas muqaddama laye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke us ke janin ki diyat ek ghurrah hai, ek ghulam ya laundi, aur aurat ki diyat ka faisla us ki aqilah par kiya, aur us ke bete aur jo un ke sath the unhein us ka waris banaya. Hamal ibn al-Nabighah al-Hudhali ne kaha: Aey Allah ke Rasul! Main us ka jurmana kaise dun jo na piya na khaya, na bola na roya? To aisi cheez ka khoon raigan hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye to kahinon ke bhaiyon me se hai, us ke saj' (qafiyabandi wale kalam) ki wajah se."
"808","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Muharibi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusait se, Ibn Abi Hadrad al-Aslami se, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ek sariyyah me bheja, aur us sariyyah me Abu Qatadah al-Ansari aur Muhallim ibn Jaththamah ibn Qais the aur main un me tha, pas jab hum is haal me the ke achanak hamare paas se Amir ibn al-Adbat al-Ashjai guzra, to us ne humein Islam ke salam ke sath salam kiya, to hum us se ruk gaye, phir Muhallim ibn Jaththamah ne us par hamla karke use qatl kar diya, aur us ka ek oont aur doodh ka ek mashkiza jo us ke sath tha loot liya, phir jab hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye to hamare baare me Quran nazil hua: Aey iman walon! Jab tum Allah ki raah me safar karo to tehqeeq kar liya karo, aayat ke aakhir tak."
"809","al-Muharibi ne kaha: Ibn Ishaq ne kaha: Mujhe Muhammad ibn Ja'far ibn al-Zubair ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ziyad ibn Damrah ibn Sa'd al-Sulami ko Urwah ibn al-Zubair se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid aur mere dada ne bayan kiya, aur woh dono Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Hunain me hazir hue the, un dono ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zuhar padhi, phir ek darakht ke saye me baith gaye, to un ke paas al-Aqra' ibn Habis aur Uyaynah ibn Badr aaye. Uyaynah al-Ashjai ke khoon ka mutalba kar raha tha aur al-Aqra' us ki taraf se difa' kar raha tha, pas dono ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne lambi bahas ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Balke tum diyat qabool kar lo, pachaas hamare is safar me aur pachaas jab hum laut aayein. Pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un se kehte rahe hatta ke unhon ne diyat qabool kar li, phir jab unhon ne diyat qabool kar li to unhon ne kaha: Tumhara sathi kahan hai taake Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke liye maghfirat ki dua karein? To ek lamba qad wala shakhs khada hua, us par ek hullah tha, us me qatl ke liye taiyyar ho kar aaya tha, hatta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne baith gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main Muhallim ibn Jaththamah hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah! Muhallim ibn Jaththamah ko mat bakhsh! To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne se khada hua, jabke woh apni chadar ke kinare se apne aansu ponchh raha tha."
"810","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Ubaid ibn Nadlah se, Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se riwayat hai: Do auratein thin jo sautan thin, to un me se ek ne dusri ko pathar ya khaime ke sutoon se mara to us ka hamal saqit ho gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us me ek ghurrah, ek ghulam ya laundi ka faisla kiya, aur use us aurat ke asabah par dala."
"811","Abu Bakr Muhammad ibn Abi Khalid al-Tabari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har batn (khandan) par uqoolah (diyat ki adaaigi ki zimmedari) hai."
"812","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl - yaani Ibn Musa - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ibn Waqid ne humein khabar di, Yazid al-Nahwi se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon ki diyat barabar hai, har ungli me das oont hain."
"813","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'alla ibn Asad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid al-Wasiti ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain al-Mu'allim ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ungliyon me das das hain."
"814","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh aur yeh barabar hain, aur unhon ne apne angoothe aur chhoti ungli ko milaya - yaani diyat me -."
"815","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Samad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh aur yeh barabar hain, aur yeh aur yeh barabar hain, chhoti ungli aur angootha, aur daadh aur saamne ka daant."
"816","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke liye ek kitab likhi, us me tha: Aur taang me pachaas hain, aur haath me pachaas hain, aur haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon me un me se har ungli me das oont hain, aur naak me jab woh jad se kaat di jaye to sau oont hain, aur daant me paanch oont hain."
"817","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Tabba' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abbad - yani Ibn al-Awwam - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Husayn al-Mu'allim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ungliyon mein das das (hain) aur muwazziha (haddi zahir kar dene wale) zakhmon mein paanch paanch (hain)."
"818","Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se (rivayat kiya) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne muwazziha (haddi khol dene wale zakhm) mein paanch oonton ka faisla farmaya aur ma'moomah (dimagh tak pahunchne wale zakhm) mein diyat ke tihai ka (faisla farmaya)."
"819","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mutarrif ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne humen khabar di, Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se (rivayat kiya) ke Sa'd ibn Ubadah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kaha: Aap ka kya khayal hai, agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi mard ko paun to kya main use mohlat dun hatta ke main chaar gawah le aaun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"820","Muhammad ibn Muslim ibn Warah al-Razi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Sa'id ibn Sabiq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Abi Qays ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mansur - yani Ibn al-Mu'tamir - se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhuma se (rivayat kiya), unhon ne kaha: Banu Mudlij ke ek shakhs ki ek jariya (londi) thi, us se us ke han ek beta paida hua aur woh us (londi) se khidmat leta tha, pas jab ladka jawan hua to ek din us (aurat) ko bulaya gaya, to us (shakhs) ne kaha: Aisa aur aisa karo, to ladke ne kaha: Woh tumhare paas nahin aayegi, tum kab tak meri walida ko hukm dete rahoge? Unhon ne kaha: To us ka walid ghusse mein aaya, to us ne apni talwar us par phenk kar mari, to us ki tang ya us ke ilawa koi hissa zakhmi hua aur kat gaya, to ladke ka khoon beh gaya aur woh mar gaya. Pas woh apni qaum ke chand afrad ke sath Umar Raziallahu anhu ke paas gaya to unhon ne kaha: Ae apni jaan ke dushman, kya tu hi hai jis ne apne bete ko qatl kiya? Agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko yeh farmate hue na suna hota: Baap se bete ke (qatl ke badle) mein qisas nahin liya jayega, to main tujhe qatl kar deta, us ki diyat lao, unhon ne kaha: To woh un ke paas ek sau bees ya ek sau tees oont laya, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne un mein se sau oont muntakhab kiye, pas unhen us ke warison ko de diya aur us ke baap ko chhod diya."
"821","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se (rivayat kiya) ke ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke hujre mein ek surakh se jhanka aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas lohe ki kanghi thi jis se Aap apne sar ko khujla rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar mujhe maloom hota ke tum dekh rahe ho to main ise tumhari aankh mein chubho deta, ijazat talab karna to nazar hi ki wajah se muqarrar kiya gaya hai."
"822","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, unhon ne al-Nadr ibn Anas se, unhon ne Bashir ibn Nahik se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se (rivayat kiya) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs logon ke ghar mein un ki ijazat ke baghair jhanke, phir woh us ki aankh phod den to us ke liye na diyat hai aur na qisas."
"823","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Isa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se (rivayat kiya) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab koi shakhs tumhare ghar mein tum par jhanke, phir tum ne use kankari mari aur us ki aankh phod di to tum par koi gunah nahin."
"824","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata ko khabar dete hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Safwan ibn Ya'la ne khabar di, unhon ne Ya'la ibn Umayyah se (rivayat kiya), unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath ghazwa-e-usra (tangi wale ghazwe) mein jihad kiya."
"825","Aur Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se hadees bayan ki - aur yeh hadees unhi ke alfaz hain - unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ibn Jurayj ne khabar di, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se (rivayat hai) ke Safwan ibn Ya'la ibn Umayyah ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ya'la ibn Umayyah se (rivayat kiya), unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath ghazwa-e-usra mein jihad kiya, aur woh mere nazdeek mera sab se mazboot amal tha, aur mera ek ujrati mazdoor tha, to us ne ek shakhs se ladai ki, to un mein se ek ne dusre ko kaat liya, to us ne apni ungli khinch li to us ka agla daant gir gaya, to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne us ke daant ko zae' qaraar diya. Ata ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai ke Safwan ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya woh apna hath tumhare munh mein chhode rakhe ke tum use kaato jaise saanḍ kaatta hai?"
"826","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada Raziallahu anhu se (rivayat kiya), unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) fath ke saal Makkah mein dakhil hue to hum mein khateeb ki haisiyat se khade hue. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Main ne ise al-Siyar mein likh diya hai."
"827","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mutarrif se, unhon ne al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne Abu Juhayfah se (rivayat kiya), unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali se kaha: Kya tumhare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf se Quran ke siwa koi cheez hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, qasam us zaat ki jis ne daane ko phaada aur jaan ko paida kiya, magar yeh ke Allah apne bande ko apni kitab mein samajh ata farmaye, aur jo is sahife mein hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aur is sahife mein kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Diyat aur qaidi ko chhudana, aur yeh ke koi Musalman kafir ke (badle) mein qatl nahin kiya jayega."
"828","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Jab main ne pehli martaba al-Zuhri ko dekha to main ne un se is hadees ke bare mein sawal kiya to unhon ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Sa'id aur Abu Salamah ne hadees bayan ki ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke Aap ne farmaya: Be-zaban janwar ka zakhm zae' (muaf) hai, aur ma'dan (kaan ke nuqsan) ka (muamla) zae' hai, aur kunwan (ke nuqsan) ka (muamla) zae' hai, aur rikaz (dafina) mein panchwan hissa hai."
"829","Ibn Al-Muqri ne kaha: Aur unhon ne hum se ek dusri martaba yeh hadees bayan ki to us me yeh nahin kaha: aur kunwaan jubar hai."
"830","Ibn Al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib aur Haram ibn Sa'd se: ke Al-Bara ki ek oontni kisi qaum ke bagh me dakhil hui aur us ne fasad kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke amwal ki hifazat din me un ke malikon par hai, aur maweshiyon walon par us ka zaman hai jo wo raat me nuqsan pahunchayen. Ibn Al-Muqri ne kaha: Aur kabhi unhon ne kaha: maweshiyon walon par us ka zaman hai jo un ke maweshi raat me fasad karen. Aur ek martaba kaha: jo un ke maweshi raat me nuqsan pahunchayen."
"831","(81) Qasamah ke bare me bab: Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Abd Al-Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ibn Abd Al-Rahman aur Sulayman ibn Yasar ne mujhe khabar di, Nabi ke Sahaba me se Ansar me se ek shakhs se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne qasamah ko usi par barqarar rakha jis par wo jahiliyyat me thi."
"832","Ibn Al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yahya se - yaani Ibn Sa'id - Bushayr ibn Yasar se, Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Sahl qatl kiye hue paye gaye - aur ek martaba kaha: murda - Khaybar ke kunwon me se ek kunwe me, ya us ke chashmon me se ek chashme me, to un ke chacha aur un ke bhai Abd Al-Rahman ibn Sahl - aur unhon ne Badr me haziri di thi - Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aaye to un ke bhai Abd Al-Rahman ne guftagu ki to Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Bade ko, bade ko. To un ke chacha Muhayyisah ne guftagu ki, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum ne Abdullah ko Khaybar ke kunwon me se ek kunwe me qatl kiya hua paya, Aap ne farmaya: To tum me se pachas qasam khayenge ke Yahud ne use qatl kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To hum us par kaise qasam khayen jo hum ne dekha hi nahin? Aap ne farmaya: To Yahud pachas se tumhen bari kar denge. Unhon ne kaha: Hum un par kaise raazi hon jabke wo mushrik hain? - Aur Ibn Al-Muqri ne kaha: Aur ek dusri martaba kaha -: To Aap ne farmaya: Yahud pachas se tumhen bari karenge, wo halaf uthayenge ke unhon ne use qatl nahin kiya aur wo kisi qatil ko nahin jante. To unhon ne kaha: Hum mushrik qaum ki qasmon par kaise raazi hon? Aap ne farmaya: To tum me se pachas qasam khayenge ke unhon ne use qatl kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Hum kaise halaf uthayen jabke hum ne dekha hi nahin? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki diyyat ada ki, to us me se ek jawan oontni ne mujhe laat mari."
"833","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Malik ibn Anas ko kehte hue suna: Abu Layla ibn Abdillah ibn Abd Al-Rahman ibn Sahl ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah se, unhon ne unhen khabar di, apni qaum ke bade buzurgon se, ke Abdullah ibn Sahl aur Muhayyisah Khaybar ki taraf gaye us tangdasti ki wajah se jo unhen pesh aayi thi, to Muhayyisah ke pas aakar khabar di gayi ke Abdullah ibn Sahl qatl kar diye gaye hain aur unhen ek chashme ya kunwe me phenk diya gaya hai, to wo Yahud ke pas aaye aur kaha: Allah ki qasam tum hi ne use qatl kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam hum ne use qatl nahin kiya, phir wo wapas aaye hatta ke apni qaum ke pas pahunche aur unhen wo baat bayan ki, phir wo aur un ke bhai Huwayyisah - aur wo bade the - aur Abd Al-Rahman ibn Sahl aaye, to Muhayyisah guftagu karne lage aur wahi the jo Khaybar me the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Muhayyisah se farmaya: Bade ko, bade ko - yaani umar ko chaha - to Huwayyisah ne guftagu ki phir Muhayyisah ne guftagu ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya to wo tumhare sathi ki diyyat denge, ya jang ka elan karenge. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen is bare me khat likha, to unhon ne likha: Beshak Allah ki qasam hum ne use qatl nahin kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Huwayyisah aur Muhayyisah aur Abd Al-Rahman se farmaya: Tum halaf uthao aur apne sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq ban jao. Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: To Yahud tumhare liye halaf uthayenge. Unhon ne kaha: Wo Musalman nahin hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki diyyat ada ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki taraf sau oontniyan bhejin hatta ke wo un ke ghar me dakhil kar di gayin. Sahl ne kaha: To us me se ek surkh oontni ne mujhe laat mari."
"834","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Al-Nu'man ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Bushayr ibn Yasar se, Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah aur Rafi' ibn Khadij se, ke un dono ne unhen hadees bayan ki ke Abdullah ibn Sahl aur Muhayyisah ibn Mas'ud Khaybar aaye ek hajat ke liye, to wo us ke khajur ke baghon me juda ho gaye, to Abdullah ibn Sahl qatl kar diye gaye to un ke bhai Abd Al-Rahman ibn Sahl aur un ke do chachazad bhai Muhayyisah aur Huwayyisah ibna Mas'ud Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aaye - to Abd Al-Rahman guftagu karne lage, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Bade ko muqaddam karo - yaani guftagu me awwal bade shuru karen - aur Abd Al-Rahman apne dono sathiyon se chhote the - to un dono ne apne sathi ke qatl ke bare me guftagu ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne maqtul aur apne sathi ke mustahiq ban jao tum me se pachas ki qasmon se, to unhon ne kaha: Hum ne hazir hokar nahin dekha, to hum kaise halaf uthayen? To Aap ne farmaya: Yahud tumhen bari karenge un me se pachas ki qasmon se. To unhon ne kaha: Kafir qaum hain. Aap ne farmaya: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ki diyyat ada ki. Sahl ne kaha: To main un oonton me se ek oontni tak pahuncha jis ne mujhe un ke mirabad me se ek laat mari."
"835","(82) Hudud ke bare me bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Abi Al-Azhar ne hum se hadees bayan ki Baghdad me, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Al-Mubarak ne humen khabar di, Isa ibn Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ibn Yazid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki ke unhon ne Abu Zur'ah ibn Amr ibn Jarir se suna, ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se suna kehte the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek hadd jo zameen me qayam ki jaye apne ahl ke liye is se behtar hai ke un par tees subhon tak barish barsai jaye."
"836","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se hadees bayan ki Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ki parda-poshi kare Allah us ki parda-poshi farmayega duniya aur akhirat me."
"837","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Yazid aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Abu Idris se, Ubadah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas ek majlis me the, to Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se bai'at karo is par ke tum Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko sharik nahin karoge, aur na chori karoge, aur na zina karoge - unhon ne un par aayat parhi - to tum me se jis ne wafa ki to us ka ajr Allah par hai, aur jis ne is me se kisi cheez ka irtikab kiya phir us par use saza di gayi to wo us ke liye kaffara hai, aur jis ne is me se kisi cheez ka irtikab kiya phir Allah ne use chhupa liya to wo Allah ke supurd hai agar chahe use bakhsh de aur agar chahe use azab de."
"838","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ek Makhzumiyyah aurat thi jo saman udhar leti thi phir inkar kar deti thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ka hath katne ka hukm diya, to us ke ghar wale Usamah ke pas aaye aur un se baat ki, to Usamah ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se baat ki, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ai Usamah, kya main tumhen dekh raha hun ke tum Allah ki hudud me se ek hadd me sifarish kar rahe ho? Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khutba dene ke liye khade hue aur farmaya: Tum se pehle log isi wajah se halak hue ke jab un me se sharif chori karta to use chhod dete, aur jab un me se kamzor chori karta to use kat dete, aur us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath me meri jaan hai agar Fatimah bint Muhammad hotin to main zaroor us ka hath kat deta. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne Makhzumiyyah ka hath kaat diya."
"839","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ayb ibn Al-Layth se, unhon ne apne walid se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah ibn Al-Zubayr se, Aishah se jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja hain, Raziallahu anha: ke Quraysh ko us Makhzumiyyah ke muamle ne fikr me dal diya jis ne chori ki thi, to unhon ne kaha: Kaun us ke bare me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se baat karega? Aur unhon ne hadees bayan ki."
"840","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Al-Walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Layth ne hum se hadees bayan ki - yaani Ibn Sa'd - Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: ke Quraysh ko us aurat ke muamle ne fikr me dal diya jis ne chori ki thi."
"841","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko do muamlat ke darmiyan kabhi ikhtiyar nahin diya gaya magar Aap ne un dono me se zyada aasan ko ikhtiyar farmaya, aur Aap ne kisi shakhs se kisi zulm ka badla nahin liya magar Allah ki hudood me se kisi cheez ki wajah se, to usay kisi ek ke liye bhi chhora nahin jata."
"842","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Teen afrad se qalam utha liya gaya hai: sonay wale se hatta ke woh jaag jaye, aur chhote bachche se hatta ke woh bara ho jaye, aur majnoon se hatta ke woh aql hasil kar le."
"843","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Uhud ke din ladai ke liye mera muaina farmaya jabke main chaudah saal ka tha to mujhe ijazat nahin di, phir jab Khandaq ka din tha to mera muaina farmaya jabke main pandrah saal ka tha to mujhe ijazat de di, unhon ne kaha: Phir main Umar Raziallahu anhu ke paas aaya, aur Umar us waqt khalifa thay, to maine un se yeh hadees bayan ki, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak yeh chhote aur bare ke darmiyan hadd hai, phir unhon ne apne amilon ko likha ke pandrah saal wale ka wazifa muqarrar karo, aur jo us se kam ho usay ayal me shamil karo."
"844","(83) Bikr aur thayyib zani ki hadd ka bab: Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ibn Bashir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mansur ne hamen khabar di, al-Hasan se, Hittan ibn Abdillah al-Raqashi se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh se lo, mujh se lo, Allah ne un ke liye rasta bana diya hai, thayyib ko sau kode phir rajm, aur bikr ko bikr ke sath sau kode aur ek saal ke liye jila watni."
"845","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Abu Hurayrah aur Zayd ibn Khalid aur Shibl se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas thay ke ek shakhs aaya to us ne kaha: Main Aap ko Allah ki qasam de kar kehta hun ke hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab ke sath hi faisla farmayen, to us ka fareeq uth khada hua aur woh us se zyada samajhdar tha, to us ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha, hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab ke sath faisla farmayen aur mujhe ijazat den, Aap ne farmaya: Kaho, us ne kaha: Mera beta is shakhs ke paas mazdoor tha, aur us ne is ki biwi se zina kiya, to mujhe bataya gaya ke mere bete par rajm hai to maine us se sau bakriyan aur ek khadim de kar fidya diya, phir maine ilm walon me se kuch mardon se pucha to unhon ne mujhe bataya ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jila watni hai, aur is shakhs ki biwi par rajm hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Main tum dono ke darmiyan Allah ki kitab ke sath zaroor faisla farmaunga, sau bakriyan aur khadim wapas honge, aur tumhare bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jila watni hai, aur aye Unays, subah is shakhs ki biwi ke paas jao, phir agar woh iqrar kar le to usay rajm karo, to us ne iqrar kar liya to us ne usay rajm kiya."
"846","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Mujhe khadsha hai ke logon par zamana lamba ho jayega hatta ke kehne wala kahega: Hum Allah ki kitab me rajm nahin paate, phir woh us farz ko chhor kar gumrah ho jayenge jo Allah ne nazil farmaya, khabardar, beshak rajm haqq hai us par jo zina kare jab woh muhsan ho aur gawahi qayam ho jaye ya hamal ho ya iqrar, khabardar, beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne rajm farmaya aur hum ne Aap ke sath rajm kiya."
"847","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se: Ke Aslam qabile ka ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne Aap ke samne zina ka iqrar kiya, phir us ne iqrar kiya to Aap ne us se munh pher liya, phir us ne iqrar kiya to Aap ne us se munh pher liya, hatta ke us ne apne khilaf chaar martaba gawahi di, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tujhe junoon hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tu muhsan hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to usay namazgah me rajm kiya gaya, phir jab patharon ne usay takleef di to woh bhaag gaya, phir usay pakad liya gaya to usay rajm kiya gaya hatta ke woh faut ho gaya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke liye bhalai farmayi, aur us par namaz nahin parhi."
"848","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf al-Sulami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Samit jo Abu Hurayrah ke bhatijay hain unhon ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: al-Aslami Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne apne khilaf gawahi di ke us ne chaar martaba haraam taur par ek aurat se sohbat ki, har martaba Aap us se munh pher lete thay, phir paanchwin martaba Aap us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue to farmaya: Kya tune us se jima kiya? Us ne kaha: Haan, Aap ne farmaya: Hatta ke tera woh uzw us ke us uzw me ghayab ho gaya jaise surma lagane wali salai surmedani me aur rassi kunwen me ghayab ho jati hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, maine us se haraam taur par woh kiya jo mard apni biwi se halal taur par karta hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tu is baat se kya chahta hai? Us ne kaha: Main chahta hun ke Aap mujhe pak kar den, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to usay rajm kiya gaya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Aap ke sahaba me se do mardon ko suna jin me se ek apne sathi se keh raha tha: Dekho is shakhs ko jis par Allah ne parda dala tha phir us ka nafs usay na chhor saka hatta ke usay kutte ki tarah rajm kiya gaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un dono se khamosh rahe, phir kuch der chale hatta ke ek gadhe ki murdar par se guzre jis ki taang uthi hui thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Fulan aur fulan kahan hain? To unhon ne kaha: Hum yeh dono hain - aur al-Sulami ne zayn kaha - aye Allah ke Rasul! To Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur is gadhe ki murdar me se khao, to unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Nabi, Allah Aap ko bakhshe, aur kaun is me se khayega? Aap ne farmaya: Jo tum ne abhi apne bhai ki izzat me se liya hai woh murdar khane se zyada sakht hai, aur us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath me meri jaan hai beshak woh is waqt Jannat ki nehron me hai un me ghota laga raha hai, aur al-Sulami ne kaha: yanqamis fiha."
"849","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Juhaynah qabile ki ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne zina ka iqrar kiya, to us ne kaha: Main hamila hun, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke wali ko bulaya aur farmaya: Us ke sath husn-e-sulook kar, phir jab woh waza-e-hamal kar le to mujhe khabar dena, to us ne aisa hi kiya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to us par us ke kapde kas kar bandh diye gaye, phir us ke rajm ka hukm diya to usay rajm kiya gaya, phir Aap ne us par namaz parhi, to Umar ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne usay rajm kiya phir us par namaz parhte hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Us ne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar woh Madinah walon me se sattar afrad ke darmiyan taqseem kar di jaye to unhen kafi ho jaye, aur kya tune is se afzal paya ke us ne Allah ke liye apni jaan de di."
"850","Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Qazzaz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Suddi se, Sad ibn Ubaydah se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Ali Raziallahu anhu ne hamen khutba diya aur farmaya: Aye logon, apne ghulamon par hudood qayam karo, un me se jo muhsan ho aur jo muhsan na ho, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki ek londi ne zina kiya, to Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke usay kode lagaun, to main us ke paas aaya to woh nifas se qareebi ahd me thi, to mujhe khadsha hua ke agar maine usay kode lagaye to woh mar jayegi - ya unhon ne kaha: main usay qatl kar dunga - to maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se mulaqat ki aur un se us ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tune acha kiya."
"851","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Umamah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba me se Ansar me se ek ne unhen khabar di: Ke un me se ek shakhs bimar hua hatta ke laghar ho gaya, us ki khaal haddi par reh gayi, phir un me se kisi ki ek londi dakhil hui to woh us ki taraf maail hua aur us se sohbat ki, phir jab us ki qaum ke kuch mard us ki ayadat ke liye us ke paas dakhil hue to us ne unhen us ki khabar di, aur kaha: Mere liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se fatwa talab karo, kyunke main us londi se sohbat kar baitha hun jo mere paas dakhil hui thi, to unhon ne us ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, hum ne logon me se kisi me aisi takleef nahin dekhi jaisi isay hai, agar hum usay Aap ke paas uthakar layen to us ki haddiyan bikhar jayengi, woh khaal par haddi ke siwa kuch nahin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen sau tehnion ka hukm diya, to unhon ne usay ek hi zarb lagayi."
"852","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Jurayj ko Abu al-Zubayr se, unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se hadees bayan karte hue suna, ke ek shakhs ne zina kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to usay hadd ke kode lagaye gaye, phir Aap ko khabar di gayi ke woh muhsan tha to Aap ne us ke bare me hukm diya to usay rajm kiya gaya, Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Usay Uthman ibn Umar, Abu Asim aur un ke ilawa digar ne rivayat kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne zina kiya to usay kode lagaye gaye, aur unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka zikr nahin kiya."
"853","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa - ya'ni Ibn Yunus - ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ma'iz al-Aslami Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Beshak main ne zina kiya hai, to Aap ne us se e'raaz farmaya, yahan tak ke us ne ye baat chaar martaba kahi, to Aap ne farmaya: Use le jao aur use rajm karo. Phir woh gaya, phir jab use rajm kiya gaya aur us ne patharon ki takleef mehsoos ki to woh tez daudta hua bhaag khada hua, phir us ka guzar ek shakhs par hua jis ke paas oont ka jabda tha to us ne use mara aur use qatl kar diya. Phir unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us ke bhaagne ka zikr kiya jab us ne patharon ka mass mehsoos kiya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: To tum ne use kyun na chhod diya tha?"
"854","Rabi' ibn Sulaiman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ibn Bilal ne mujhe khabar di, Amr maula al-Muttalib se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise tum qaum-e-Lut ka amal karte hue pao to fa'il aur maf'ul bihi (dono) ko qatl kar do."
"855","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah ibn Abdillah ibn Utbah se, Abu Hurairah aur Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se lauNdi ke baare me poochha gaya jab woh zina kare aur muhsana na ho, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar woh zina kare to use kode lagao, phir agar woh zina kare to use kode lagao, phir agar woh zina kare to use kode lagao, phir agar woh zina kare to use bech do khwaah ek rassi ke badle hi ho. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Main nahin jaanta teesri ke ba'd ya chauthi ke ba'd (farmaya), aur zafeer se murad rassi hai."
"856","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ayyub se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek Yahudi mard aur ek Yahudi aurat ko rajm kiya."
"857","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Hammad ibn Talhah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Asbat - ya'ni Ibn Nasr - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Simak se, Alqamah ibn Wail se, un ke walid Wail ibn Hujr se ke ek aurat par ek mard ne subah ke andhere me zabardasti hamlah kiya jabke woh masjid ki taraf ja rahi thi - Ibn Yahya ne kaha: apne nafs par zabardasti jhelte hue - to us ne ek mard se madad maangi jo us par se guzra, aur us ka saathi bhaag gaya, phir us par kai afrad par mushtamil ek qaum ka guzar hua to us ne un se madad maangi to unhon ne usi ko pakad liya jis se us ne madad maangi thi aur doosra un se aage nikal gaya aur chala gaya, phir woh use us ki taraf kheench kar laye, to us ne kaha: Main to wahi hun jis ne tumhari madad ki thi aur doosra ja chuka hai. Phir woh use lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye, to us (aurat) ne Aap ko khabar di ke us ne us par hamlah kiya hai, aur qaum ne Aap ko khabar di ke unhon ne use daudte hue pakda hai. To us ne kaha: Main us ke saathi ke khilaf us ki madad kar raha tha, phir in logon ne mujhe pa liya aur mujhe pakad liya. To us (aurat) ne kaha: Us ne jhoot bola, wahi hai jis ne mujh par hamlah kiya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use le jao aur use rajm karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir logon me se ek mard khada hua aur us ne kaha: Use rajm na karo aur mujhe rajm karo, main hi hun jis ne us se ye fe'l kiya hai, phir us ne iqraar kar liya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas teen jama ho gaye: woh jis ne us par hamlah kiya tha, woh jis ne us ki madad ki thi, aur woh aurat, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahi tum to beshak Allah ne tumhe bakhsh diya hai. Aur us se jis ne us ki madad ki thi achhi baat farmai. Umar ne kaha: Us ko rajm karo jis ne zina ka iqraar kiya hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahin, beshak us ne Allah ki taraf tauba ki hai. Ibn Umair ne kaha, us me ye izafa karte hue: Agar ahl-e-Madinah - ya ahl-e-Yathrib - is jaisi tauba karte to un se qubool ki jaati. Phir Aap ne unhein chhod diya. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Is se un ki murad Ubaid ibn Umair hain."
"858","(84) Chori me haath kaatne ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Amrah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) chauthai deenar aur us se upar me (haath) kaatte the."
"859","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne humein khabar di, Ayyub se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek dhaal me (haath) kaata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi."
"860","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yahya se, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, un ke chacha Wasi' ibn Habban se, Rafi' ibn Khadij Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Na phal me (haath) kaatna hai aur na khajoor ke gude me."
"861","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith aur Hisham ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, Amr ibn Shu'aib se, un ke walid se, Abdillah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma se ke Muzainah ka ek mard Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, pahad me charti hui bakri ke baare me Aap kya farmate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh aur us jaisi (tawaan me) aur saza ke taur par maar hai, maweshiyon me se kisi cheez me (haath) kaatna nahin hai magar us me jise baada panah de phir woh dhaal ki qeemat ko pahunch jaye to us me haath kaatna hai, phir jo dhaal ki qeemat ko na pahunche to us me dogne ki jurmana aur saza ke taur par kode hain. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, latke hue phal ke baare me Aap kya farmate hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Woh aur us ke saath us jaisa dogna (tawaan me) aur saza ke taur par maar hai, aur phal me se kisi cheez me (haath) kaatna nahin hai magar us me jise khalihan panah de, phir jo khalihan se liya gaya aur dhaal ki qeemat ko pahunch gaya to us me kaatna hai, aur jo dhaal ki qeemat ko na pahunche to us me us jaisa jurmana aur saza ke taur par kode hain."
"862","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Harun ibn Ishaq aur Abu Zur'ah al-Razi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Talhah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Asbat se, Simak se, Humaid ibn ukht Safwan ibn Umayyah se, Safwan ibn Umayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid me soya hua tha - aur Harun ne kaha: masjid me baitha hua tha - tees dirham qeemat ki chaadar par, phir ek shakhs aaya aur us ne use mujh se uchak liya, phir woh shakhs pakda gaya, phir use lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas laya gaya to Aap ne us ke (haath) kaatne ka hukm diya, to main Aap ke paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Kya Aap use tees dirham ki wajah se kaatte hain? Main use us ke haath bechta hun aur use us ki qeemat udhaar deta hun. Aap ne farmaya: To ye us waqt kyun na hua jab tum use mere paas laye the is se pehle?"
"863","(85) Sharab peene wale ki hadd ka bab: Abu Ja'far al-Mukharrimi Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Ja'far ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, Qatadah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas ek shakhs laya gaya jis ne sharab pi thi, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne use apne paas maujood do khajoor ki chhadion se taqreeban chalees martaba mara, phir Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne usi tarah kiya, phir jab Umar Raziallahu anhu ka daur hua to unhon ne logon se mashwara kiya, to Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne kaha: Sab se halki hadd assi hai. Dar al-Kutub al-Ilmiyah ki taba'at me isi tarah hai, aur la'alla durust (Muhammad ibn Ja'far al-Hudhali) hai, Wallahu A'lam."
"864","Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahim al-Bazzar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shababab ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas ek shakhs laya gaya jis ne sharab pi thi, to Aap ne use do khajoor ki chhadion se chalees martaba mara, aur Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne aisa hi kiya, phir jab Umar Raziallahu anhu ka daur hua to unhon ne logon se mashwara kiya, to Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne un se kaha: Sab se halki hadd assi hai, to unhon ne aisa hi kiya."
"865","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se bayan kiya, Haris - yani Ibn Abdur Rahman - se, Abu Salama se, Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab woh nashay me madhosh ho to usay koray lagao, teen martaba, phir chauthi martaba me farmaya: to us ki gardan maar do."
"866","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Abdullah ibn Murra se, Masruq se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi musalman shakhs ka khoon halal nahin jo gawahi deta ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur ke main Allah ka Rasul hun, magar teen me se ek shakhs ki wajah se: jaan ke badle jaan, aur shadi shuda zani, aur apne deen ko chhorne wala jamaat se juda hone wala."
"867","(86) Amd ke zakhmon ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-Aqadi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurra - yani Ibn Khalid - ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad - woh Ibn Sirin hain - se, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Bakra ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se; aur Humayd ibn Abdur Rahman ne Abu Bakra Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hamen Yawm-un-Nahr me khutba diya to farmaya: Yeh kaun sa din hai? Hum ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul zyada jante hain, unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap khamosh rahe yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Aap is ka naam is ke naam ke baghair kisi aur naam se rakhenge, phir farmaya: Kya yeh Balda (shahar) nahin? Hum ne kaha: Kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: To beshak Allah ne tum par tumhare khoon aur tumhare maal haram kiye hain, jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat hai tumhare is mahine me tumhare is shahar me, us din tak jab tum apne Rab se miloge, khabardar! Kya main ne pahuncha diya? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah! Gawah reh, chahiye ke hazir ghayab ko pahunchaye, pas bahut se pahunchaye gaye sunne wale se zyada yaad rakhne wale hote hain, khabardar! Mere baad kafir ban kar na laut jana ke tum me se baaz baaz ki gardenen marne lagen."
"868","Ali ibn Muslim al-Tusi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ibn Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, Hasan ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Mujahid ne hum se bayan kiya, Junada ibn Abi Umayya se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs ahl-e-zimma me se kisi maqtul ko qatal kare woh Jannat ki khushbu nahin payega, halanke us ki khushbu itni itni masafat se pai jati hai, Marwan ne jo zikr kiya us ke mutabiq jo is (hadees) ko pahunchane wala hai."
"869","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid - yani Ibn Harun - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uyayna ibn Abdur Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Abu Bakra Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi muahid ko us ke haq ke baghair qatal kare to Allah us par Jannat haram kar deta hai ke woh us ki khushbu (bhi) na paye."
"870","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Abu Umama ibn Sahl se, unhon ne kaha: Main Uthman Raziallahu anhu ke sath tha jabke woh ghar me mahsur thay, aur ghar me ek dakhli rasta tha, jo us me dakhil hota woh un logon ki guftagu sun leta jo khule sahan par thay, to Uthman us dakhli raste me dakhil hue, phir bahar nikle jabke un ka rang mutaghayyir tha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh abhi mujhe qatal ki dhamki de rahe hain, hum ne kaha: Aye Amir-ul-Muminin! Allah aap ki taraf se un ke liye kafi ho jayega, unhon ne kaha: Aur woh mujhe kyun qatal karenge? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Kisi musalman shakhs ka khoon halal nahin magar teen me se ek ki wajah se: woh mard jo apne Islam ke baad kufr kare, ya jo apne muhsan hone ke baad zina kare, ya jo kisi jaan ko qatal kare, to Allah ki qasam! Main ne na jahiliyyat me kabhi zina kiya aur na Islam me, aur na hi jab se Allah ne mujhe is deen ki hidayat di hai main ne pasand kiya ke is ke badle (kuchh lun), aur na hi main ne kisi jaan ko qatal kiya, to phir woh mujhe kis bunyad par qatal karenge?"
"871","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatada ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai: Ke ek Yahudi ne ek londi ka sar pathar se kuchal diya, phir chandi ke zewar jo us par thay le liye, to logon ne usay paya jabke us me jaan baqi thi, to usay liye phirte rahe: Kya yeh hai? Kya yeh hai? Yahan tak ke us ne Yahudi ki taraf ishara kiya, to unhon ne usay pakar liya to us ne iqrar kar liya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to us ka sar patharon se kuchal diya gaya."
"872","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatada ne mujhe khabar di, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai: Ke ek Yahudi ne ek londi ka sar do patharon ke darmiyan kuchal diya, to us se kaha gaya: Tere sath yeh kis ne kiya? Kya fulan ne ya fulan ne? Yahan tak ke Yahudi ka naam liya gaya, to usay Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas laya gaya to us ne is ka iqrar kiya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare me hukm diya to us ka sar patharon se kuchal diya gaya."
"873","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Khalid al-Hadhdha se, Abu Qilaba se, Abu al-Ashath al-Sanani se, Shaddad ibn Aws Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum qatal karo to qatal ko umda tariqe se karo, al-Ahmasi ne izafa kiya: Aur jab tum zibah karo to zibah ko umda tariqe se karo."
"874","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mughira ne mujhe khabar di - shayad unhon ne kaha - Shibak se, Ibrahim se, Hunnay ibn Nuwayra se, Alqama se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Qatal ke muamle me sab se zyada parhezgar log ahl-e-iman hain."
"875","Abu Said al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne mujhe khabar di, Anas Raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne dant ke badle me qisas ka hukm diya, aur farmaya: Allah ki kitab (ka hukm) qisas hai."
"876","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne mujhe khabar di, Firas se, Abu Salih se, Zadham se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke pas betha hua tha, to unhon ne apne ek ghulam ko bulaya to usay azad kar diya phir kaha: Mujhe us ke ajr me se kuchh nahin? Is ka wazan kya hai - ya is ki qimat kya hai? Aur unhon ne apne hath se zameen se koi cheez uthai, beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs apne ghulam ko kisi had ki wajah se mare jo us ne ki hi nahin, ya usay thappar mare, to us ka kaffara yeh hai ke usay azad kare."
"877","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Aruba ne mujhe khabar di, Ayyub se, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badal de to use qatl kar do."
"878","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Jurayri ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Nadra se, Abu Firas se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne humein khutba diya to farmaya: Khabardar, maine apne ummal ko tum par is liye nahin bheja ke woh tumhari khalon ko marein aur na is liye ke woh tumhare malon mein se kuch lein, lekin maine unhein sirf is liye bheja hai ke woh tumhein tumhara deen aur tumhari sunnat sikhayein, pas jis ke sath is ke ghair kuch kiya jaye woh use meri taraf uthaye, pas us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Umar ki jan hai main zaroor us se us ka badla lunga, phir Amr ibn al-As khade hue to kaha: Aye Amir al-Muminin, agar Musalmanon mein se koi shakhs ra'iyyat par ho phir woh apni ra'iyyat mein se kisi ko adab sikhaye to kya aap us se us ka badla lenge? Umar ne kaha: Main us se badla kyun na lunga jabke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apni zat se badla lete hue dekha hai, aur us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Umar ki jan hai main zaroor us se us ka badla lunga."
"879","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne mujhe khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwa se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Abu Jahm ibn Hudhayfa ko sadaqa wasool karne wala bana kar bheja, to ek aadmi ne apne sadaqe mein un se takrar ki, to Abu Jahm ne use mara aur us ka sar zakhmi kar diya, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Qisas, Ya Rasulallah, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare liye itna aur itna hai. Woh razi na hue, Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhare liye itna aur itna hai. Woh razi na hue, Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhare liye itna aur itna hai. To woh razi ho gaye, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Main logon ko khutba dene wala hun aur unhein tumhari razamandi ki khabar dene wala hun. Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne logon ko khutba diya aur farmaya: Yeh Laythi log mere paas qisas talab karte hue aaye, to maine unhein itna aur itna pesh kiya aur woh razi ho gaye, kya tum razi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, to Muhajirun ne un ka rukh kiya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke woh ruk jayein to woh ruk gaye, phir Aap ne unhein bulaya aur unhein mazeed diya, aur farmaya: Kya tum razi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Phir main logon ko khutba dene wala hun aur unhein tumhari razamandi ki khabar dene wala hun. Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne logon ko khutba diya aur farmaya: Kya tum razi ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han."
"880","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne mujhe khabar di, Qatada se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Ukl aur Urayna ke chand afrad ne Islam ka kalma padha, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur unhon ne Aap ko khabar di ke woh doodh wale janwaron wale log hain aur dehati (kheti wale) log nahin hain, aur unhon ne Madina ke bukhar ki shikayat ki, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke liye doodh dene wali oontnion ka hukm diya, aur un ke liye ek charwahe ka hukm diya, aur unhein hukm diya ke woh niklein aur un ke doodhon aur peshabon mein se piyen, phir woh Harra ki taraf rawana hue phir unhon ne apne Islam ke ba'd kufr kiya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke charwahe ko qatl kar diya aur oontnian hank kar le gaye, phir yeh baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko pahunchi to Aap ne un ke peeche talash karne walon ko bheja, phir unhein laya gaya to Aap ne un ki aankhein garam salakhon se phod din, aur un ke hath aur paon kaat diye, aur woh Harra ke kinare chhod diye gaye, woh us ke pattharon ko chabate rahe yahan tak ke mar gaye. Qatada ne kaha: Hamein yeh baat pahunchi ke un ke bare mein yeh ayat utari gayi: Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasul se jang karne walon ki jaza yahi hai."
"881","Muhammad ibn Ismail ibn Abdullah al-Baghdadi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Ghaylan ibn Abdullah al-Khuzai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Zuray ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Taymi se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki aankhein sirf is liye garam salakh se phodin kyunke unhon ne charwahon ki aankhein (garam salakh se) phodi thin."
"882","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya - aur yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri ki hai - unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se: ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Meri biwi ne kala ladka jana hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas oont hain? Us ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Un ke rang kya hain? Us ne kaha: Surkh, Aap ne farmaya: Kya un mein koi maila (khakistari) hai? Us ne kaha: Un mein mailay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir woh unhein kahan se aaya? Us ne kaha: Ho sakta hai use kisi rag ne khencha ho, Aap ne farmaya: Aur yeh bhi ho sakta hai use kisi rag ne khencha ho."
"883","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl - ya'ni Ibn Musa - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fudayl ibn Ghazwan ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Nu'm se, Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim, Tauba ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam par tohmat lagaye jabke woh zalim ho, Qayamat ke din us par hadd qaim ki jayegi, magar yeh ke woh waisa hi ho jaisa us ne kaha."
"884","al-Rabi ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuayb - ya'ni Ibn al-Layth - ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Abu Burda Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Das kodon se upar koi koda nahin lagaya jayega magar Allah ki hudud mein se kisi hadd mein."
"885","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Harun al-Burdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Yusuf ne mujhe khabar di, al-Qasim ibn Fayyad al-Abnawi se, Khallad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Ibn al-Musayyib se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Banu Bakr ibn Layth mein se ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne iqrar kiya ke us ne ek aurat se chaar martaba zina kiya hai, to Aap ne use sau kode lagaye, aur woh ghair shadi shuda tha, phir Aap ne us se aurat ke khilaf saboot manga, to aurat ne kaha: Allah ki qasam us ne jhoot kaha hai, Ya Rasulallah, to Aap ne use tohmat ki hadd assi kode lagaye."
"886","(87) Ashriba ke bare mein jo kuch aaya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hayyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne humein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke minbar par khutba diya, phir unhon ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur Us ki sana ki, aur wa'z aur nasihat ki, aur kaha: Amma ba'd, khamr ki hurmat us din nazil hui jis din nazil hui, aur woh paanch cheezon se hai: angoor se, khajoor se, gandum se, jau se, aur shehed se, aur khamr woh hai jo aql ko dhamp le."
"887","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Waddak ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Abu Sa'id Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Jab sharaab haram ki gayi to hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, hamare paas ek yateem ki sharaab hai, to unhon ne humein hukm diya aur hum ne use baha diya. Dar al-Kutub al-Ilmiyyah ki taba'at mein is tarah hai, aur durust (Mujalid) hai."
"888","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Suddi se, Abu Hubayra se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sharaab ke bare mein poocha gaya ke use sirka banaya jaye, to Aap ne use napasand farmaya."
"889","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har sharab jo nasha laye, woh haram hai."
"890","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qurra se, unhon ne Sayyar Abu al-Hakam se, unhon ne Abu Burda se, unhon ne Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare paas is Bit jo shehed se banta hai aur Mizr jo makai aur jau se banta hai me se ashriba hain ya sharab hai, to aap hamen kya hukm dete hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Main tumhen har nasha-aawar cheez se mana karta hun."
"891","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ubaydullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Main ise Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hi se janta hun, Aap ne farmaya: Har nasha-aawar khamr hai aur har khamr haram hai."
"892","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad jo Ibn Amr hain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Muqayyar, Muzaffat, Dubba, Hantama aur Naqir me nabeez banane se mana farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Aur har nasha-aawar haram hai."
"893","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har nasha-aawar khamr hai, aur har nasha-aawar haram hai."
"894","Abu al-Azhar Ahmad ibn al-Azhar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Damra ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Dawud ibn Bakr ibn Abi al-Furat se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis cheez ki kaseer miqdar nasha laye, uski thodi miqdar haram hai."
"895","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahdi ibn Maymun ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Uthman al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka Faraq bhar nasha laye, us me se hatheli bhar haram hai."
"896","Sa'd ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam aur Allan ibn al-Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Said ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Jafar ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-Dahhak ibn Uthman ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj se, unhon ne Amir ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhen us cheez ki thodi miqdar se mana karta hun jiski zyada miqdar nasha laye."
"897","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Sufyan se, unhon ne Alqama ibn Marthad se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Burayda se, unhon ne apne walid se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Maine tumhen qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha, pas ab unki ziyarat karo, kyunke Muhammad ko apni walida ki ziyarat ki ijazat di gayi, aur beshak woh aakhirat ki yaad dilati hai, aur maine tumhen qurbani ke gosht ko teen din se zyada rok kar rakhne se mana kiya tha, is se mera maqsad tha ke gunjaish wale tangdast logon ke liye wus'at karen, pas khao aur zakhira karo, aur maine tumhen bartanon se mana kiya tha, halanke koi bartan kisi cheez ko na halal karta hai na haram, aur har nasha-aawar haram hai."
"898","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asbat ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Shaybani se, unhon ne Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, unhon ne Said ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne busr aur khajoor ko ikattha milane se mana farmaya, aur kishmish aur khajoor ko ikattha milane se mana farmaya, aur Ahle Jurash ko likha ke kishmish aur khajoor na milayen."
"899","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Abi Najih se, unhon ne Mujahid se, unhon ne Ibn Abi Layla se, aur Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne Ibn Abi Layla se, aur Abu Farwa ne Abdullah ibn Ukaym se, unhon ne kaha: Hudhayfa Raziallahu anhu ne peene ke liye pani manga, to ek dihqan chandi ke bartan me pani laya to unhon ne use phenk diya, phir jo unhon ne kiya us par unse mazrat ki aur kaha: Maine ise mana kiya tha, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Sone aur chandi ke bartan me na piyo, aur na Deebaj aur na resham pehno, kyunke ye unke liye duniya me hain aur hamare liye aakhirat me."
"900","Abu Jafar al-Mukharrami, Ishaq ibn Mansur aur Umar ibn Shabba ne hum se bayan kiya aur hadees Abu Jafar ki hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Shu'ba se, unhon ne kaha: Qatada ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Isa al-Uswari se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aadmi ke khade ho kar peene se mana farmaya."
"901","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Imran ibn Hudayr ne mujhe khabar di, Yazid ibn Utarid Abu al-Bazari se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se khade hokar peene ke baare mein sawal kiya to unhon ne kaha: Hum khade hokar peete the aur chalte phirte khate the, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ahad mein."
"902","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Jurayj se, Abd al-Karim ibn Malik se, Anas Raziallahu anhu ki beti ke bete al-Bara ibn Zayd se, ke un ki walida khabar deti hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un ke paas tashreef laye jabke ek mashkiza latka hua tha, to Aap ne mashkize ke munh se khade hokar piya. Unhon ne kaha: To main us ki taraf uthi aur maine use kaat liya."
"903","(88) Khano ke baare mein jo warid hua hai us ka bab: Yusuf ibn Musa aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Qabisa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Umar ibn Muhammad se, al-Qasim se, Salim se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bayen haath se na khaye, aur na apne bayen haath se piye, kyunke shaitan apne bayen haath se khata hai aur apne bayen haath se peeta hai."
"904","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Uways ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Sulayman ibn Bilal se, Umar ibn Muhammad se, ke Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne unhein khabar di ke Salim ibn Abdullah ne unhein khabar di ke Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne yehi khabar farmayi. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Maine Muhammad ibn Yahya ko kehte hue suna: Hamare nazdeek al-Qasim se murad Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah hain, In sha Allah."
"905","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mamar se, al-Zuhri se, Ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us choohi ke baare mein pucha gaya jo ghee mein mar jaye, Aap ne farmaya: Agar woh jama hua ho to use aur us ke aas paas wale hisse ko phenk do, aur agar patla ho to us ke qareeb na jao."
"906","Ibn al-Muqri aur Said ibn Bahr al-Qaratisi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Maymuna Raziallahu anha se, ke ek choohi ghee mein gir gayi to mar gayi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us ke baare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Use aur us ke aas paas wale hisse ko phenk do aur use khao."
"907","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apni kisi zauja ki ek mari hui bakri dekhi to farmaya: Tum ne us ki khaal ko dabaghat kyun na diya ke us se faida uthate."
"908","Amr ibn Dinar se, Ata se - aur unhon ne use is se chalis saal pehle suna tha - Ibn Abbas se, Maymuna Raziallahu anhum se."
"909","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ibn Wala se, Ibn Abbas se marfuan - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: Aur ek martaba unhon ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi khaal dabaghat di jaye to woh paak ho gayi."
"910","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani al-Qattan - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Abi Aruba se, Qatada se, Abu al-Malih se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne darindon ki khalon ko bichhane se mana farmaya."
"911","Muhammad Khalaf al-Haddad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yaqub ibn Ishaq al-Hadrami ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Waqid al-Laythi se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Madina tashreef laye jabke woh oonton ke kohan kaat te the aur bakriyon ki sarin kaat te the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tukda zinda janwar se kaata jaye to woh murdar hai. Yahya ibn Main ne kaha: Yahya al-Qattan ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Dinar se hadees bayan ki hai."
"912","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Mustamirr ibn al-Rayyan se, Abu Nadra se, Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek aurat ka zikr farmaya jis ne ek angoothi banayi aur use behtareen khushbu mushk se bhar diya."
"913","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe Abu Ubayda ke sath ek sariyya me bheja to hamara tosha khatm ho gaya, to ham ek machhli ke pas se guzre jise samundar ne bahar phenk diya tha, to ham ne us me se khane ka irada kiya to Abu Ubayda ne hamen mana kiya, phir unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke qasid hain aur Allah ke raste me hain, to khao, to hum ne us me se kai din tak khaya, phir jab hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas hazir hue to hum ne Aap ko khabar di, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar us me se kuch tumhare pas bacha hua ho to use hamare pas bhejo."
"914","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim ibn Abi al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Hazim ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Miqsam se - Ahmad ne kaha: yani Ubaydullah - Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se samundar ke pani ke bare me pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Us ka pani pak karne wala hai, us ka murdar halal hai."
"915","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyayna ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Yafur se, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa Raziallahu anhu se. Aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Yafur se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa Raziallahu anhu ke pas aaya, to main ne un se tiddi ke bare me pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath chhe ghazwat me jang ki, tiddiyan khate hue."
"916","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Kuch log Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aaye to unhon ne kaha: Hamare pas gosht laya jata hai hum nahin jante ke us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ya nahin liya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Allah ka naam lo aur khao."
"917","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Amir ibn Sad se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Musalmanon me Musalmanon ke haq me jurm ke lehaz se sab se bara woh hai jis ne kisi aise hukm ke bare me sawal kiya jo haram nahin kiya gaya tha, phir woh us ke sawal ki wajah se haram kar diya gaya."
"918","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi aur Salim se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne paltu gadhon ke gosht khane se mana farmaya."
"919","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Khaybar ke din ghode, khachchar aur gadhe zibah kiye, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hamen khachcharon aur gadhon se mana farmaya, aur ghodon se mana nahin farmaya."
"920","al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ali se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya, aur ghodon ke gosht ki ijazat di."
"921","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se - yani Ibn Urwa - Fatima se, Asma Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me ghode ka gosht khaya."
"922","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Said - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se - yani al-Dastuwai - Qatada se, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah ne gandagi khane wali gaaye ke doodh se, aur mujaththama se, aur mashkize ke munh se peene se mana farmaya."
"923","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilaba se, Zahdam al-Jarmi se, ke ek aadmi ne murghi se alahdagi ikhtiyar ki, aur kaha: Main ne use koi cheez khate dekha to mujhe us se ghin aayi, to Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko use khate dekha."
"924","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Abu Idris se, Abu Thalaba al-Khushani Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne har daant wale darinde ke khane se mana farmaya."
"925","Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Ubayd ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Ammar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se mila to main ne un se kaha: Mujhe dab'u (hyena) ke bare mein bataiye, kya hum use khate hain? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Kya woh shikar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Kya aap ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"926","Ma'ruf ibn Hasan Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, Hisham ibn Zayd ibn Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Hum ne Marr az-Zahran mein ek khargosh ko bhagaya, to log daude pas main ne use pa liya, phir main use Abu Talha ke paas laya to unhon ne us ki raan - unhon ne kaha: aur mera gumaan hai unhon ne kaha - us ke surin (warik) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf bheja to Aap ne use qabool farmaya."
"927","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Maymun ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne har naab wale darinde (siba') se aur parindon mein se har mikhlab wale se mana farmaya."
"928","Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubada ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Aruba ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Hakam se, Maymun ibn Mihran se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne har naab wale darinde (siba') se aur parindon mein se har mikhlab wale se mana farmaya."
"929","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne mujhe khabar di, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke un se goh (dhi­bab) khane ke bare mein pucha gaya? To unhon ne kaha: Meri khala Umm Hufayd ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ghee aur aqit aur gohen hadiya kin, to Aap ne ghee aur aqit mein se khaya, aur gohon ko un se nafrat karte hue chhod diya, aur agar woh haram hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke dastarkhwan par na khai jatin aur na Aap ne un ke khane ka hukm diya."
"930","(89) Zabihon mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan Sauri ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Abaya ibn Rifaa se, Rafi' ibn Khadij Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Tihama wale Zu al-Hulayfa mein the, to logon ko bakriyan aur oont mile, to unhon ne un mein jaldi ki pas un se handiyan ubalin, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un ke paas pahunche, to Aap ne handiyon ka hukm diya to woh undhel di gayin, aur Aap ne das bakriyon ko ek oont ke barabar qarar diya, unhon ne kaha: Aur un mein se ek oont bhag nikla to ek shakhs ne use teer mara to use rok diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak in chaupayon mein wahshi janwaron ki tarah wahshi hone wale hote hain, pas jo tum par ghalib aa jaye to us ke sath isi tarah karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rafi' ibn Khadij Aap ke paas aye to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah! Hum darte hain - ya unhon ne kaha: hum ummeed rakhte hain - ke hum kal dushman se milenge aur hamare paas chhuriyan nahin hain, to kya hum sarkande (qasab) se zibah kar len? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khoon baha de aur us par Allah ka naam zikr kiya gaya ho to khao, siwaye daant aur nakhun ke, aur main tumhen (us ki wajah) bayan karunga: raha daant to woh haddi hai, aur raha nakhun to woh Habsha ki chhuri hai, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Madina mein ek pani dhone wala oont (nadih) kunwen mein gir gaya to use us ke pahlu (shakila) ki taraf se zakat (zibah) kiya gaya yani us ki kokh (khasira) ki taraf se, to Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne us mein se daswan hissa do dirhamon ke badle liya."
"931","Ahmad ibn Sa'id Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hibban - yani Ibn Hilal - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir - yani Ibn Hazim - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub mujhe Zayd ibn Aslam se hadees bayan karte the, phir main Zayd se mila to main ne un se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ata ibn Yasar ne bayan kiya, Abu Sa'id Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek shakhs ki ek oontni thi jo Uhud ki taraf char rahi thi, to woh sar­kash ho gayi pas us ne use ek mekh (watad) se nahr kar diya. Main ne Zayd se kaha: Lohe se ya lakdi se? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, balke lakdi se. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aye to unhon ne Aap se us ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne unhen use khane ka hukm diya."
"932","Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne mujhe khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke ek aurat Ka'b ibn Malik ki bakriyan Sal' mein charaya karti thi, to use ek bakri ke marne ka khauf hua, to us ne ek pathar liya aur use us se zibah kar diya, aur yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se zikr ki gayi to Aap ne unhen use khane ka hukm diya."
"933","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwaron ko baandh kar nishana banaya jaye."
"934","Abu Sa'id Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafs ibn Ghiyath se, unhon ne kaha: Khalid Hazza ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilaba se, Abu Ash'ath San'ani se, Shaddad ibn Aws Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne har cheez par ehsan likh diya hai, pas qatl ko umda tarike se karo, aur zibah ko umda tarike se karo, aur tum mein se har ek ko chahiye ke apni chhuri (shafra) tez kare aur apne zabiha ko aaram pahunchaye."
"935","Abu Sa'id Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujalid se, Abu Waddak se, Abu Sa'id Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se janin (pet ke bachche) ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho to use khao, pas beshak us ki zakat us ki maan ki zakat hai."
"936","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman - yani Ibn Mahdi - ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ushara se, un ke walid se: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah! Kya zakat (zibah) halq aur labba ke siwa nahin hoti? To Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum ne us ki raan mein neza mara hota to tumhari taraf se kifayat kar jata. Ibn Mahdi ne kaha: Yeh us ke bare mein hai jis par qabu na paya ja sake, jo (oonchayi se) girne wale (janwar) ke mushabeh hai."
"937","(90) Qurbaniyon ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab. Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Uqba - yani Ibn Khalid - ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Abi Aruba se, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Anas Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne do seengon wale safed o siyah mendhon ki qurbani ki."
"938","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni biwiyon ki taraf se gaayon ki qurbani kiya karte the."
"939","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shababa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abu al-Zubayr se, unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musinnah ke siwa (koi janwar) zibh na karo, magar jab tum par dushwari ho to bhed me se jaza'ah zibh kar lo."
"940","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hamen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujhe khabar di ke Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj ne un se hadees bayan ki ke Muadh ibn Abdullah ibn Khubayb al-Juhani ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Uqba ibn Amir al-Juhani se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath bhed me se jaza' ki qurbani ki."
"941","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne hamen khabar di (h). Aur Muhammad ibn Hisham ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Shurayh ibn al-Nu'man al-Hamdani se (riwayat ki) ke Ali Raziallahu anhu ne kaha - aur Ibn Hisham ne (yun) kaha: Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai ke) unhon ne kaha - : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hamen muqabalah ya mudabarah ya sharqa ya kharqa ya jad'a' ki qurbani karne se mana farmaya."
"942","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Shu'ba se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Abd al-Rahman - jo Bani Asad ke mawla hain - se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Maine Ubayd ibn Fayruz - jo Bani Shayban me se ek shakhs hain - se suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Bara ibn Azib Raziallahu anhuma se pucha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne qurbaniyon me se kin ko makruh jana ya kin se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Char (qism ke janwar) kafi nahin hote - aur mera hath un ke hath se chhota hai - : kani jiska kanapan wazeh ho, langdi jiska langdapan wazeh ho, bimar jiska bimar hona wazeh ho, aur aisi tooti-phooti (kamzor) jisme gudda na ho. Maine kaha: To main napasand karta hun ke daant me koi naqs ho ya seeng me ya kaan me koi naqs ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jo tum napasand karo use chhod do aur use kisi par haram na thehrao."
"943","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Ali ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Sha'bi se, unhon ne Bara ibn Azib Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi shakhs namaz padhne se pehle hargiz zibh na kare. Unhon ne kaha: To un ke samne mere mamun Abu Burda ibn Niyar khade hue aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, ye aisa din hai jisme gosht kasrat se (khaya jata) hai aur maine apni qurbani zibh kar di hai taake mere ghar wale aur padosi us me se khayen, aur mere pas (bakri ki) ek pathiya hai jo gosht wali do bakriyon se behtar hai, to kya main use zibh kar dun? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan, aur tumhare baad kisi ke liye koi jaza'ah kafi na hogi, aur ye tumhari dono qurbaniyon me se behtar hai."
"944","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Shu'ba se, unhon ne Qatada se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna - to maine kaha: Kya tum ne use (khud) suna hai? To unhon ne kaha: Haan - : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) do safed o siyah seengdar mendhon ki qurbani kiya karte the aur (zibh ke waqt) Allah ka naam lete aur takbir kehte, aur yaqinan maine un dono ko dekha ke wo unhen apne hath se zibh kar rahe the, un ke pehluon par apna qadam rakhe hue."
"945","(91) Aqiqah ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Samura ibn Jundub Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat ki ke) unhon ne farmaya: Har ladka apne aqiqah ke badle girwi hai, us ki taraf se satven din (janwar) zibh kiya jayega aur us ka sar munda jayega aur us ka naam rakha jayega."
"946","Abu Bakr Muhammad ibn Ishaq al-Saghani ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Umar al-Qasabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Warith ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hasan aur Husayn ki taraf se aqiqah kiya, ek ek mendha (zibh kiya)."
"947","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'mar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Warith ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hasan ki taraf se ek mendhe ka aur Husayn ki taraf se ek mendhe ka aqiqah kiya. Thawri, Ibn Uyayna, Hammad ibn Zayd aur dusron ne use Ayyub se riwayat kiya, unhon ne use Ikrima se aage nahin badhaya."
"948","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat ki ke) unhon ne farmaya: Na fara' hai aur na atirah."
"949","(92) Shikar ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nuaym aur Yala ibn Ubaid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Zakariyya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amir se, Adi ibn Hatim se - Ibn Yahya ne kaha: aur yeh Abu Nuaym ki hadees hai - unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se mirad ke shikar ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya: Jo apni dhaar se lage to khao, aur jo apni pahl (chaudi taraf) se lage to woh waqiz hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur maine Aap se kutte ke shikar ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya: Jo woh tumhare liye rok rakhe to khao, kyunke kutte ka pakad lena us ki zakat hai, aur agar tum apne kutte ke sath koi dusra kutta ya dusre kutte pao, aur tumhe andesha ho ke kahin us ne us ke sath mil kar use pakda ho aur use qatal kiya ho to mat khao, kyunke tum ne Allah ka naam sirf apne kutte par liya tha aur us ke siwa par nahi liya tha."
"950","Said ibn Bahr al-Qaratisi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaida ibn Humaid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bayan Abu Bishr ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Amir al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Adi ibn Hatim Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha, maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum sikhaye hue kutte chhorte hain to woh qatal kar dete hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab woh qatal kar dein to khao, magar yeh ke woh us mein se kha le, ya us ke sath koi dusra kutta shareek ho jaye."
"951","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Haywa ibn Shurayh ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Rabia ibn Yazid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Idris al-Khawlani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Thalaba al-Khushani Raziallahu anhu ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aya to maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum Ahl-e-Kitab ki zameen mein hain to hum un ke bartanon mein khate hain, aur hum shikar wali zameen mein hain to main apni kaman se teer marta hun aur apne sikhaye hue kutte se aur apne ghair sikhaye hue kutte se shikar karta hun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum Ahl-e-Kitab ki zameen mein ho jaisa tum ne zikr kiya to un ke bartanon mein mat khao, magar yeh ke tum un se be-niyaz hone ki koi surat na pao, pas agar tum un se be-niyaz hone ki koi surat na pao to unhen dho lo phir un mein khao, aur agar tum shikar wali zameen mein ho jaisa tum ne zikr kiya, to jo tum ne apni kaman se shikar kiya to Allah ka naam lo aur khao, aur jo tum ne apne sikhaye hue kutte se shikar kiya to Allah ka naam lo aur khao, aur jo tum ne apne ghair sikhaye hue kutte se shikar kiya to agar tum us ki zakat ko pa lo to khao."
"952","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Haywa ibn Shurayh ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Rabia ibn Yazid al-Dimashqi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Idris al-Khawlani ko kehte hue suna: Unhon ne Abu Thalaba al-Khushani Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aya to unhon ne sirf kutte ka qissa zikr kiya. Aur us ke akhir mein kaha: Aur jis ki zakat ko tum waqt par na pa sako to mat khao, ghair sikhaye hue kutte ke qisse mein."
"953","Said ibn Bahr al-Qaratisi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaida ibn Humaid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Bayan se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Adi ibn Hatim ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se mirad ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh cheer de (zakhm karke ghus jaye) to khao, aur agar woh apni pahl se lage to mat khao."
"954","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Said - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shuba se, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Maysara ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Said ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Adi ibn Hatim ne kaha: Maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main shikar par teer marta hun phir ek raat ke baad us ka nishan talash karta hun to us mein apna teer pata hun, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum use pao aur us mein tumhara teer ho aur us mein se kisi darinde ne na khaya ho to khao."
"955","Unhon ne kaha: Maine us ka Abu Bishr se zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha, Said ibn Jubayr se, Adi se (riwayat hai) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum us mein apna teer pao aur us mein us ke ghair ka koi nishan na dekho, tum jante ho ke usi ne use qatal kiya hai, to khao."
"956","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Tabba ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Abi Zaida - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Asim ibn Sulayman se, al-Shabi se, Adi ibn Hatim Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab tumhara teer pani mein gire phir woh dub kar mar jaye to mat khao."
"957","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abd al-Malik ibn Maysara se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Adi ibn Hatim Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main shikar par teer marta hun phir ek raat ke baad nishan talash karta hun to Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum us mein apna teer pao aur us mein se darinde ne na khaya ho to khao."
"958","Shuba ne kaha: Maine us ka Abu Bishr se zikr kiya to unhon ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Said ibn Jubayr se, Adi ibn Hatim Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum us mein apna teer pao aur us mein us ke ghair ka koi nishan na dekho, tum jante ho ke usi ne use qatal kiya hai, to khao."
"959","(93) Qasmon ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Umar Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Mere baap ki qasam! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein apne baapon ki qasam khane se mana karta hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Us ke baad maine us ki qasam nahi khai, yaad karke (jaan bujh kar) aur na naqal karke. Yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri ki hai."
"960","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne mujhe khabar di, al-Hasan se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Samura se (riwayat hai) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne baapon ki qasam mat khao aur na taghuton ki qasam khao."
"961","Ali ibn Muhammad ibn Abi al-Khasib aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn al-Mubarak se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Qilabah se, Thabit ibn al-Dahhak Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam ke siwa kisi aur millat ki jhooti qasam khaye to woh waisa hi hai jaisa us ne kaha. Yeh hadees Ali ki hai aur unhon ne izafa kiya: Aur woh un logon mein se thay jinhon ne darakht ke neeche bai'at ki thi."
"962","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, Hisham ibn Urwah se, un ke walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Allah Ta'ala ke farman: Allah tumhari qasmon mein laghw par tumhara muakhaza nahin farmata ke baare mein, unhon ne kaha: Yeh aadmi ke qaul: Haan Allah ki qasam, aur Nahin Allah ki qasam ke baare mein nazil hui."
"963","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sabr wali qasam par qasam khaye jis ke zariye woh kisi Musalman shakhs ka maal kaat le aur woh us mein jhoota ho to woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se is haal mein milega ke Woh us par ghazabnak hoga, phir nazil hui: Beshak jo log Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain, phir al-Ash'ath ibn Qays dakhil hue to unhon ne kaha: Abu Abd al-Rahman tumhein kya hadees bayan kar rahe hain? Hum ne kaha: Aisa aur aisa, to unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha, yeh mere baare mein nazil hui, mere aur meri qaum ke ek aadmi ke darmiyan hamari ek zameen mein jhagda tha to main ne use Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf mukadma pesh kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari daleel lao, mere paas koi daleel na thi, to Aap ne us se farmaya: Qasam khao, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah phir to woh qasam kha lega, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sabr wali qasam par qasam khaye jis ke zariye woh kisi Musalman shakhs ka maal kaat le aur woh us mein jhoota ho to woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se is haal mein milega ke Woh us par ghazabnak hoga, phir nazil hui: Beshak jo log Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain, yeh ayat."
"964","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hashim ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Nistas ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Koi aadmi mere is mimbar ke paas gunah wali qasam nahin khata, chahe hare miswak par hi ho, magar woh apna thikana Jahannam mein bana leta hai."
"965","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi qasam par qasam khaye phir kahe: In Sha Allah, to us ne istisna kar liya."
"966","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn ne humein khabar di, al-Hasan se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum kisi qasam par qasam khao phir us ke ghair ko us se behtar dekho, to jo behtar hai use ikhtiyar karo aur apni qasam ka kaffara ada karo."
"967","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Hammam ibn Munabbih se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne ghar walon ke baare mein qasam par israar kare, to beshak woh Allah ke nazdeek us kaffare se zyada gunah ka ba'is hai jis ka Us ne hukm diya hai."
"968","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ansar ke ek aadmi se ke woh ek kali londi lekar aaya to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah beshak mere zimme ek mominah gardan hai, pas agar Aap is ko mominah samajhte hain to main ise aazad kar dun, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi deti ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin? Us ne kaha: Haan, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi deti ho ke main Allah ka Rasul hun? Us ne kaha: Haan, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum maut ke baad uthaye jane par iman rakhti ho? Us ne kaha: Haan, Aap ne farmaya: Phir ise aazad kar do."
"969","(94) Nuzur ke baare mein jo warid hua us ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Hammam ibn Munabbih se, unhon ne kaha: Yeh woh hai jo Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Nazr Ibn Adam ko koi cheez nahin dilati jo Main ne us ke liye pehle se muqaddar na ki ho, lekin nazr us se ja milti hai jo Main ne us ke liye muqaddar ki hai, Main us ke zariye bakheel se maal nikalwata hun, woh Mujhe us par woh deta hai jo us ne pehle Mujhe nahin diya tha."
"970","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ya'ni Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Thaqif Banu Uqayl ke haleef thay, Thaqif ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba mein se do aadmiyon ko qaid kiya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba ne Banu Uqayl ke ek aadmi ko qaid kiya aur us ke sath al-Adba ko pakad liya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke paas tashreef laye jabke woh bandish mein tha, to us ne kaha: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! To Aap us ke paas aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe kyun pakda, aur hajiyon ke aage chalne wali ko kyun pakda? Us ne is baat ko bada samajhte hue kaha, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein tumhare haleefon Thaqif ke jurm ki wajah se pakda hai, phir Aap us se wapas tashreef le gaye, to us ne pukara: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah raheem narm khu thay, to Aap us ki taraf laut aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak main Musalman hun, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum yeh kehte jab tum apne muamle ke malik thay to tum poori kamyabi pa lete, phir Aap us se wapas tashreef le gaye, to us ne pukara: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! To Aap us ke paas aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak main bhooka hun mujhe khilao, aur pyasa hun mujhe pilao, Aap ne farmaya: Yehi tumhari hajat hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir us ka fidya un do aadmiyon ke badle mein diya gaya, aur Ansar ki ek aurat qaid hui aur al-Adba pakdi gayi, aurat bandish mein thi, aur log apne maweshiyon ko apne gharon ke samne charate thay, ek raat woh bandish se nikal bhagi aur unton ke paas aayi, jab woh kisi unt ke qareeb jati to woh badbadati to woh use chhod deti, hatta ke woh al-Adba tak pahunchi to us ne aawaz na nikali, woh ek tayyar untni thi, woh us ke pichhle hisse mein sawar hui, phir us ne use hanka to woh chal padi, unhein us ki khabar hui to unhon ne use talash kiya magar woh un se aage nikal gayi, unhon ne kaha: Aur us ne nazr mani thi ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zaroor zibah karegi, phir jab woh Madinah pahunchi to logon ne use dekha aur kaha: Al-Adba Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki untni hai, us ne kaha: Us ne nazr mani hai ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zaroor zibah karegi, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Subhan Allah us ne use kya bura badla diya: ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zibah karegi? Allah ki nafarmani mein koi wafa nahin, aur na us mein jo banda malik nahin."
"971","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne humein khabar di, (ha). Aur Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Talhah ibn Abd al-Malik se, al-Qasim se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki ita'at ki nazr mane to use chahiye ke Us ki ita'at kare aur jo Us ki nafarmani ki nazr mane to use chahiye ke Us ki nafarmani na kare."
"972","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Musa ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khattab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Karim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Nazr do qism ki hai, pas jo Allah ke liye ho to us ka kaffara poora karna hai, aur jo shaitan ke liye ho to us mein koi wafa nahin aur us par qasam ka kaffara hai."
"973","Hammad ibn al-Hasan ibn Anbasah al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam se, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Uqbah ibn Amir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se apni behan ke baare mein sawal kiya jis ne Ka'bah tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhari behan ki nazar se be-niyaaz hai, use chahiye ke sawar ho aur badanah hadi kare; aur ise Khalid al-Hazza ne Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya aur ‘aur badanah hadi kare’ ka zikr nahin kiya."
"974","Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, Yahya - yani Ibn Ayyub - se, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Abu al-Khayr se, Uqbah ibn Amir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unki behan ne Bait tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani, to unhon ne unke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se fatwa poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh sawar ho; aur Abu al-Khayr Uqbah se laziman wabasta rehte the."
"975","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) maujud the ke achanak ek shakhs dhoop mein khada tha, to Aap ne uske baare mein poocha, to logon ne kaha: Yeh Abu Isra'il hai, us ne nazar mani hai ke woh khada rahega aur baithega nahin, aur saaya hasil nahin karega, aur baat nahin karega aur roza rakhega, to Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh baat kare, aur saaya hasil kare, aur baithe, aur apna roza poora kare."
"976","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid ne humein bataya, Thabit se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo apne do beton ke darmiyan sahara diye hue chal raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Logon ne kaha: Us ne Bait tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah is shakhs ke apne aap ko azab dene se be-niyaaz hai; phir Aap ne use hukm diya to woh sawar ho gaya."
"977","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Sa'd se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne kaha: Meri walida faut ho gayin aur un par ek nazar thi, to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, to Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke main unki taraf se use poora karun."
"978","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya - aur Ibn Hashim ne unki nisbat zikr nahin ki - Ubaydullah ibn Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Umar Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Main ne jahiliyyat mein nazar mani thi ke Masjid al-Haram mein ek raat i'tikaf karunga, to Aap ne un se farmaya: Apni nazar poori karo."
"979","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, al-Hakam aur Muslim al-Batin aur Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr aur Mujahid aur Ata se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Meri behan faut ho gayi hai aur us par lagatar do mahine ke roze hain, Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar tumhari behan par qarz hota to kya tum use ada kartin? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka haq zyada haqdar hai."
"980","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Musa ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Ja'far se ke Muhammad ibn Ja'far ne un se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se (riwayat hai) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs faut ho jaye aur us par roze hon to uska wali uski taraf se roze rakhe."
"981","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa - yani Ibn Yunus - ne humein bataya, Shu'bah se, Ja'far ibn Iyas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Meri behan ne hajj karne ki nazar mani thi aur woh faut ho gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar us par qarz hota to kya tum use ada karte? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka (haq) ada karo, Woh wafa ka zyada haqdar hai."
"982","al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne humein bataya, Habib al-Mu'allim se, Ata se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke ek shakhs ne Bait al-Maqdis mein namaz padhne ki nazar mani, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Yahan namaz padho - yani Masjid al-Haram mein - Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Main ne Bait al-Maqdis mein namaz padhne ki nazar mani hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Yahan namaz padho."
"983","(95) Wasaaya ke baare mein jo kuch aaya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat hai) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman shakhs ka yeh haq nahin ke woh do raatein guzare aur uske paas koi cheez ho jis ke baare mein wasiyyat karni ho, magar yeh ke uski wasiyyat uske paas likhi hui ho."
"984","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Amir ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Main Makkah mein ek marz mein bimar pada jis se main maut ke kareeb pahunch gaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye, to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Mere paas bahut maal hai aur meri waris sirf meri beti hai, to kya main apne maal ke do tihai ki wasiyyat kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, main ne kaha: To aadhe ki? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, main ne kaha: To ek tihai ki? Aap ne farmaya: Ek tihai, aur ek tihai bahut ya bada hai, beshak agar tum apne warison ko ghani chhodo to yeh is se behtar hai ke tum unhein mohtaj chhodo."
"985","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - ya'ni Ibn Ulayyah - ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke ek shakhs ne apni maut ke waqt apne chhe ghulamon ko aazad kiya, un ke siwa us ka koi maal na tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein bulaya aur unhein teen hisson me taqseem kiya, phir un ke darmiyan qur'a dali, to do ko aazad kiya aur chaar ko ghulam rakha, unhon ne kaha: aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se sakht baat kahi."
"986","Abu Ayyub Sulaiman ibn Abd al-Hamid al-Bahrani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abd Rabbihi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jabir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, aur Salim ibn Amir aur ghair ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abu Umamah se - aur un ghair se jo us din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke khutbe me hazir the - to jo kuch unhon ne farmaya us me tha: Khabardar! Beshak Allah ne har haq wale ko us ka haq de diya hai, khabardar! Waris ke liye koi wasiyyat nahin hai."
"987","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-Aqadi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Ishaq se, al-Harith se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah ne qarz ko wasiyyat se pehle ada karne ka faisla kiya, halanke tum ye parhte ho: {min ba'di wasiyyatin yusi biha au dain}, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne maa-baap dono ki taraf se hone wale beton ke liye miras ka faisla kiya, banu allat ko chhor kar."
"988","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj aur Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Abdah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hisham ibn Urwah se, un ke walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Allah ke is qaul ke bare me: {wa man kana faqiran falya'kul bil-ma'ruf}, unhon ne kaha: Yeh yateem ke sarparast ke bare me nazil hui jo us ki islah karta hai aur us ka nigran hai, jab woh mohtaj ho to us me se khaye. Yeh hadees Harun ki hai."
"989","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abd al-Wahhab al-Hajabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn al-Harith ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Husayn al-Mu'allim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se (riwayat hai) ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya aur kaha: Main faqir hun aur mere paas kuch nahin hai aur mere paas ek yateem hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Apne yateem ke maal me se khao baghair israf kiye aur baghair fizul kharchi ya jaldi kharch kiye - al-Hajabi ko shak hua - aur baghair jama karke rakhne ke."
"990","(96) Miras me warid hone wale ahkam ka bab: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Idris al-Awdi se, Talhah ibn Musarrif se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, {wa likullin ja'alna mawali} ke bare me, unhon ne kaha: Waris, aur Us ke qaul {wallazina aqadat aimanukum fa'atuhum nasibahum} ke bare me, unhon ne kaha: Muhajir jab Madinah aye to Muhajir Ansari ka waris banta tha, us ke rishtedaron ko chhor kar, us bhai-chare ke zariye jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan karaya tha, phir jab yeh ayat nazil hui: {wa likullin ja'alna mawali} to us ne usay mansukh kar diya, phir unhon ne parha: {wallazina aqadat aimanukum fa'atuhum nasibahum}, madad, khair-khwahi, himayat aur wasiyyat me se, aur miras khatm ho gayi."
"991","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Ali ibn Husayn se, Amr ibn Uthman se, Usamah ibn Zayd Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: aur ek martaba unhon ne kaha: isay Nabi tak pahunchate hue - : Musalman kafir ka waris nahin banta aur na kafir Musalman ka waris banta hai, yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri ki hai."
"992","al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne hum se hadees bayan ki. Aur Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Mughirah ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Tawus ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Muqarrar hisse un ke haq-daron tak pahunchao, phir jo bache to woh sab se qareebi mard zikar ke liye hai. al-Za'farani ne Ibn Tawus se (yun) kaha: Sab se qareebi zikar ke liye."
"993","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujhe khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne meri iyadat ki, Aap aur Abu Bakr, Banu Salimah me, to mujhe behosh paya, to unhon ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya, phir us me se mujh par chhinta, to main hosh me a gaya, to main ne kaha: Main apne maal me kis tarah karun Ya Rasulullah? To yeh ayat nazil hui: {yusikumullahu fi auladikum liz-zakari mislu hazzil-unsayayn}."
"994","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Hasin se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo maal chhor jaye to woh us ke asaba ke liye hai, aur jo bojh ya zaya hone wali aulad chhor jaye to woh meri taraf hai, main us ka wali hun."
"995","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Main bimar hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye, Aap aur Abu Bakr, aur woh dono paidal the, aur mujh par behoshi tari hui thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir apna wuzu ka pani mujh par dala, to main hosh me a gaya, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main apne maal me kis tarah faisla karun? Main apne maal me kya karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe jawab na diya, yahan tak ke miras ki ayat nazil hui. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu al-Zubayr ne kaha: Us ke bare me nazil hui: {yastaftunaka qulillahu yuftikum fil-kalalah}."
"996","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, Uthman ibn Ishaq ibn Kharashah se, Qabisah ibn Dhu'ayb se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dadi Abu Bakr ke paas apni miras mangne ayi, to unhon ne kaha: Kitabullah me tumhare liye kuch nahin hai, aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki sunnat me tumhare liye kuch nahin janta, wapas jao yahan tak ke main logon se puchun, to unhon ne logon se pucha, to al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, Aap ne usay chhata hissa diya, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kya tumhare sath tumhare ilawa koi aur hai? To Muhammad ibn Maslamah al-Ansari khare hue aur usi tarah kaha jaise al-Mughirah ne kaha tha, to Abu Bakr ne usay us ke liye nafiz kar diya, phir dusri dadi Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ke paas apni miras mangne ayi, to unhon ne kaha: Kitabullah me tumhare liye kuch nahin hai, aur woh faisla jo hamein pahuncha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne kiya tha woh tumhare ilawa kisi aur ke liye tha, aur main faraiz me kisi cheez ka izafa karne wala nahin, lekin wohi chhata hissa hai, phir agar tum dono us me jama ho jao to woh tum dono ke darmiyan hai, aur tum me se jo akeli ho us ke liye wohi hai."
"997","Hum se Muhammad ibn Ali ibn al-Hasan ibn Shaqiq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne walid ko kehte hue suna: humen Abu al-Munib ne khabar di, Abdullah ibn Buraydah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne dadi ko chhata hissa diya, jab maan na ho."
"998","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Bishr ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: mera beta faut ho gaya hai to us ki wirasat me se mera kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: tumhare liye chhata hissa hai, phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to use bulaya aur farmaya: tumhare liye ek aur chhata hissa hai, phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to use bulaya aur farmaya: dusra chhata hissa mazeed atiya hai. Qatadah ne kaha: to dada kam az kam chhata hissa waris hota hai; kyun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use chhate hisse ka waris banaya, aur hum nahin jante ke aap ne use kis ke sath waris banaya."
"999","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abd al-Razzaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen Sufyan ne khabar di, Abu Qays se, al-Huzayl se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ke bare me faisla farmaya jis ne apni beti aur pote ki beti aur apni behen chhodi, to aap ne us ki beti ke liye aadha muqarrar kiya, aur pote ki beti ke liye chhata hissa, aur jo baqi bache wo behen ke liye hai."
"1000","Hum se Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se al-Nadr yani Ibn Shumayl ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen Shu'bah ne khabar di, Sulayman se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Jabal ne hamare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ahd me ek shakhs ke bare me faisla kiya jis ne apni beti aur apni behen chhodi, unhon ne kaha: unhon ne us ki beti ke liye aadhe ka aur behen ke liye aadhe ka faisla kiya."
"1001","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah se, Hakim ibn Abbad ibn Hunayf se, Abu Umamah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne Abu Ubaydah ibn al-Jarrah ko likha: apne ladkon ko tairna sikhao aur apne jangjuon ko teer-andazi sikhao, unhon ne kaha: to wo nishanon par aate jaate the, unhon ne kaha: to ek anjana teer aaya aur ek ladke ko qatl kar diya jo us ke ek khal ki god me tha jis ki asal maloom na thi, unhon ne kaha: to Abu Ubaydah ne Umar ko likha: main us ki diyyat kisko dun? To Umar Raziallahu anhu ne likha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmaya karte the: Allah aur Us ke Rasul us ke wali hain jis ka koi mawla na ho, aur khal us ka waris hai jis ka koi waris na ho."
"1002","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se al-Haytham ibn Jamil aur Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd se, Budayl ibn Maysarah se, Ali ibn Abi Talhah se, Rashid ibn Sa'd se, Abu Amir al-Hawzani se, al-Miqdam al-Kindi se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: main har momin ki jaan se us se zyada haqdar hun, jo qarz ya zaya hone wali aulad chhod jaye — aur al-Haytham ne kaha: ya kalla — to wo meri taraf hai, aur jo maal chhod jaye to wo us ke warison ke liye hai, aur main us ka mawla hun jis ka koi mawla na ho, main us ke maal ka waris hun aur us ke qaidi ko chhudata hun, aur khal us ka mawla hai jis ka koi mawla na ho, wo us ke maal ka waris hai aur us ke qaidi ko chhudata hai."
"1003","Hum se Ibn al-Muqri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: diyyat aqilah ke liye hai, aur aurat apne shohar ki diyyat me se waris nahin hoti, yahan tak ke al-Dahhak al-Kilabi ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen likha ke Ashyam al-Dibabi ki biwi ko us ke shohar ki diyyat me se waris banayen."
"1004","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen al-Hasan ibn Salih ne khabar di, Umar ibn Sa'id se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne mere dada se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Fath-e-Makkah ke din farmaya: do millaton wale ek dusre ke waris nahin honge, aur biwi apne shohar ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se waris hogi, aur wo us ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se waris hoga jab tak ke un me se ek ne dusre ko qatl na kiya ho, phir agar un me se ek ne dusre ko qatl kar diya to wo us ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se kisi cheez ka waris nahin hoga, aur agar un me se ek ne dusre ko ghalti se qatl kiya to wo us ke maal me se waris hoga aur us ki diyyat me se waris nahin hoga."
"1005","(97) Gulaam aazad karne ke bare me jo warid hua us ka bab. Hum se Hammad ibn al-Hasan ibn Anbasah al-Warraq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen Makki yani Ibn Ibrahim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdullah ibn Sa'id ibn Abi Hind ne bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Hakim se, Sa'id ibn Marjanah se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jo kisi momin gardan ko aazad kare, Allah us ke har uzw ke badle us ka har uzw aag se aazad karega, yahan tak ke haath ke badle haath ko aur paon ke badle paon ko aur sharmgah ke badle sharmgah ko zaroor aazad karega. To Ali ibn Husayn ne kaha: aye Sa'id, kya tum ne ye Abu Hurayrah se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: ji han, to us waqt Ali ibn Husayn ne apne ek gulam se jo un ke gulamon ka sardar tha kaha: mere liye Mutarrif ko bulao, unhon ne kaha: phir jab wo un ke samne aaya to unhon ne kaha: jao tum Allah ke liye aazad ho."
"1006","Hum se Abdullah ibn Hashim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya wo Ibn Sa'id hain ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, ke unhen Abu Mirwah al-Ghifari ne khabar di, ke unhen Abu Dharr Raziallahu anhu ne khabar di, ke unhon ne kaha: aye Allah ke Rasul, kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman, aur Us ke raste me jihad, unhon ne kaha: to kaun si gardanein afzal hain? Aap ne farmaya: jo qeemat me zyada aur apne walon ke nazdeek nafees-tareen ho, unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: batayen agar main ye na karun? Aap ne farmaya: kisi zaya hone wale ki madad karo, ya kisi na-tajurbakar ke liye banao, unhon ne kaha: batayen agar main is se aajiz rahun? Aap ne farmaya: shar se ruke raho, kyun ke ye sadqa hai jo tum apni jaan par karte ho."
"1007","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammad ibn Mas'adah ne bayan kiya, Malik se, Nafi' se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: jo bhi gulam साझेदारों ke darmiyan ho aur un me se ek apna hissa aazad kar de, to us par lazim hai ke us ka baqi hissa bhi aazad kare — jab us ke paas itna maal ho jo is ko pahunche — warna us me se jitna aazad hua utna aazad hua."
"1008","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ya'la ibn Ubayd aur Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Suhayl se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: koi beta apne walid ka badla nahin chuka sakta, siwaye is ke ke use gulam paye to use khareed kar aazad kar de."
"1009","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abd al-Aziz al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Damrah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Abdullah ibn Dinar se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi aise rishtedar ka malik ho jaye jis se nikah haram hai to woh azaad hai."
"1010","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nu'man ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se Qatadah se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Hasan se, unhon ne Samurah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya ke Nabi ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi aise rishtedar ka malik ho jaye jis se nikah haram hai to woh azaad hai."
"1011","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se al-Mughirah se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Harith se, unhon ne Abu Zur'ah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Teen baton ke baad jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se suni hain main hamesha Banu Tamim se mohabbat karta rahunga, maine Aap ko farmate hue suna: Woh Dajjal ke muqable mein meri ummat mein sab se sakht tareen hain, aur un ke sadqe aaye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh hamari qaum ke sadqe hain, aur Aishah Raziallahu anha ke paas un mein se ek qaidi londi thi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use azaad kar do kyunke woh Ismail ki aulad mein se hai."
"1012","Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se Umarah ibn al-Qa'qa' se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Zur'ah se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat kiya."
"1013","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Jumhan ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Safinah Abu Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umm Salamah ne mujhe azaad kiya aur mujh par shart lagayi ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki khidmat karun jab tak Aap zinda rahen."
"1014","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Shu'bah se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se riwayat kiya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Barirah ke bare mein pucha jabke us ke ghar walon ne wala ki shart lagayi thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Wala sirf usi ka hai jo azaad kare."
"1015","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar jo Ibn Umar ke mawla hain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wala ko bechne aur us ke hadiya karne se mana farmaya."
"1016","(98) Mukatab aur Mudabbar ka bab Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Teen shakhs hain jin sab ki madad karna Allah par haq hai: Allah ke raste mein jihad karne wala, woh nikah karne wala jo pakdamani chahta ho, aur woh mukatab jo adayegi ka irada rakhta ho."
"1017","Aur Ibn Hashim ne ek martaba phir hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat kiya."
"1018","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abadah ne hum se Hisham se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Barirah mere paas aayi aur kaha: Mere ghar walon ne mujh se nau uqiya par nau saalon mein kitabat ki hai har saal mein ek uqiya, to meri madad karo, unhon ne kaha: To maine kaha: Agar tumhare ghar wale pasand karen ke main un ke liye ek hi martaba mein poori raqam gin dun aur tumhein azaad kar dun to main karungi aur tumhari wala mere liye hogi, to woh apne ghar walon ke paas gayi aur un se is bare mein baat ki to unhon ne inkar kiya magar yeh ke wala unhi ka ho, to woh Aishah Raziallahu anha ke paas aayi aur unhein us bare mein khabar di jo us ke ghar walon ne kaha tha, to Aishah Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Phir to nahin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se us bare mein pucha to unhon ne Aap ko us bare mein khabar di jo unhon ne kaha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Aishah se farmaya: Use khareed lo aur azaad kar do aur un ke liye wala ki shart kar lo, kyunke wala sirf usi ka hai jo azaad kare, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khade hue aur logon ko khutba diya, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki phir farmaya: Tum mein se un aadmiyon ka kya haal hai jo aisi sharten lagate hain jo Allah ki Kitab mein nahin hain, jo shart Allah ki Kitab mein nahin woh batil hai agarche sau sharten hon, Allah ka faisla zyada haq hai aur Allah ki shart zyada mazboot hai, tum mein se un aadmiyon ka kya haal hai jin mein se ek kehta hai: Azaad kar do aye falan aur wala mere liye hai, wala sirf usi ka hai jo azaad kare."
"1019","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali yani Ibn al-Mubarak ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Yahya yani Ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mukatab ke bare mein jab woh qatl kiya jaye faisla farmaya ke us ki diyyat us miqdar ke mutabiq ada ki jayegi jitna us mein se azaad ho chuka hai, azaad shakhs ki diyyat ke tor par, aur Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Mukatab par ghulam ki hadd ke siwa hadd qaim nahin ki jayegi."
"1020","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Amr se bayan kiya, unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne apne ek ghulam ko mudabbar banaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use bech diya."
"1021","Hasan ibn Abi al-Rabi' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se suna, woh keh rahe the: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ahd mein ek shakhs ne apne ek ghulam ko, jis ke siwa us ke paas koi maal na tha, apni dubur ki taraf se (yani apni maut ke baad aazad hone ki shart par) aazad kiya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne pucha: Mujh se ise kaun kharidta hai? To Nu'aym ibn Abdullah ne kaha: Main ise kharidta hun, pas unhon ne ise kharid liya. Amr ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: Qibti ghulam tha jo pichle saal faut hua. Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Aur is mein Abu al-Zubayr ne izafa kiya: use Ya'qub kaha jata tha."
"1022","(99) Umra aur Ruqba ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab. Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne Ibn Abi Arubah se, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Nadr ibn Anas se, unhon ne Bashir ibn Nahik se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne kaha: Umra apne ahl ke liye mirath hai ya apne ahl ke liye jaiz hai."
"1023","Ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne Ibn Abi Arubah se, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Ata se, unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi ki misl (riwayat ki)."
"1024","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs bhi apne liye aur apni aulad ke liye umra diya jaye to woh usi ka hai jise diya gaya, us ki taraf nahi lautega jis ne use diya, is liye ke us ne aisa atiya diya jis mein mirarthen jari huin."
"1025","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Wohi umra hai jise Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jaiz qarar diya ke (dene wala) kahe: Yeh tumhare liye aur tumhari aulad ke liye hai, lekin jab woh kahe: Yeh tumhare liye hai jab tak tum zinda raho to woh apne malik ki taraf laut jayegi. Ma'mar ne kaha: Aur al-Zuhri isi ke mutabiq fatwa dete the."
"1026","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah ne Dawud se, unhon ne Abu al-Zubayr se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ruqba usi ka hai jise ruqba kiya gaya aur umra usi ka hai jise umra kiya gaya."
"1027","Hasan ibn Abi al-Rabi' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe Habib ibn Abi Thabit se khabar di, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Na ruqba hai aur na umra, pas jise koi cheez umra ki gayi ya ruqba ki gayi, jise koi cheez umra ki gayi ya ruqba ki gayi to woh usi ki hai us ki zindagi mein aur us ki maut ke baad. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ruqba yeh hai ke woh dusre se kahe: Meri taraf se aur teri taraf se hai, aur umra yeh hai ke woh use us ki zindagi ke liye de ke woh un dono ki zindagi bhar use abad kare. Ata ne kaha: Pas agar use ek saal ya do saal ya koi cheez de jise woh muta'yyin kare to woh maniha hai jo woh use ata karta hai, woh umra nahi hai."
"1028","(100) Nihal aur Hibat ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne Ma'mar se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Muhammad ibn al-Nu'man ibn Bashir aur Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne al-Nu'man ibn Bashir se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Bashir ibn Sa'd Raziallahu anhu mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas le gaye taake mujhe diye hue ek nihal par unhein gawah banayen, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne tamam beton ko is jaisa nihal diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: To ise wapas le lo."
"1029","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'alla ibn Asad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne Dawud se, unhon ne Amir se, unhon ne al-Nu'man ibn Bashir Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid mujhe uthaye hue Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf le kar chale, unhon ne mujhe ek nihal diya tha taake unhein us par gawah banayen, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne al-Nu'man ko yeh ghulam nihal ke taur par diya hai, pas is par gawah ban jaiye, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne apni tamam aulad ko is jaisa diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhe pasand hai ke woh tum se husn-e-suluk mein barabar hon? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, unhon ne kaha: To is par mere siwa kisi aur ko gawah bana lo."
"1030","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Qatadah se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab ko Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne hibah mein lautne wala apni qai mein lautne wale ki tarah hai."
"1031","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq al-Azraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husayn al-Mu'allim ne hum se bayan kiya (ha). Aur Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne Husayn al-Mu'allim se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne Tawus se, unhon ne Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, un dono ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi shakhs ke liye halal nahi ke woh koi atiya de phir us mein laut aaye, siwa walid ke jo woh apne bete ko de, aur us shakhs ki misal jo atiya de phir us mein laut aaye kutte ki tarah hai ke us ne khaya yahan tak ke jab badhazm hua - aur Ali ne kaha: ser hua - to us ne qai ki, phir apni qai mein laut aya."
"1032","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn al-Akhnas ne Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Ek a'rabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya to us ne kaha: Mere walid mera maal hadap karna chahte hain, unhon ne farmaya: Tum aur tumhara maal tumhare walid ke ho, tum jo sab se pakiza khate ho woh tumhari kamai se hai, aur beshak tumhari aulad ke maal tumhari kamai se hain, pas use khushi se khao."
"1033","(101) Ahkam ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne maghrib aur isha ke darmiyan chiraagh par rukhsat ki raat mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Thawri se, unhon ne Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad se, unhon ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab hakim ijtihad kare aur durust ho to us ke liye do ajar hain, aur jab ijtihad kare aur khata kare to us ke liye ek ajar hai. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur hum nahin jante ke Ma'mar ke siwa kisi ne Thawri se yeh hadees riwayat ki ho."
"1034","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik ibn Umair ne hum se khabar di, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Bakrah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Qazi do aadmiyon ke darmiyan faisla na kare jabke wo ghusse mein ho."
"1035","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Umar ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn ne Hasan se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Samurah Raziallahu anhu se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Imarat ka sawal na karo, kyunke agar tumhe baghair mange di gayi to us par tumhari madad ki jayegi, aur agar mange par di gayi to tum usi ke supurd kar diye jaoge."
"1036","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya (ha). Aur Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdah ne Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Zainab bint Umm Salamah se, unhon ne Umm Salamah Raziallahu anha se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne jhagre mere paas late ho aur main sirf ek bashar hun, aur ho sakta hai ke tum mein se koi apni daleel mein dusre se zyada chust-zaban ho, pas agar main tum mein se kisi ke haq mein us ke bhai ke haq mein se kisi cheez ka faisla kar dun to main us ke liye aag ka ek tukda kaat raha hun, pas wo us mein se kuch na le. Yeh hadees Harun ki hai."
"1037","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne Usamah ibn Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Rafi jo Umm Salamah ke maula hain unhon ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Umm Salamah Raziallahu anha se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ke do aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye jo apne darmiyan meeras mein jhagad rahe the jo purani ho chuki thi, un dono ke darmiyan koi daleel na thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne jhagre mere paas late ho aur main sirf ek bashar hun, aur ho sakta hai ke tum mein se koi apni daleel mein dusre se zyada chust-zaban ho, aur main tumhare darmiyan sirf usi ke mutabiq faisla karta hun jo tum se sunta hun, pas jis ke haq mein main us ke bhai ke maal mein se kisi cheez ka faisla kar dun wo use na le, kyunke main us ke liye aag ka ek tukda kaat raha hun, wo qiyamat ke din use apni gardan mein tauq bana kar layega. Unhon ne kaha: To dono aadmi ro pade aur dono mein se har ek ne kaha: Mera haq mere bhai ke liye hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum ne aisa kiya hai to jao aur taqseem kar lo aur haq ki justuju karo phir qura andazi karo phir tum mein se har ek dusre ko muaf kar de."
"1038","Abu Salih Hamzah ibn Malik ibn Hamzah al-Aslami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan yani Ibn Hamzah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Kasir yani Ibn Zaid se, unhon ne Walid ibn Rabah se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman apni sharton par qayam hain jo un mein se haq ke muwafiq hon."
"1039","Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke darmiyan sulah jayez hai."
"1040","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Qasim ibn Muhammad se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamare is muamle mein koi nayi cheez ijad kare jo us mein nahin hai to wo mardud hai."
"1041","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne Bahz ibn Hakim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko tohmat mein rok liya phir use chhod diya."
"1042","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik yani Ibn Umair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Alqamah ibn Wail se, unhon ne apne walid Wail ibn Hujr se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas tha ke do aadmi aaye jo zameen mein jhagad rahe the, un mein se ek ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Is ne jahiliyyat mein meri zameen chheen li, aur wo Imru al-Qais ibn Abis al-Kindi tha, aur us ka fareeq Rabiah ibn Aydan tha, to Aap ne us se farmaya: Tumhari daleel? Us ne kaha: Mere paas nahin hai, Aap ne farmaya: Us ki qasam, us ne kaha: Tab to wo use le jayega, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye us ke siwa kuch nahin, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab wo qasam khane ke liye khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zulman zameen kaat le wo qiyamat ke din Allah se is haal mein milega ke Wo us par ghazabnak hoga."
"1043","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haris ibn Sulaiman al-Kindi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kardus ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ash'as ibn Qais al-Kindi se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya ke Kindah ka ek aadmi aur Hadramaut ka ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas Yaman ki zameen mein jhagadte hue aaye, Hadrami ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri zameen hai, is ke baap ne mujh se ghasab kar li, to Aap ne Kindi se farmaya: Tum kya kehte ho? Us ne kaha: Main kehta hun: Yeh zameen mere qabze mein hai jo maine apne baap se wirasat mein payi, to Aap ne Hadrami se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas koi daleel hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, lekin Ya Rasulullah! Wo Allah ki qasam khaye jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin ke wo nahin janta ke yeh meri zameen hai jo us ke baap ne mujh se ghasab ki, Kindi qasam ke liye tayyar hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Koi aadmi apni qasam se maal nahin kaat-ta magar wo qiyamat ke din Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo ajzam hoga, to Kindi ne use wapas kar diya."
"1044","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani aur Sa'id ibn Bahr al-Qaratisi ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Zaid ibn al-Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saif ibn Sulaiman ne hum se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Qais ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne Amr ibn Dinar se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek gawah aur qasam par faisla kiya. Ahmad ibn Bakr ibn Khalaf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ali ibn Abdullah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Yahya ibn Sa'id se Saif ibn Sulaiman ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha: Wo hamare nazdeek sabit, sach bolne wale aur yaad rakhne walon mein se the."
"1045","Rabi ibn Sulaiman ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne un se hadees bayan ki, Sulaiman ya'ni Ibn Bilal se, unhon ne Rabiah se, unhon ne Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek gawah ke sath qasam ke zariye faisla farmaya."
"1046","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Zubair al-Humaidi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne gawah ke sath qasam ke zariye faisla farmaya."
"1047","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nafi ibn Yazid ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Had ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata se, unhon ne Ata ibn Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap ne farmaya: dehati ki gawahi shehri ke khilaf jayez nahin hai."
"1048","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ibn al-Harith ne mujh se hadees bayan ki - phir unhon ne kaha: unhon ne mujh se barahe raast hadees bayan nahin ki lekin maine unhein bayan karte hue suna - unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Ihab ki beti se nikah kiya, phir ek siyah faam aurat aayi aur us ne kaha: beshak maine tum dono ko doodh pilaya hai, to main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se sawal kiya to Aap ne mujh se munh pher liya, phir maine Aap se sawal kiya to Aap ne mujh se munh pher liya, phir Aap ne chauthi ya teesri martaba farmaya: jab ye kaha ja chuka to tera us ke sath rehne ka kya jawaz hai, unhon ne kaha: phir Aap ne unhein us aurat se rok diya."
"1049","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mamar se, Ayyub se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ubaid ibn Abi Maryam se, Uqbah ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: - aur Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne kaha: aur maine Uqbah se bhi suna hai - unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aurat se nikah kiya, unhon ne kaha: phir ek siyah faam aurat aayi aur us ne dawa kiya ke us ne un dono ko doodh pilaya hai, unhon ne kaha: phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur maine Aap se is ka zikr kiya, phir maine kaha: ye jhooti hai, unhon ne kaha: to Aap ne mujh se munh pher liya, phir main dusri janib se ghoom kar aaya aur maine kaha: Ya Rasulallah ye jhooti hai, Aap ne farmaya: tum is aurat ki baat ka kya karoge, use apne se alag kar do, Mamar ne kaha: aur maine Ayyub ko kehte hue suna: beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab ye kaha ja chuka to tera us ke sath rehne ka kya jawaz hai."
"1050","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne humein khabar di, Hammam se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek qaum ke samne qasam pesh ki to dono fareeq sab ke sab jaldi karne lage, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke un ke darmiyan qasam ke bare mein qura andazi ki jaye ke un mein se kaun qasam khaye."
"1051","Ibn al-Muqri aur Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ansar ko bulaya taake unhein Bahrain mein zameen kaat kar dein, to unhon ne kaha: nahin hatta ke Aap hamare Muhajirin bhaiyon ko bhi kaat kar dein, to Aap ne farmaya: beshak tum mere baad tarjeeh dena dekhoge, pas sabr karo hatta ke mujh se milo."
"1052","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ibn Abi Ja'far ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jo shakhs aisi zameen ko abad kare jo kisi ki malikiyat mein nahin to wahi us ka zyada haqdar hai, Urwah ne kaha: aur Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne apni khilafat mein isi ke mutabiq faisla kiya."
"1053","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, Sa'id se, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jo shakhs zameen par deewar se ihata kar le to wo usi ki hai."
"1054","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne humein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Sa'b ibn Jaththamah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Allah aur Us ke Rasul ke siwa koi hima nahin hai."
"1055","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Hammad ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah aur Abdul Aziz ibn Mukhtar dono ne humein khabar di, Khalid al-Hadhdha se, Ibn Sirin ke bhanje Yusuf se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap ne farmaya: jab tum raste ke bare mein ikhtilaf karo to us ki chaudai saat hath hogi."
"1056","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muthanna ibn Sa'id al-Duba'i se, Qatadah se, Bushair ibn Ka'b al-Adawi se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: rasta saat hath ka rakho."
"1057","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ma'mar ne Zuhri se, unhone Talha ibn Abdullah ibn Awf se, unhone Abdur Rahman ibn Sahl se, unhone Sa'id ibn Zaid ibn Amr ibn Nufail se riwayat kiya, unhone kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs zameen me se kuch chori kare use saat zameenon se tauq pehnaya jayega."
"1058","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne Zuhri se, unhone A'raj se, unhone Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ka padosi us se ijazat mange ke apni lakdi us ki deewar me gaade to use na roke, phir jab Abu Huraira ne apni hadees poori ki to logon ne apne sar jhuka liye, unhone kaha: Mujhe kya hai main tumhen is se munh pherte hue dekhta hun?! Allah ki qasam main ise zaroor tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan dalunga."
"1059","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhone kaha: Yunus ibn Yazid aur Laith ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se ke Urwa ibn Zubair ne un se hadees bayan ki, ke Abdullah ibn Zubair ne un se hadees bayan ki, Zubair ibn Awwam Raziallahu anhu se ke unhone Ansar ke ek aadmi se jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Badr me hazir hua tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas Harra ki ek naali ke baare me jhagda kiya jis se wo dono khajooron ko paani dete the, to Ansari ne kaha: Paani chhod de taake guzar jaye, to us ne inkar kar diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Zubair paani de phir paani apne padosi ki taraf bhej de, to Ansari ghusse me aa gaya, us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool kya is liye ke wo aap ki phuphi ka beta hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyir ho gaya, phir farmaya: Ae Zubair paani de phir paani ko rok le yahan tak ke wo mend tak wapas laut aaye, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zubair ke liye us ka poora haq wusool kar diya, aur is se pehle Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zubair ko aisi raay ki taraf ishara kiya tha jis me Zubair aur Ansari dono ke liye gunjaish chahi thi, to Zubair ne kaha: Mera khayal nahi ke ye aayat magar isi baare me nazil hui: Phir nahi aap ke Rab ki qasam wo iman nahi layenge yahan tak ke aap ko faisal kun banayen us me jo un ke darmiyan jhagda paida ho, aur un dono me se ek apne saathi par qisse me izafa karta hai."
"1060","Sulaiman ibn Dawud al-Qazzaz ad-Dari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Dawud Umar ibn Sa'd al-Hafari ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Humaid at-Tawil se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhone kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki kisi zauja ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek pyale me khana hadiya bheja, to Aisha ne pyale ko apne haath se maara to use gira diya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khana badle khana aur bartan badle bartan."
"1061","Bahr ibn Nasr ne humein khabar di ke Yahya ibn Hassan ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Ismail ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Shurahbil ibn Muslim al-Khawlani se, unhone kaha: Maine Abu Umama al-Bahili ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko Hajjatul Wada me farmate hue suna: Aariyat ada ki jayegi, aur minha wapas ki jayegi, aur qarz ada kiya jayega, aur zamin zimmedar hoga."
"1062","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sa'id ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Qatada se, Hasan se, Samura ibn Jundub Raziallahu anhu se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Haath par hai jo us ne liya yahan tak ke use ada kar de."
"1063","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne Hisham se hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, Aisha Raziallahu anha se: Ke Hind bint Utba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool Abu Sufyan bakheel aadmi hai aur mujhe aur mere bachche ko jo humein kafi ho nahi deta magar jo main us ke maal se lun aur wo na janta ho, unhone kaha: Jo tujhe aur tere bachche ko maroof tareeqe se kafi ho le lo."
"1064","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Haitham ibn Jamil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Musa ibn Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Hasan se, Samura Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhone farmaya: Jo shakhs apna samaan kisi aadmi ke paas pehchane wo us se le le aur wo jis ne use khareeda tha us se mutalba kare jis se us ne khareeda tha."
"1065","Ibn Abdul Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhone kaha: Amr ibn Harith aur Laith ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, Bukair ibn Ashajj se, Iyad ibn Abdullah se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me ek aadmi ko khareede hue phalon me nuqsan pahuncha to us ka qarz zyada ho gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par sadqa karo, to us par sadqa kiya gaya to wo us ke qarz ki adayegi ko na pahuncha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pao le lo, aur tumhare liye is ke siwa kuch nahi."
"1066","Abu Qilaba ar-Raqashi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abbad ibn Laith ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Abdul Majid wo Ibn Abi Yazid hain Abu Wahb ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Adda ibn Khalid ibn Haudha ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhe wo kitab na padhaun jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mere liye likhi thi? To maine kaha: Kyun nahi, to us ne mere liye ek kitab nikali to us me tha: Ye wo hai jo Adda ibn Khalid ibn Haudha ne Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se khareeda, ek ghulam ya laundi Abbad shak karte hain na koi bimari na koi dhoka na koi khabees aib, Musalman ka Musalman se bechna hai."
"1067","(102) Hijrat ka bab Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Auza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Zuhri ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Ata ibn Yazid al-Laithi ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to us ne aap se hijrat ke baare me poochha to aap ne farmaya: Afsos tujh par, beshak hijrat ka mamla sakht hai, kya tumhare paas oont hain? Us ne kaha: Ji han, aap ne farmaya: To kya tum un ka sadqa dete ho? Us ne kaha: Ji han, aap ne farmaya: Kya tum un me se atiya dete ho? Us ne kaha: Ji han, aap ne farmaya: To kya tum unhein un ke ghaat par doodh pilate ho? Us ne kaha: Ji han, aap ne farmaya: To samandaron ke peechhe se amal karo, pas beshak Allah tumhare amal me se kuch kam nahi karega."
"1068","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne Sufyan se hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Mujahid se, Taus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Fath ke baad koi hijrat nahi, aur jab tumhe jihad ke liye pukara jaye to nikal pado."
"1069","(103) Qayamat ke din tak jihad ke hamesha jari rehne ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhone Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Meri ummat me se ek giroh hamesha haq par qital karta rahega, ghalib reh kar qayamat ke din tak, unhone kaha: phir Isa ibn Maryam nazil honge to unka amir kahega: aaiye hamein namaz padhaiye, to wo kahenge: nahi, tum me se baaz baaz par amir hain, is ummat ke liye Allah ki taraf se izzat bakhshne ki wajah se."
"1070","(104) Us cheez ke bare me bab jiska Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko Allah Azza wa Jalla ki tawhid ki taraf dawat dene aur us par qital karne ka hukm diya gaya: Muhammad ibn Awf al-Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Uthman yani Ibn Said ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shuayb ne hamein al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhone kaha: Said ibn al-Musayyab ne hum se bayan kiya ke Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se qital karun yahan tak ke wo La ilaha illallah kahen, phir jo La ilaha illallah kahe usne apni jaan aur apna maal mujh se mehfooz kar liya magar uske haq ke sath, aur uska hisab Allah par hai."
"1071","(105) Jihad ke kifaya par farz hone ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hamein Abu Salih al-Samman se khabar di, unhone Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar meri ummat par ya kaha: logon par mashaqqat dalna na hota to main pasand karta ke Allah ke raste me ghazwa karne wali ya nikalne wali kisi sariyya ke peeche na rahun, lekin main itni gunjaish nahi pata ke main unhein sawari dun, aur na wo itni gunjaish pate hain ke mere peeche chalen, aur un par mere baad peeche reh jana giran guzarta hai, pas main chahta hun ke main Allah ke raste me qital karun phir qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda kiya jaun phir qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda kiya jaun phir qatl kiya jaun."
"1072","(106) Peeche reh jane me uzr rakhne wale ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Salih se, Ibn Shihab se, unhone kaha: Sahl ibn Sad al-Saidi Raziallahu anhu ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhone kaha: maine Marwan ibn al-Hakam ko masjid me baitha dekha, phir main aage badha yahan tak ke main unke paas baith gaya to unhone hamein khabar di ke Zayd ibn Thabit ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein imla karaya: La yastawi al-qaaiduna min al-muminina wal-mujahiduna fi sabilillah, unhone kaha: phir Ibn Umm Maktum unke paas aaye jabke wo mujhe imla kara rahe the, to unhone kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qasam agar main jihad ki istetaat rakhta to zarur jihad karta aur wo ek nabina shakhs the, to Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Apne Rasul (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par wahi nazil farmayi jabke Aap ki ran meri ran par thi, to wo itni bhari ho gayi ke mujhe dar hua ke meri ran kuchal jayegi, phir Aap se ye kaifiyat door kar di gayi, to Allah ne nazil farmaya: Ghayru uli al-darar."
"1073","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne hamein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhone kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujhe khabar di, Darraj Abu al-Samh se, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se ke ek shakhs Yaman se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf hijrat karke aaya, to usne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! maine hijrat ki hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumne shirk ko tark kar diya, lekin ye Allah ke raste me jihad hai, kya tumhara Yaman me koi hai? Usne kaha: mere walidain, Aap ne farmaya: kya unhone tumhein ijazat di hai? Usne kaha: nahi, Aap ne farmaya: wapas jao aur un dono se ijazat mango, phir agar wo tumhein ijazat dein to jihad karo warna un dono se neki karo."
"1074","(107) Ghazwa tark karne wale par sakhti me jo aaya uska bab: al-Rabi ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Asad yani Ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Sumayy se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar gaya aur usne ghazwa nahi kiya aur uske nafs me iska irada na tha, wo nifaq ki ek shaakh par mara."
"1075","(108) Ghazwe se jo kifayat kare aur jisne ghazi ko tayyar kiya uska bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, Busr ibn Said se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisne Allah ke raste me ghazi ko tayyar kiya to usne ghazwa kiya, aur jisne ghazi ke peeche uske ghar walon me bhalai ke sath khilafat ki to usne ghazwa kiya."
"1076","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Said mawla al-Mahri se, Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Banu Lihyan ki taraf ek lashkar bheja, Aap ne farmaya: Har do admiyon me se ek nikle, aur ajr dono ke darmiyan hai."
"1077","(109) Ghazwe par ujrat muqarrar karne ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Layth ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Haywah ibn Shurayh al-Kindi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Shufayy se, Shufayy se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Wapsi ghazwe ki tarah hai. Aur farmaya: Ghazi ke liye uska ajr hai, aur dene wale ke liye uska ajr aur ghazi ka ajr hai."
"1078","(110) Umara ki itaat me se jo wajib hai aur jab wo gunah ka hukm dein to unhein tark karne ka bab: al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhone kaha: Yala ibn Muslim ne mujhe khabar di, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhone kaha: Ya ayyuha allazina amanu atiullah wa atiur rasul wa ulil amri minkum ye Abdullah ibn Hudhafah ibn Qays ibn Adi al-Sahmi ke bare me nazil hui, jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein ek sariyya me bheja tha."
"1079","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs par sunna aur itaat karna lazim hai magar ye ke use Allah ki nafarmani ka hukm diya jaye, phir jab use nafarmani ka hukm diya jaye to na sunna hai na itaat."
"1080","(111) Lashkaron aur amiron ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki wasiyyat ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abd al-Samad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Alqamah ibn Marthad ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Buraydah al-Aslami se jinhone unse bayan kiya, unhone apne walid se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab kisi lashkar ya sariyya par amir muqarrar karke bhejte to use bulate phir use khaas apni zaat ke bare me aur jo Musalman uske sath hote unke bare me bhalai ki wasiyyat karte, phir farmate: Allah ke naam ke sath aur Allah ke raste me ghazwa karo, jo Allah ka inkar karte hain unse qital karo, ghazwa karo aur ghadr na karo aur ghanimat me khiyanat na karo aur musla na karo aur bachche ko qatl na karo, aur jab tum mushrikon me se apne dushman se milo to unhein teen khaslaton ya khislon me se ek ki taraf bulao, phir agar wo tumhein uska jawab dein to unse qubul kar lo aur unse ruk jao: unhein Islam ki taraf bulao, phir agar wo aisa karen to unhein khabar do ke unke liye wohi hai jo Musalmanon ke liye hai aur un par wohi hai jo Musalmanon par hai, phir unhein apne ghar se Muhajirin ke ghar ki taraf muntaqil hone ki dawat do, phir agar wo aisa karen to unhein khabar do ke unke liye wohi hai jo Muhajirin ke liye hai aur un par wohi hai jo Muhajirin par hai, phir agar wo Islam qabool karen aur apne ghar ko ikhtiyar karen to unhein khabar do ke wo dehati Mominon ki tarah hain un par Allah ka wohi hukm jari hoga jo Mominon ya kaha: Muslimon par jari hota hai, aur ghanimat aur fay me unka koi hissa nahi, phir agar wo inkar karen to unhein jizya dene ki taraf bulao, phir agar wo aisa karen to unse qubul kar lo aur unse ruk jao, phir agar wo inkar karen to Allah se madad mango aur unse qital karo, aur jab tum kisi qile ka muhasra karo phir wo tumse chahen ke tum unke liye Allah ka zimma aur Uske Rasul ka zimma muqarrar karo to unke liye Allah ka zimma aur na Uske Rasul ka zimma muqarrar karo, aur unke liye apna zimma aur apne aba ka zimma aur apne sathiyon ke zimme muqarrar karo, kyunki agar tum apna zimma aur apne aba ke zimme todo to ye tum par usse halka hai ke tum Allah ka zimma aur Uske Rasul ka zimma todo, aur jab tum kisi qile walon ka muhasra karo phir wo tumse chahen ke tum unhein Allah ke hukm par utaro to unhein Allah ke hukm par na utaro, kyunki tum nahi jante ke tum unke bare me Allah ke hukm ko paoge ya nahi, lekin unhein apne hukm par utaro."
"1081","(112) Aurton aur bachon ke qatl ki mumanaat ka bab: 1119 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne Layth se, Nafi se (riwayat karke) hum se bayan kiya, ke Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne unhein khabar di: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke baaz maghazi mein ek maqtula aurat pai gai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aurton aur bachon ke qatl par inkar farmaya."
"1082","(113) Raat ko hamla karne mein unko lag jane par gunah saqit hone ka bab: 1120 - Abd Allah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe al-Sab ibn Jaththamah ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) unke paas se guzre jabke woh al-Abwa mein - ya Waddan mein - the, unhon ne kaha: aur maine Aap ko suna ke Aap se mushrikeen ki basti ke bare mein poochha ja raha tha jismein raat ko hamla kiya jata hai to unki aurton aur unke bachon ko nuqsan pahunchta hai, Aap ne farmaya: Woh unhi mein se hain."
"1083","(114) Woh hadd jisko pahunch kar ladka zurriyat ki hadd se nikal jata hai uska bab: 1121 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Atiyyah al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Banu Qurayzah wale din woh aadmi ki sharmgah ke baal dekhte the, phir agar baal nikal aaye hote to use qatl kar dete aur agar na nikle hote to use chhor dete, phir unhon ne mere baal dekhe to woh nahin nikle the, to unhon ne mujhe chhor diya."
"1084","(115) Qasidon ke qatl ki mumanaat ka bab: 1122 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Asim se, Abu Wail se, Abd Allah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek aadmi se farmaya - yaani Musaylimah ke qasid se -: Agar tu qasid na hota to main tujhe qatl kar deta."
"1085","(116) Qital se pehle mushrikeen ko dawat dena tark karne ke bare mein jo aya hai uska bab: 1123 - Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muadh - yaani Ibn Muadh - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Awn se, unhon ne kaha: maine Nafi ko khat likha aur unse poochha kya qital se pehle dawat hoti thi? To unhon ne mujhe likha: Yeh to sirf Islam ke awwal mein tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Banu al-Mustaliq par chhapa mara jabke woh ghafil the, aur unke maweshi pani par pani pi rahe the, to Aap ne unhein qatl kiya aur unke qaidiyon ko qaid kiya, to us din Juwayriyah bint al-Harith haasil huin. Mujhe yeh hadees Abd Allah ibn Umar ne bayan ki, aur woh is lashkar mein the."
"1086","(117) Mushrikeen se madad na lene ka bab: 1124 - Abu Umayyah Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Tarsusi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Fudayl ibn Abi Abd Allah se, Abd Allah ibn Niyar se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kaha jabke Aap Badr ka irada kar rahe the: Kya main Aap ke sath niklun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hum kisi mushrik se madad nahin lete."
"1087","(118) Us tadad ka bab jisse bhagne par aadmi (maidan se) nahin nikalta: 1125 - Abd Allah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Un par farz kiya gaya tha ke ek aadmi das se na bhage, aur bees do sau se na bhagen, phir unse takhfeef ki gai to Allah ne farmaya: {Ab Allah ne tum se takhfeef farma di} Aur un par farz kiya gaya ke sau do sau se na bhagen aur na das bees se."
"1088","(119) Maidan-e-jang se kisi jamaat ki taraf bhagne wale ke bayan ka bab: 1126 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Isa al-Tabba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ek sariyya mein bheja, to log hat kar peeche hat gaye, phir hum Madina mein dakhil hue aur gharon mein chhup gaye, phir hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne zahir hue to humne kaha: Hum halak ho gaye Ya Rasulullah, hum bhag jane wale hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Balke tum dobara hamla karne wale ho, main tumhari jamaat hun."
"1089","(120) Jang mein baat ko pher kar kehne ki rukhsat ka bab: 1127 - Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se, Jabir ibn Abd Allah Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jang dhoka hai."
"1090","(121) Jiska aman jayez hai aur dastay ka lashkar ki taraf lautne ka bab: 1128 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shuayb se, unke walid se, unke dada Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Fath wale saal Makkah mein dakhil hue to hum mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khutba dene ke liye khade hue aur farmaya: Ae logon, jahiliyyat mein jo bhi hilf tha to Islam ne use mazbooti mein hi badhaya hai, aur Islam mein koi hilf nahin, aur Musalman unke siwa sab ke muqable mein ek haath hain, unka adna shakhs unki taraf se aman dega, aur unka door wala unki taraf lautayega, aur unke dastay unke peeche rehne walon ki taraf lauteinge, aur koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega, kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat ka aadha hai, na jalab hai aur na janab, aur unke sadaqat unke gharon ke siwa kahin nahin liye jayenge."
"1091","(122) Ghadar par sakht waeed ke bare mein jo aya hai uska bab: 1129 - Muhammad ibn Yahya aur al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, donon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah awwalin aur aakhirin ko Qayamat ke din jama karega to har ghadar ke liye ek jhanda buland kiya jayega, phir kaha jayega yeh fulan ki ghadari hai. Yeh hadees Ibn Yahya ke alfaz hain. al-Zafarani ne: Yaum al-Qiyamah ka zikr nahin kiya."
"1092","(123) Khajoor ke darakhton ko jalane ka bab: 1130 - Abu Said al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah - yaani Ibn Khalid - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Nafi ne hadees bayan ki, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Banu al-Nadir ke khajoor ke darakht jalaye."
"1093","(124) Aurton ke aman ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Sa'id al-Maqburi se, unhon ne Abu Murrah se ke Umm Hani' ne apne do hamuon ko aman di, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hum ne us ko aman de di jis ko tum ne aman di, aur hum ne us ko aman diya jis ko tum ne aman diya."
"1094","Ibn al-Muqri' ne kaha: Aur Sufyan ne humein ye hadees ek aur martaba bayan ki, unhon ne Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Murrah mawla Aqeel se, unhon ne Umm Hani' Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas ayi - aur unhon ne us ka zikr kiya."
"1095","(125) Musla karne ki mumaniat ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Hayyaj se ke ek ghulam - shayad unhon ne kaha ke us ne apne baap se - bhaag gaya, to us ne nazr mani ke agar wo us par qadir ho gaya to zaroor us mein se koi tukda kaat dega, phir jab wo us ke paas wapas aa gaya to us ne mujhe Imran ibn Husayn ke paas bheja, to main ne un se pucha, to Imran Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Jo apne ghulam ko azad karna chahe ya apni qasam ka kaffara dena chahe, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) humein sadqe ki targheeb dete the aur musla karne se mana farmate the. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Samurah ke paas aya, to unhon ne Imran ki baat jaisi baat kahi."
"1096","(126) Zawat al-ruh ko jalane ki mumaniat ka bab: Bahr ibn Nasr al-Khawlani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Shu'ayb ibn al-Layth se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Bukayr se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ek lashkar mein bheja aur farmaya: Agar tum falan aur falan ko pao - Quraysh ke do admiyon ke liye - to un dono ko aag se jala dena. Phir jab hum nikalne lage to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Maine tumhein hukm diya tha ke falan aur falan ko aag se jalana, halanke aag se azab Allah ke siwa koi nahin deta, pas agar tum un dono ko pao to un dono ko qatl kar dena."
"1097","(127) Jasus par qabu pa liya jaye phir wo Islam le aye us ke bare mein jo aya us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hammam al-Dallal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan al-Thawri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Harithah ibn Mudarrib se, unhon ne Furat ibn Hayyan se - aur wo Abu Sufyan ka jasoos aur haleef tha - jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke qatl ka hukm diya tha, phir wo Ansar ki ek halqa ke paas se guzra to un mein se ek admi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo kehta hai: Beshak main Musalman hun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se kuch aise mard hain jinhein hum un ke iman ke supurd karte hain, un mein se Furat ibn Hayyan hai."
"1098","(128) Ghore bandhne ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Nafi' se, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalai bandhi hui hai. Aur Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Hamesha qayamat ke din tak."
"1099","(129) Zirah pehenne ke bare mein jo aya us ka bab: Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yazid ibn Khusayfah se, unhon ne Sa'ib ibn Yazid se - InshaAllah - ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Uhud ke din do zirahein pehne hue the."
"1100","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Nabi ke liye jayez nahin ke jab wo apna jangi libas pehen le to use utare hatta ke wo qital kare."
"1101","(130) Aadmi ka apne ghore ko sadhane aur teer-andazi ki fazilat ka bab: Abbas ibn al-Walid al-Bayruti ne humein khabar di ke un ke walid ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jabir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sallam ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid - wo Ibn Yazid hain - ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main teer-andaz admi tha aur Uqbah al-Juhani mujhe bulate the aur kehte the: Aao Khalid! Hamare sath nikal kar teer chalao, phir jab ek din main un se piche reh gaya to unhon ne kaha: Aao main tumhein wo batata hun jo mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne bayan farmaya, aur tum se wo kehta hun jo mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya, main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Beshak Allah ek hi teer ke zariye teen afrad ko Jannat mein dakhil farmayega: us ke banane wale ko jo us ke banane mein khair ki niyyat rakhe, us se teer chalane wale ko, aur use teer pakrane wale ko, aur tum teer-andazi karo aur sawari karo, aur tumhara teer chalana mujhe tumhare sawar hone se zyada mehboob hai, aur khel-kud mein se kuch nahin siwaye teen ke: aadmi ka apne ghore ko sadhana, apni biwi se dil-lagi karna, aur apni kaman aur teeron se nishana lagana, aur jo shakhs teer-andazi seekhne ke baad us se be-raghbati karte hue use tark kar de, to beshak ye ek nemat hai jis ki us ne nashukri ki."
"1102","(131) Jang mein shiar ke bare mein jo aya us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Sufyan se, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Muhallab ibn Abi Sufrah se, unhon ne us shakhs se jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Agar dushman tum par raat ko chhapa mare, to tumhara shiar ye hai: Ha-Mim, wo madad nahin kiye jayenge."
"1103","(132) Dushman ki zameen mein Masahif le jane ki karahat ka bab: Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne Nafi' se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Quran lekar dushman ki zameen ki taraf safar karne se mana farmaya; is andeshe se ke dushman use haasil kar lega."
"1104","(133) Qital ke waqt dua ke bare mein jo aya us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Ya'qub ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ibn Dinar ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sahl ibn Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Do duayein radd nahin hotin - ya farmaya ke radd nahin ki jatin - azaan ke waqt dua aur sakht ladai ke waqt jab ek dusre se gutham-gutha hote hain."
"1105","(134) Ladai ke liye saf bandi aur (sawari se) utarne ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nufaili ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Bara ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: pas woh utre aur madad talab ki - ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) - phir unhon ne kaha: main Nabi hun, jhoot nahin, main Ibn Abd al-Muttalib hun, phir unhon ne apne sahaba ki saf bandi ki."
"1106","(135) Dushman ki bastiyon mein imam ke qiyam aur ghalbe ke baad theharne ka bab: Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Mu'adh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Anas se, unhon ne Abu Talhah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab kisi qaum par ghalib aate to un ki bastiyon mein teen din qiyam karna pasand farmate."
"1107","(136) Us maal ka bab jise dushman le le phir woh Musalmanon ke hath lag jaye: Muhammad ibn Uthman Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ubaid Allah se, unhon ne Nafi' se, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ka ek ghoda chala gaya to use dushman ne le liya, phir Musalman un par ghalib aaye to woh unhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein wapas kar diya gaya, aur un ka ek ghulam bhag kar Rum ki zameen se ja mila, phir Musalman un par ghalib aaye to Khalid ibn al-Walid ne use Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke baad unhein wapas kar diya."
"1108","(137) Ahd ki muddat poori hone se pehle dushman ke mulk mein safar ki karahat ka bab: Abu Ja'far Muhammad ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Mubarak Mukharrami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Fayd se, unhon ne Sulaim ibn Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah aur Rum ke darmiyan ahd tha, unhon ne kaha: pas un ke paas Amr ibn Abasah kaha jane wala ek shakhs apne ghode par aya, pas woh kehne laga: Allahu Akbar, wafa ho, ghadar na ho, main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs kisi qaum se ahd rakhta ho woh na koi girah mazboot kare aur na use khole hatta ke us ki muddat poori ho jaye, ya woh barabari par un ki taraf (ahd) phaink de, unhon ne kaha: pas Mu'awiyah ne lashkaron ko wapas lauta diya."
"1109","(138) Mu'ahidon ke khoon ke haram hone ka bab: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid - ya'ni Ibn Harun - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uyaynah - ya'ni Ibn Abd al-Rahman - ne humein khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Bakrah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi mu'ahid ko na-haq qatl kiya, Allah ne us par Jannat haram kar di ke woh us ki khushbu bhi na paye."
"1110","(139) Ghanaim ke halal kiye jane ki ibteda ka bab: Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne A'mash se, unhon ne Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Tum se pehle kalay sir walon mein se kisi qaum ke liye ghanaim halal nahin hue, aasman se aag utarti thi pas use kha jati thi, unhon ne kaha: phir jab Badr ka din hua to log ghanaim ki taraf jaldi karne lage, pas Allah ne nazil farmaya: Agar Allah ki taraf se pehle likhi hui (taqdeer) na hoti to jo kuch tum ne liya us mein tumhein azeem azab pohanchta."
"1111","(140) Taqseem ke baghair dushman ke khano ke mubah hone ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaibani ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Abi al-Mujalid se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: mujhe masjid walon ne Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ke paas bheja, pas main ne un se Khaibar ke khane ke bare mein pucha: kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ka khumus nikala tha? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, woh is se kahin halka (ma'muli) tha, hum mein se har ek us mein se apni zaroorat le leta tha."
"1112","(141) Chhote dastoun ka lashkar walon ki taraf (ghanimat) lautane ke bare mein jo warid hua us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Ishaq Saghani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaid Allah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shu'aib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke khoon barabar hain, un mein se adna shakhs un ki taraf se zimme (aman) ki koshish karta hai, aur un mein se door wala un par panah deta hai, aur woh ghairon ke muqable mein ek hath hain, un ka taqatwar un ke kamzor ki taraf lautata hai, aur un ka chhapa mar dastah apne peeche theharne walon ki taraf lautata hai, kisi momin ko kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega, aur na ahd wale ko us ke ahd mein (qatl kiya jayega)."
"1113","(142) Lashkar se nikalne wale chhote daste ko khumus mein se nafal dene ka bab: Muhammad ibn Awf Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'aib ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki): ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Najd ki taraf ek lashkar bheja, pas us lashkar mein se ek chhota dastah bheja aur us mein Ibn Umar bhi the, pas Ibn Umar ne bayan kiya ke (bade) lashkar ke hisse barah barah oont pahunche, pas us chhote daste walon ko jis mein Ibn Umar the us ke siwa ek ek oont nafal mein diya gaya, pas chhote daste walon ke liye terah terah (oont) hue, aur (bade) lashkar walon ke liye barah barah."
"1114","(143) Fazilat dene mein ek aur surat: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ibn Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas ibn Salamah ibn al-Akwa' ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid Raziallahu anhu ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aaj ke din behtareen shahsawar Abu Qatadah hain, aur hamare behtareen pyadah Salamah hain, phir unhon ne mujhe do hisse diye, ghudsawar ka hissa aur pyadah ka hissa dono jama karke."
"1115","(144) Qatil ko maqtul ka salb nafal mein dene ka bab: Rabi' ibn Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Malik ibn Anas ko hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne Umar ibn Kathir ibn Aflah se, unhon ne Abu Muhammad mawla Abu Qatadah se, unhon ne Abu Qatadah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Hunain ke din nikle, phir jab hum aamne samne hue to Musalmanon ko paspai hui, unhon ne kaha: pas main ne mushrikon mein se ek shakhs ko dekha jo Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs par chadh gaya tha, unhon ne kaha: pas main us ke liye ghoom kar us ke peeche se us tak aya aur use us ke kandhe ki rag par mara, aur woh meri taraf mutawajjeh hua aur mujhe itne zor se bheenchha ke main ne us mein maut ki boo pai, phir use maut ne aa liya pas us ne mujhe chhod diya, pas main Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu se ja mila aur main ne kaha: logon ka kya haal hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ka hukm hai, unhon ne kaha: phir log wapas aaye aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) baith gaye pas farmaya: Jis ne kisi (dushman) ko qatl kiya jis par us ke paas gawah ho, pas us ka salb usi ka hai, Abu Qatadah ne kaha: pas main khada hua aur main ne kaha: mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya, phir unhon ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi (dushman) ko qatl kiya jis par us ke paas gawah ho pas us ka salb usi ka hai, unhon ne kaha: pas main khada hua aur main ne kaha: mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya, phir unhon ne teesri martaba yehi farmaya, pas main khada hua, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhein kya hai ai Abu Qatadah? Unhon ne kaha: pas main ne unhein qissa sunaya, pas qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha ai Rasulullah, aur us maqtul ka salb mere paas hai pas use us ke haq ke badle razi karo, pas Abu Bakr Siddiq Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Allah ki qasam aisa hargiz nahin, kya woh Allah ke sheron mein se ek sher ki taraf jo Allah aur us ke Rasul ke liye lad raha hai qasd kare phir tumhein us ka salb de de, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha, use woh de do, pas us ne mujhe de diya, unhon ne kaha: pas main ne zirah bech di aur us ke badle Banu Salamah mein khajooron ka bagh khareeda, pas beshak ye sab se pehla maal hai jo main ne Islam mein jama kiya, unhon ne kaha: aur makhraf se murad khajoor (ke darakht) hain."
"1116","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Mughirah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubair ibn Nufair ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Awf ibn Malik Ashja'i aur Khalid ibn al-Walid Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat ki) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne salb ka khumus nahin nikala."
"1117","(145) Saraya ko khumus ke baad nafl dene ka bab, jab woh (maal) haasil kar chuken hon: Abdullah ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abd al-Aziz se, Makhul se, Ziyad ibn Jariyah se, Habib ibn Maslamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat hai): ke Aap ne khumus ke baad chauthai (hissa) nafl ke tor par ata farmaya."
"1118","Abbas ibn al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya ke un ke walid ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abd al-Aziz ne kaha, unhon ne kaha: Makhul ne hum se bayan kiya, Ziyad ibn Jariyah se, Habib ibn Maslamah se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat hai): ke Aap ne ibtida (pehli rawangi) mein chauthai nafl diya, aur wapsi mein tihai (nafl diya)."
"1119","(146) Ghall (maal-e-ghanimat mein khiyanat) karne wale par sakht wa'id aur khumus kahan rakha jaye, is bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyash ibn al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-A'la ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Shu'ayb ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri chadar wapas karo, meri chadar wapas karo, Allah ki qasam! Agar mere paas Tihamah ke darakhton ki tadad ke barabar maweshi hote to main unhen tumhare darmiyan taqseem kar deta, aur tum mujhe bakheel na paoge, na buzdil, na jhoota, phir Aap ek oont ke pehlu mein khare hue aur us ke kohan se oon ka ek baal liya, phir farmaya: Aye logon! Beshak tumhare fay (maal) mein se is (baal) jaisi (haqeer cheez) ke siwa mere liye kuch nahin hai, magar khumus, aur khumus (bhi) tumhi par lautaya hua hai, pas dhaga aur sui (tak) ada kar do, kyunke ghulul (khiyanat) apne karne wale ke liye Qayamat ke din aar aur aag aur ruswai hoga, phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs baalon ke dhagon ka ek gola lekar aya to kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Maine ise apne oont ki zakhmi hui chadar (burdah) silne ke liye liya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mera hissa hai woh tumhara hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab baat yahan tak pahunch gayi hai to mujhe is mein koi hajat nahin."
"1120","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid, woh al-Ahmar hain, ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, Abu Amrah se jo unhi ke mawla hain, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se (riwayat hai). Aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne mujhe khabar di ke Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban ne unhen khabar di ke Abu Amrah, jo Zayd ibn Khalid ke mawla hain, ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani ko zikr karte hue suna ke Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs Khaybar mein faut ho gaya aur unhon ne us ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya taake Aap us par (janaze ki) namaz parhen to Aap ne farmaya: Apne sathi par (khud) namaz parho, to logon ke chehre mutaghayyir ho gaye, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne dekha jo unhen (pareshani) thi, to farmaya: Beshak tumhare sathi ne sabilillah (Allah ke raste) mein ghulul (khiyanat) kiya hai, unhon ne kaha: To hum ne us ke saman ki talashi li to Yahud ke mankon mein se (kuch) manke paye, Allah ki qasam! Jo do dirham ke barabar bhi na the."
"1121","(147) Ghall (khiyanat karne wale) ke saman ko jalane aur us ki saza ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Bahr al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, apne walid se, apne dada se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar ne ghall (khiyanat karne wale) ko kode se mara aur us ka saman jala diya aur us ka hissa rok liya."
"1122","(148) Dushman ke qareeb maal-e-ghana'im ki taqseem mein jaldi karne ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ji'ranah mein maal-e-ghana'im taqseem farma rahe the to ek shakhs khara hua aur kaha: Adl karen kyunke Aap ne adl nahin kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tujh par afsos! Agar main adl na karun to kaun adl karega? Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Mujhe chhor den ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun, to Aap ne farmaya: Use chhor do, beshak is ke sath kuch sathi hain, ya (farmaya:) is ke sathiyon mein (aise log hain), jo Quran parhte hain (lekin) jo un ke halq se tajawuz nahin karta, deen se is tarah nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se (paar) nikal jata hai."
"1123","(149) Ghudsawar aur pyada ke hisse ka bab: al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah al-Darir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne (ghudsawar) shakhs aur us ke ghore ke liye teen hisse muqarrar farmaye: ek hissa us ke liye, aur do hisse us ke ghore ke liye."
"1124","(150) Aurat aur ghulam jo jang mein hazir hon un ko razkh (thora sa atiyyah) dene ka bab: Muhammad ibn Abd Allah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Iyad ne mujhe khabar di, Ja'far ibn Muhammad se, apne walid se, Yazid ibn Hurmuz se: ke Najdah ne Abd Allah ibn Abbas ko khat likha, to Ibn Abbas ne unhen (jawab mein) likha: Tum ne mujhe likh kar pucha hai ke kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aurton ke sath ghazwa karte the? Aur Aap un ke sath ghazwa karte the, pas woh mareezon ki marham-patti kartin aur unhen maal-e-ghanimat mein se (kuch) diya jata tha, lekin raha (muqarrar) hissa to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke liye koi hissa muqarrar nahin farmaya tha."
"1125","Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Sa'igh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qays ibn Sa'd ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Hurmuz se, unhon ne kaha: Najdah ne Abbas ko chand cheezon ke bare mein puchte hue likha, unhon ne kaha: To main Ibn Abbas ke paas hazir tha jab unhon ne us ka khat parha, aur jab unhon ne unhen (jawab) likha, unhon ne kaha: Aur tum ne aurat aur ghulam ke bare mein pucha hai ke kya jab woh sakht lara'i mein hazir hon to un ke liye koi muqarrar hissa tha? Pas un ke liye koi muqarrar hissa na tha, magar ye ke unhen qawm ke ghana'im mein se (thora sa) diya jata tha."
"1126","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs, yani Ibn Ghiyath, ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Zayd se, Umayr mawla Abi al-Lahm se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Khaybar mein hazri di jabke main ghulam tha, to maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere liye hissa muqarrar farmaden, unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne mujhe ek talwar di, farmaya: Ise (gale mein) latka lo, aur mujhe ghar ke raddi saman mein se (kuch) diya."
"1127","(151) Is par dalil ka bab ke maal-e-ghanimat us ke liye hai jo lara'i mein hazir ho: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Walid al-Zubaydi se ke Anbasah ibn Sa'id ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah ko Sa'id ibn al-As se hadees bayan karte hue suna: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Aban ibn Sa'id ibn al-As ko Madinah se Najd ki taraf ek sariyyah par bheja, phir Aban aur un ke sathi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas Khaybar mein us ke fath hone ke baad aye, jabke un ke ghoron ke tange lif (khajur ke reshe) ke the, to Aban ne kaha: Mere liye taqseem farmaden Ya Rasulullah! Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: To maine kaha: Un ke liye taqseem na farmaden Ya Rasulullah! To Aban ne kaha: Tum is (hasad) ke sath ho, aye wabr (jungli chuhe) jo bakri ke sar se utra hai, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Baith jao aye Aban! Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke liye taqseem nahin farmayi. Aur riwayat kiya gaya hai ke Aap ne Khaybar mein se Ja'far aur un ke sathiyon ko diya tha."
"1128","Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Qirati ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne humen khabar di, Burayd se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: To hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aye jab Aap ne Khaybar fath kiya tha, to Aap ne humare liye hissa muqarrar farmaya, ya (farmaya:) Aap ne humen us mein se diya, aur Aap ne Khaybar ki fath se ghayab rehne wale kisi shakhs ke liye us mein se kuch taqseem nahin farmaya, siwa us ke jo Aap ke sath hazir tha, magar hamari kashti wale sathiyon ke sath jo Ja'far aur un ke sathiyon ke sath the, un ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hissa taqseem farmaya."
"1129","(152) Qaidiyon se fidya lene ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab 1168 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nufaili ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Yahya ibn Abbad ne bayan kiya, apne walid Abbad ibn Abdullah ibn Zubair se, Ayesha Raziallahu anha se jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja hain, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ahle Makkah ne apne qaidiyon ke fidye ke liye bheja to Zainab bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Abu al-As ke fidye mein bheja, aur us mein apna ek haar bheja jo Khadija ne unhen Abu al-As se shadi ke waqt pehnaya tha, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use dekha to un ke liye shadeed narmi se narm pade aur farmaya: Agar tum munasib samjho to us ke qaidi ko us ke liye riha kar do aur jo us ka hai use wapas lauta do to aisa kar do? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han Ai Allah ke Rasul, phir unhon ne use riha kar diya aur jo us ka tha use wapas lauta diya."
"1130","(153) Qaidiyon ko baghair fidye ke riha karne ka bab 1169 - Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Muhammad ibn Jubair se, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Mut'im ibn Adi Abu Jubair zinda hota aur mujh se in galeez logon ke bare mein guftagu karta - yani Badr ke qaidiyon ke bare mein - to main unhen us ki khatir riha kar deta. 1170 - Sufyan ne ek martaba kaha: Muhammad ibn Jubair, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam)."
"1131","(154) Zabardasti fatah shuda zameen taqseem karne ka bab 1171 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaid ibn Aslam se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Agar aakhri Musalman na hote to main koi basti fatah na karta magar use taqseem kar deta, jaisa ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaibar ko taqseem kiya tha."
"1132","(155) Mushrikeen ke ghulamon mein se jo Islam le aye us ke azad hone ka bab 1172 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harun ibn Ma'ruf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Aban ibn Salih se, Mansur ibn al-Mu'tamir se, Rib'i se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Sulah se pehle Hudaibiya ke din Ahle Makkah ke do ghulam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf nikal aye aur Islam le aye, to Ahle Makkah mein se un ke maalikon ne un ke bare mein bheja: Allah ki qasam Ai Muhammad, woh tumhare paas tumhare deen ki raghbat se nikal kar nahin aye, balke woh sirf ghulami se bhaag kar nikle hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se kuch aadmiyon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha Ai Allah ke Rasul, unhen un ki taraf wapas lauta dijiye, to Aap ghazabnak hue phir farmaya: Ai Quraish ki jama'at, main tumhen is deen par baaz aate hue nahin dekhta yahan tak ke Allah tum par aisa shakhs bhej de jo tumhari gardanein mare, phir unhen wapas lautane se inkar kiya aur farmaya: Woh Allah ke azad kardah hain."
"1133","(156) Aaimma par adl wajib hone ka bab 1173 - Muhammad ibn Usman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek nigran hai aur tum mein se har ek se us ki riaya ke bare mein sawal hoga, phir logon par jo ameer hai woh un par nigran hai aur un ke bare mein us se sawal hoga, khabardar, aadmi apne ghar walon par nigran hai aur un ke bare mein us se sawal hoga, khabardar, aurat apne shauhar ke ghar par nigran hai aur un ke bare mein us se sawal hoga, khabardar, ghulam apne aaqa ke maal par nigran hai aur us ke bare mein us se sawal hoga, khabardar, tum mein se har ek nigran hai aur tum mein se har ek se us ki riaya ke bare mein sawal hoga."
"1134","(157) Lashkaron ko baari baari bhejne mein jo wajib hai us ka bab 1174 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, ke Abdullah ibn Ka'b al-Ansari ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se Ansar ka ek lashkar bola: Ai Umar, aap ne hum se ghaflat barti aur humen nazar andaz kar diya, aur hamare darmiyan us cheez ko chhor diya jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hukm diya tha ke lashkar ke ek hisse ke baad dusre hisse ko baari baari bheja jaye, aur unhon ne baqi hadees zikr ki."
"1135","(158) Bai'at ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab 1175 - Yusuf ibn Musa aur Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hum mein se har ek se sunne aur ita'at par bai'at lete the, phir us se kehte: Jitni tum istita'at rakho."
"1136","(159) Jis par ghode ya oont daudaye baghair qabza hua ho aur khums aur safaya ke zikr ka bab 1176 - Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Zuhri se, Malik ibn Aus se, Umar Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Banu Nadir ke amwal mein se apne ghar walon par ek saal ka kharch karte the, aur woh us mein se tha jo Allah ne apne Rasul ko fai ke taur par diya tha jis par Musalmanon ne ghode ya oont nahin daudaye the, aur jo baqi bachta use ghode aur hathiyar mein rakhte the Allah ke raste mein taiyari ke taur par."
"1137","1177 - Muhammad ibn Awf al-Ta'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Sa'id ibn Kathir ibn Dinar aur Abu al-Yaman aur Bishr ibn Shu'aib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'aib ibn Abi Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Urwa ibn Zubair ne bayan kiya ke Ayesha Raziallahu anha ne unhen khabar di ke Fatima bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhuma ki taraf apni virasat mangne ke liye bheja jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf se thi us mein se jo Allah ne apne Rasul ko fai ke taur par diya tha, aur Fatima us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke us sadqe ka mutalba kar rahi thin jo Madina aur Fadak mein tha, aur Khaibar ke khums mein se jo baqi tha, Ayesha Raziallahu anha ne kaha, Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hum mein se koi waris nahin banta, jo hum chhor jayen woh sadqa hai, Aale Muhammad sirf is maal mein se khate hain - yani: Allah ke maal mein se - unhen khane se zyada lene ka haq nahin hai. Aur Allah ki qasam, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sadqon mein se kisi cheez ko us haalat se nahin badlunga jis par woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein thin aur main un mein waisa hi amal karunga jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un mein amal kiya tha."
"1138","1178 - Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Qurra ibn Khalid se, Abu al-Ala' Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Shikhkhir se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Basra mein Mirbad mein baithe the, phir ek dehati ek chamde ya thaili ke tukde ke sath aya aur bola: Yeh woh kitab hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mere liye likhi thi, Abu al-Ala' ne kaha: Phir maine use liya aur qaum ko parh kar sunaya to us mein tha: Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim, yeh kitab Muhammad Rasulullah ki taraf se Banu Zuhair ibn Uqaish ke liye hai, agar tum namaz qaim karo aur zakat do, aur ghanimaton mein se khums aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka hissa aur safi do, to tum Allah ke aman aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke aman mein aman wale ho. Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne us se kaha: Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko kuch kehte hue suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Maine unhen kehte hue suna: Sabr ke mahine ka roza, aur har mahine mein teen din ka roza seene ke kine ko door kar dete hain. Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Kya tum ne khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum samajhte ho ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par jhoot bolunga? Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne kitab li aur peeth pher kar hat gaya. Yeh hadees Ahmasi ki hai, aur alfaz mutaqarib hain."
"1139","(160) Yahudiyon ko jila watan karne ka bab 1179 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne humen khabar di, Musa ibn Uqba se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Yahud Banu Nadir aur Quraiza ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se jang ki, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Banu Nadir ko jila watan kar diya aur Quraiza ko rehne diya, aur un par ehsan kiya, yahan tak ke Quraiza ne us ke baad jang ki, phir un ke mardon ko qatl kiya aur un ki aurton, bachchon aur amwal ko Musalmanon mein taqseem kiya siwae un mein se kuch ke jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se aa mile to unhen aman diya aur woh Islam le aye, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Madina ke tamam Yahudiyon ko jila watan kar diya, Banu Qaynuqa' jo Abdullah ibn Salam ki qaum hain, aur Banu Haritha ke Yahud aur har Yahudi jo Madina mein tha."
"1140","(161) Khaibar ke zikr ka bab 1180 - Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaibar walon se us mein se nikalne wali khajoor ya kheti ke aadhe hisse par muamala kiya tha."
"1141","Rabi' ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usamah ne mujhe khabar di, Nafi' se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Khaybar fatah hua to Yahud ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se darkhwast ki ke unhen wahan is shart par rehne den ke woh wahan se nikalne wali khajoor aur kheti me se aadhe par kaam karenge, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tak hum chahenge tumhen is par wahan rehne denge, aur woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ke zamane me isi tarah wahan rahe, aur khajoor Khaybar ke aadhe hisse me se hisson ke mutabiq taqseem ki jati thi, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khums lete the."
"1142","(162) Jazeerat-ul-Arab se Yahud ke ikhraj ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu-az-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Umar ibn-ul-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Main zaroor Yahud aur Nasara ko Jazeerat-ul-Arab se nikalunga hatta ke Muslim ke siwa kisi ko na chhodunga."
"1143","(163) Jizyah ka bab: Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Al-A'mash se, Abu Wa'il se, Masruq se, Mu'adh Raziallahu anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen Yemen ki taraf bheja aur unhen hukm diya ke tees gaayon me se ek tabi' ya tabi'ah len aur har baligh se ek dinar ya us ke barabar Ma'afir kapra len."
"1144","Ibn-ul-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Amr se bayan kiya, unhon ne Bajalah ko kehte hue suna: Main Jaz' ibn Mu'awiyah ka katib tha, to Umar Raziallahu anhu ka khat un ki wafat se ek saal pehle humare pas aaya: Har jadugar ko qatl karo, aur Majus me se har zi-mehram ke darmiyan aur Kitabullah me us ke harim ke darmiyan tafreeq karo, aur khana tayyar karo aur talwar apni ran par rakho, to unhon ne baghair zamzamah ke khaya aur ek khacchar ya do khaccharon ka bojh chandi ka dala, aur Umar Raziallahu anhu Majus se jizyah nahin lete the hatta ke Abdur Rahman ibn Awf Raziallahu anhu ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hajar ke Majus se jizyah liya tha. Dar-ul-Kutub Al-Ilmiyyah ke taba' me Jareemah hai, aur durust woh hai jo hum ne sabit kiya hai."
"1145","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne Hisham ibn Urwah se, un ke walid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hakim Raziallahu anhu Sham me Umayr Al-Ansari ke pas dakhil hue, aur woh Umar Raziallahu anhu ke aamil the, to woh un ke pas dakhil hue aur un ke pas Anbat me se kuch log dhoop me khade paye, to unhon ne kaha: In logon ka kya haal hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine unhen jizyah me rok rakha hai, to Hisham ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo duniya me logon ko azab dega Allah use akhirat me azab dega, to Umayr ne unhen chhod diya aur unhen jaane diya."
"1146","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Haytham ibn Jamil aur Ibn-ut-Tabba' ne hum se bayan kiya, donon ne kaha: Jarir ne Qabus se, un ke walid se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek basti me do millaten - aur Ibn-ut-Tabba' ne kaha: do qiblen - durust nahin reh sakten, aur Musalman par koi jizyah nahin hai."
"1147","(164) Anwatan fatah shuda zameen par kharaj muqarrar karne ki daleel ka bab: Hasan ibn Ali ibn Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Adam - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ne Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Iraq apna qafeez aur dirham rok lega, Sham apna mudy aur dinar rok lega, Misr apna irdabb aur dinar rok lega, aur tum wahan laut jaoge jahan se tum ne ibteda ki thi, ise teen martaba kaha. Abu Hurayrah ka gosht aur khoon is par gawah hai."
"1148","(165) Mushrikon ke tohfon ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abbas ibn Sahl se, Abu Humayd As-Sa'idi se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Tabuk wale saal me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath nikle hatta ke Tabuk pahunche, phir Aylah ke badshah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aa kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek safed khacchar tohfe me diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use ek burd pehnaya aur un ke liye un ke samandar ke bare me likh diya."
"1149","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne Qatadah se, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn-ash-Shikhkhir se, Iyad ibn Himar Al-Mujashi'i se khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek oontni - ya kaha: ek tohfa - hadya kiya, to unhon ne un se farmaya: Kya tum Islam le aaye ho, unhon ne kaha: Nahin, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Mushrikon ke zabd se (aur un ke atiye se) mana kiya gaya hai."
"1150","(166) Un suraton ka bab jin me maal-e-fay kharch kiya jata hai: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne Az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us shakhs par namaz nahin padhte the jis par qarz hota, phir ek mayyat layi gayi to unhon ne pucha: Kya is par qarz hai, logon ne kaha: Han, do dinar, to unhon ne farmaya: Apne sathi par namaz padho, to Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Ai Rasulullah, woh donon mere zimme hain, to unhon ne us par namaz padhi, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Allah ne Apne Rasul ko fatah ata farmai to unhon ne farmaya: Main har momin ki us ki jaan se zyada qareeb hun, jo qarz chhod jaye to woh mere zimme hai aur jo maal chhod jaye to woh us ke warison ke liye hai."
"1151","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu-al-Mughirah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Jubayr ibn Nufayr ne apne walid se, Awf ibn Malik se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas koi cheez aati to use usi din taqseem kar dete, to shadi-shuda ko do hisse dete aur ghair-shadi-shuda ko ek hissa dete, unhon ne kaha: To mujhe bulaya gaya - aur mujhe Ammar ibn Yasir se pehle bulaya jata tha - to mujhe bulaya gaya aur mujhe do hisse diye, aur mere ahl-o-ayal the, phir us ke baad Ammar ko bulaya gaya to unhen ek hissa diya."
"1152","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne Salih se, Ibn Shihab se, Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn-ul-Harith ibn Nawfal ibn-ul-Harith ibn Abdul Muttalib se bayan kiya, ke Abd-ul-Muttalib ibn Rabi'ah ibn-ul-Harith ibn Abdul Muttalib ne unhen khabar di, use khabar diya ke Rabi'ah ibn-ul-Harith aur Abbas ibn Abdul Muttalib jama hue aur donon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, agar hum in donon ladkon ko - mere liye aur Fadl ibn-ul-Abbas ke liye - Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf bhejen to woh unhen in sadqat par aamil bana denge, phir unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: To hum ne un se baat ki aur hum ne kaha: Ai Rasulullah, hum Aap ke pas aaye hain taake Aap humen in sadqat par aamil banaden, to unhon ne farmaya: Khabardar, sadaqah Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad ke liye munasib nahin, woh to logon ka mail hai, mere liye Mahmiyah ibn-ul-Jaz' ko bulao - aur woh ushoor par the - aur Abu Sufyan ibn-ul-Harith ko, to woh donon un ke pas aaye, to unhon ne Mahmiyah se farmaya: Is ladke ka - Fadl ke liye - apni beti se nikah kardo, to unhon ne us ka nikah kardia, aur Abu Sufyan se farmaya: Is ladke ka apni beti se nikah kardo, to unhon ne nikah kardia. Phir unhon ne Mahmiyah se farmaya: Un donon ki taraf se khums me se mehar ada karo."
"1153","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Al-Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Abdullah ibn Nafi ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya ke jab Muawiyah Hajj ke liye Madina tashreef laye to Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma un ke paas aaye, to Muawiyah ne un se kaha: Aye Abu Abdur Rahman! Aap ki hajat kya hai? To unhon ne un se kaha: Meri hajat muharrarin ka atiya hai, kyunke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha hai ke jab bhi Aap ke paas koi cheez aati thi to Aap un se pehle kisi aur se ibteda na farmate."
